window.STUDY_DATA.questions = (window.STUDY_DATA.questions || []).concat([{"id":"e01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The word “configure” is closest in meaning to ______.","options":["delete","set up","borrow","break"],"answer":"set up","pitfalls":["IT词汇：set up同义"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】set up 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The word “configure” is closest in meaning to ____。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭","analysis":"【审题】题干问 configure 的最接近词义，属词义辨析题。configure 是 IT 常用词，意为“配置、设置（系统/软件/设备）”。四个选项都是动词原形，只需比词义。\n【语法点/词汇】configure = set up（设置、安装、配置）；delete 删除；borrow 借入；break 打破、损坏。同义替换：configure ↔ set up / adjust settings。\n【步骤】① 先回忆 configure 的核心义：把参数、选项设好，使系统可用。② 逐一代入：A delete（删除）——意思相反/无关，错。③ B set up（建立、设置）——与“配置”同义，对。④ C borrow（借）——完全不相关，错。⑤ D break（打破）——无关，错。⑥ 验证：configure a computer = set up a computer，成立。\n【答案】B. set up。\n【易错】易被中文“配置”字面带偏，误选与“删除/清空”相关的 delete；也不要把 configure 和 confirm（确认）混淆。\n【口诀/模板句】configure 就是 set up，配置等于设置；词义题先定核心义，再排除不沾边选项。","steps":["【秒懂考点】词义辨析：configure = 设置、配置","【第一步：题干】configure最接近哪个意思？","【第二步】configure（配置）就是set up（设置、安装）","【第三步】delete删除、borrow借、break弄坏，都不对","【答案】选set up"]},{"id":"e02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"Please fill ______ the form before submission.","options":["in","on","at","for"],"answer":"in","pitfalls":["fill in固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】in 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please fill ______ the form before submission.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please fill ______ the form before submission.（提交前请填表。）空格在 fill 与 the form 之间，考固定搭配的介词/副词。\n【语法点/词汇】fill in / fill out 均可表示“填写表格”；fill in 强调填入空白处，英式更常用；fill out 强调填完整张表。fill on、fill at、fill for 均不与 form 构成“填表”义。fill for 可表示“代替”，fill up 是“装满”。\n【步骤】① 识别搭配：fill + 宾语（form）需要介词/副词构成短语。② 填表固定说 fill in the form 或 fill out the form。③ 选项中只有 in 是正确的介词。④ A. in ✓。⑤ B. on——fill on 不表示填表，错。⑥ C. at——fill at 无此搭配，错。⑦ D. for——fill for = 代替某人，与表格无关，错。\n【答案】A. in。\n【易错】把 fill in 和 fill in for（代替）混淆；或误以为“在表格上填”就用 on，其实 on the form 作地点状语时才对（write on the form），fill 必须配 in/out。\n【口诀/模板句】fill in / fill out the form = 填表；fill up 装满，fill for 代班，fill in 填空。","steps":["【秒懂考点】固定搭配：fill in = 填写","【第一步：题干】提交前请填写表格","【第二步】fill in是固定短语，in表示填入","【第三步】fill on/at/for都不搭配","【答案】选in"]},{"id":"e04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"She ______ in this company for five years since she graduated.","options":["worked","has worked","had worked","works"],"answer":"has worked","pitfalls":["for+时间段完成时"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】has worked 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She ______ in this company for five years since sh。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ in this company for five years since she graduated. 出现 for five years（持续时间段）和 since she graduated（自从毕业），时间标志指向“从过去延续到现在”。\n【语法点/词汇】现在完成时：have/has + 过去分词，表示动作从过去开始持续到现在，或对现在有影响。for + 时间段，since + 过去时间点/从句，是现在完成时的经典标志。第三人称单数用 has。\n【步骤】① 圈时间标志：for five years + since… → 现在完成时。② 结构：has worked（she 是三单）。③ A. worked 一般过去时——只表示过去，不体现“到现在五年”，错。④ B. has worked ✓。⑤ C. had worked 过去完成时——需要“过去的过去”，本句无参照过去点，错。⑥ D. works 一般现在时——不能与 for five years 连用表持续，错。⑦ 回译：她毕业以来已在这家公司工作五年。\n【答案】B. has worked。\n【易错】看到 since 就想过去时；或三单忘了 has 用 have；或把 had worked 当“更完成”误选。\n【口诀/模板句】for since 配完成，have/has + 过去分；三单 has 其余 have，过去完成要“过去的过去”。","steps":["【秒懂考点】现在完成时：for+时间段，持续到现在","【第一步：题干】她毕业以来在这家公司工作了五年","【第二步】for five years + since，持续到现在，用现在完成时","【第三步】has worked（have/has+过去分词）","【第四步】worked过去式、had worked过去完成、works现在时，都不符合","【答案】选has worked"]},{"id":"e06","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"The project ______ by our team next month.","options":["will complete","will be completed","is completed","has completed"],"answer":"will be completed","pitfalls":["被动结构"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】will be completed 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The project ______ by our team next month.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语","analysis":"【审题】题干：The project ______ by our team next month. 有 by our team（被我们团队）和 next month（下月），说明是将来时的被动语态。\n【语法点/词汇】一般将来时被动：will be + 过去分词。by + 施动者是被动标志；next month 是将来时间标志。complete 完成，及物动词，project 是“被完成”的对象。\n【步骤】① 看时间 next month → 将来时（will）。② 看 by our team → 被动（be + done）。③ 合并：will be completed。④ A. will complete——主动“将完成”，项目不能自己完成自己，错。⑤ B. will be completed ✓。⑥ C. is completed——一般现在时被动，与 next month 不符，错。⑦ D. has completed——现在完成主动，错。\n【答案】B. will be completed。\n【易错】只看 by 就写 be done，忘了 will；或把 complete 当不及物；或误选 will complete，忽略主语是动作承受者。\n【口诀/模板句】by + 施动者是被动，next + 时间用 will；将来被动 will be done，主语承受记心上。","steps":["【秒懂考点】被动语态：项目被完成","【第一步：题干】项目将在下个月被我们团队完成","【第二步】project和complete是被动关系，将来时被动","【第三步】will be completed（will be+过去分词）","【第四步】will complete主动、is completed现在被动、has completed主动","【答案】选will be completed"]},{"id":"e09","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"The device ______ we tested yesterday is used for mobile development.","options":["who","which","where","what"],"answer":"which","pitfalls":["物which"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】which 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The device ______ we tested yesterday is used for 。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确","analysis":"【审题】题干：The device ______ we tested yesterday is used for mobile development. 空格引导定语从句，先行词是 the device（物），从句 we tested yesterday 缺宾语。\n【语法点/词汇】定语从句关系词：who/whom/that/which 代人/物，where 表地点（从句不缺主宾），what 不能引导定语从句。物作先行词且作宾语 → which/that。本题选项只有 which。\n【步骤】① 找先行词：the device（物）。② 分析从句成分：we tested yesterday——tested 缺宾语（tested what? the device）。③ 物 + 作宾语 → which（或 that）。④ A. who——只能指人，错。⑤ B. which ✓。⑥ C. where——表地点状语，从句不能缺主宾时才用，此处缺宾语，错。⑦ D. what——不引导定语从句，错。\n【答案】B. which。\n【易错】device 是设备但被当成“地点”用 where；或不知 what 不能做定语从句关系词；缺宾语却选了作状语的 where。\n【口诀/模板句】人 who 物 which，缺宾 which/that 补；where 只管地点状，what 不进定语从。","steps":["【秒懂考点】定语从句：which指代物","【第一步：题干】我们昨天测试的设备用于移动开发","【第二步】先行词device是物，在从句中作宾语，用which","【第三步】who指人，where指地点，what不引导定语从句","【答案】选which"]},{"id":"e10","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"I don't know ______ he will come tomorrow.","options":["that","what","whether","which"],"answer":"whether","pitfalls":["是否whether"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】whether 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I don't know ______ he will come tomorrow.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 wh","analysis":"【审题】题干：I don't know ______ he will come tomorrow. know 后为宾语从句，句意是“我不知道他明天是否来”，空格需表达“是否”。\n【语法点/词汇】宾语从句连接词：that（陈述，无义）、whether/if（是否）、what/which 等（疑问意义）。whether 与 if 表“是否”；陈述句用 that；疑问词保留疑问义。否定主句 I don't know 后常见 whether 引导不确定内容。\n【步骤】① 判断从句类型：know 后宾语从句。② 从句 he will come tomorrow 是完整陈述（不缺成分），但语义是“来不来”= 是否。③ 需“是否”→ whether。④ A. that——引导肯定事实，不表“是否”，与 don't know 的不确定矛盾，错。⑤ B. what——从句不缺宾语/表语，what 无处安放，错。⑥ C. whether ✓。⑤ D. which——表“哪一个”，句中无选择范围，错。\n【答案】C. whether。\n【易错】看到完整句就选 that；或把 whether 与 which 混淆；否定句后不知道要用“是否”。\n【口诀/模板句】know 后接宾从，陈述 that“是否”whether；成分完整语义悬，whether/if 填中间。","steps":["【秒懂考点】宾语从句：whether表示是否","【第一步：题干】我不知道他明天是否会来","【第二步】\"是否\"用whether或if","【第三步】that无意义，what什么，which哪个","【答案】选whether"]},{"id":"e11","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"______ he is young, he knows a lot about networks.","options":["Because","Although","So","Unless"],"answer":"Although","pitfalls":["转折"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】Although 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：______ he is young, he knows a lot about networks.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④","analysis":"【审题】题干：______ he is young, he knows a lot about networks. 前半句“他年轻”，后半句“他懂很多网络知识”，语义转折。\n【语法点/词汇】让步状语从句：Although/Though（虽然），不能与 but 连用。Because 因为（因果）；So 所以（结果）；Unless 除非（条件）。转折让步用 Although。\n【步骤】① 读两句关系：年轻 ↔ 懂很多，相反/让步。② 让步连接词 Although/Though。③ A. Because——“因为年轻所以懂很多”，因果反了，错。④ B. Although ✓。⑤ C. So——“所以”放句首表结果，逻辑不通，错。⑥ D. Unless——“除非他年轻”，语义荒谬，错。⑦ 验证：Although he is young, he knows a lot. 虽年轻却博学。\n【答案】B. Although。\n【易错】选 Because 把转折当因果；或写 Although…but（双重连词错误）；或用 Unless 误判为条件。\n【口诀/模板句】前弱后强是让步，Although/Though 打头住；有了 Although 不用 but，因为 Because 才对路。","steps":["【秒懂考点】让步状语从句：although虽然","【第一步：题干】虽然他年轻，但他对网络了解很多","【第二步】young和knows a lot是转折，用although","【第三步】because因为、so所以、unless除非","【答案】选Although"]},{"id":"e13","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"Could you tell me ______?","options":["where does he live","where he lives","where he does live","he lives where"],"answer":"where he lives","pitfalls":["陈述语序"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】where he lives 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Could you tell me ______?。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 where he liv","analysis":"【审题】题干：Could you tell me ______? tell me 后为宾语从句，选项涉及语序。间接疑问句要用陈述语序（主语在前，谓语在后）。\n【语法点/词汇】宾语从句三要素：连接词 + 陈述语序 + 时态呼应。where does he live 是疑问语序（助动词 does 提前），错误；where he lives 是陈述语序，正确。\n【步骤】① 主句 Could you tell me 是请求，后接宾语从句。② 从句要用陈述语序：where + 主语 + 谓语。③ A. where does he live——疑问语序（does 提前），错。④ B. where he lives ✓（he 主语在前，lives 谓语在后）。⑤ C. where he does live——do/does 强调语不用在此处且语序别扭，错。⑥ D. he lives where——where 位置错，疑问词必须在从句句首，错。\n【答案】B. where he lives。\n【易错】直接把疑问句语序搬进宾语从句；看到 tell me 就写成问句；忽略 where 要置前。\n【口诀/模板句】宾从语序要陈述，疑问词后主谓顺；tell me where he lives，别把 does 往前拎。","steps":["【秒懂考点】宾语从句用陈述语序","【第一步：题干】你能告诉我他住在哪里吗？","【第二步】宾语从句必须用陈述语序：where he lives","【第三步】where does he live是疑问语序，错误","【答案】选where he lives"]},{"id":"e18","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The software must be ______ regularly to keep it safe.","options":["updated","updated to","up to date","update"],"answer":"updated","pitfalls":["must be done"],"difficulty":1,"source":"mock","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】updated 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The software must be ______ regularly to keep it s。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/","analysis":"【审题】题干：The software must be ______ regularly to keep it safe. 有 must be（情态动词被动），空格需要过去分词作谓语的一部分。\n【语法点/词汇】情态动词被动：must be + 过去分词。update 更新（及物），be updated 被更新。regularly 频率副词修饰动词。to keep it safe 是目的状语。\n【步骤】① 看谓语框架：must be ______，缺的是 done（过去分词）。② update → updated。③ A. updated ✓（must be updated 被更新）。④ B. updated to——to 后缺宾语，结构多余，错。⑤ C. up to date 是形容词短语“最新的”，不能直接跟在 be 后表被动动作，且缺动词义，错。⑥ D. update——原形，must be 后不能接原形（那会变成 must do），错。\n【答案】A. updated。\n【易错】选 up to date（意思沾边但词性/结构不对）；或写 must be update 忘了变分词；或加 updated to 把及物用成不及物。\n【口诀/模板句】must be + 过去分，被动结构记在心；be updated 才是“被更新”，up to date 是形容。","steps":["【秒懂考点】被动语态：软件被更新","【第一步：题干】软件必须定期更新以保持安全","【第二步】software和update是被动，must be updated","【第三步】up to date是形容词\"最新的\"，不能直接用","【答案】选updated"]},{"id":"e19","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"阅读理解中，题干问 “What is the passage mainly about?” 时应优先看（　）","options":["第一段最后一句与各段首句","文章中出现次数最少的词","最后一段所有细节","作者心情描写"],"answer":"第一段最后一句与各段首句","pitfalls":["阅读技巧"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】第一段最后一句与各段首句 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：阅读理解中，题干问 “What is the passage mainly about?” 时应优先。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/","analysis":"【审题】题干问：阅读理解中 “What is the passage mainly about?” 应优先看什么。这是主旨题（main idea）策略题，不考语言点，考方法。\n【语法点/词汇】主旨题技巧：读首段（尤其末句）+ 各段首句（topic sentences）+ 末段总结句，拼出全文中心。细节、生词、情绪都不是主旨来源。\n【步骤】① 识别题型：mainly about = 主旨题。② 主旨位置：开篇引出、各段首句展开、结尾总结。③ A. 第一段最后一句与各段首句 ✓，覆盖中心线索。④ B. 出现次数最少的词——无关，错。⑤ C. 最后一段所有细节——细节不是主旨，错。⑥ D. 作者心情描写——态度题才看，且不是“主要关于”，错。⑦ 方法：先串首尾句，再概括，最后对选项找“能覆盖全文”的那项。\n【答案】A. 第一段最后一句与各段首句。\n【易错】把“最后一段”当万能主旨；或见关键词多就选；主旨必须概括全文而非某段细节。\n【口诀/模板句】主旨看首尾与段首，细节例证不能留；题目问 mainly about，全文中心一句话。","steps":["【秒懂考点】主旨题：看首段末句和各段首句","【第一步】mainly about问主旨","【第二步】主题句通常在首段末句或各段首句","【答案】第一段最后一句与各段首句"]},{"id":"e24","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","stem":"It took him two hours ______ the report.","options":["finish","to finish","finishing","finished"],"answer":"to finish","pitfalls":["不定式"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["非谓语动词","ch-en-4"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to finish 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：It took him two hours ______ the report.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确","analysis":"【审题】题干：It took him two hours ______ the report. 句型 It takes/took sb. + 时间 + to do sth.，空格应为不定式作真正主语。\n【语法点/词汇】It takes sb. some time to do sth.（花费某人多少时间做某事）。It 是形式主语，to do 是真正主语。finish 完成，report 报告。\n【步骤】① 认句型：It took him two hours to do…（过去式 took）。② 固定结构：to + 动词原形。③ A. finish——缺 to，语法不成立，错。④ B. to finish ✓。⑤ C. finishing——动名词不能用于 It took…to do 句型，错。⑥ D. finished——过去分词不能作真正主语，错。⑦ 回译：他花了两个小时完成这份报告。\n【答案】B. to finish。\n【易错】与 It is no use doing / spend time doing 混淆；或看到 took 就用 doing；忘记 to 后用原形（finish 而非 finishes）。\n【口诀/模板句】It takes sb. time to do，形式主语 to 置后；spend 用 doing，take 用 to do，句型一换词形变。","steps":["【秒懂考点】It takes sb time to do，固定","【第一步】took him two hours to finish，不定式","【答案】选to finish"]},{"id":"e25","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"He is responsible ______ the network maintenance.","options":["to","for","with","about"],"answer":"for","pitfalls":["for固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】for 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is responsible ______ the network maintenance.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is responsible ______ the network maintenance. 考形容词 responsible 的介词搭配。\n【语法点/词汇】be responsible for sth.（对……负责）；be responsible to sb.（向某人负责）。题干后是物（network maintenance 网络维护），用 for。with/about 不与 responsible 构成此义。\n【步骤】① 形容词短语：responsible + 介词。② 负责某事 = responsible for。③ A. to——responsible to 是“向（上级）负责”，后接人，此处是事，错。④ B. for ✓。⑤ C. with——无此搭配，错。⑥ D. about——无此搭配，错。\n【答案】B. for。\n【易错】把 responsible to（向谁负责）和 responsible for（对什么事负责）混用；或按中文“对”想当然选 to。\n【口诀/模板句】负责事情用 for，对人负责用 to；be responsible for the work，be responsible to the boss。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be responsible for，对……负责","【第一步】for负责网络维护","【答案】选for"]},{"id":"e26","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The two plans are quite ______ from each other.","options":["same","different","similar","like"],"answer":"different","pitfalls":["from搭配"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】different 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The two plans are quite ______ from each other.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭","analysis":"【审题】题干：The two plans are quite ______ from each other. 有 from each other，需与 from 搭配的形容词。\n【语法点/词汇】be different from（与……不同）；be the same as（与……相同）；be similar to（与……相似）。like 作介词“像”，不与 from each other 搭。\n【步骤】① 信号词 from each other → different from。② A. same——要说 the same as，且 the two plans 不同还是相同取决于搭配；same 不与 from 连用，错。③ B. different ✓（quite different from each other 彼此很不同）。④ C. similar——应配 to，不是 from，错。⑤ D. like——不能 be like from each other，结构冲突，错。\n【答案】B. different。\n【易错】similar from、same from 是典型错误搭配；记住 from 只跟 different 系。\n【口诀/模板句】different from 记心间，same as similar to 不要换；见到 from each other，答案首选 different。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be different from，与……不同","【第一步】两计划彼此不同","【第二步】same相同，similar相似，like像","【答案】选different"]},{"id":"e27","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"He is interested ______ computer networks.","options":["at","in","on","for"],"answer":"in","pitfalls":["in固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】in 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is interested ______ computer networks.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 i","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is interested ______ computer networks. 考 be interested 的介词。\n【语法点/词汇】be interested in sth./doing sth.（对……感兴趣）。interest 的形容词 interested 固定配 in。at/on/for 均不搭配。\n【步骤】① 固定短语：be interested in。② 代入：interested in computer networks（对计算机网络感兴趣）。③ A. at——无，错。④ B. in ✓。⑤ C. on——无，错。⑥ D. for——无，错。⑦ 注意 interested 后可接 in doing，不可接 to do 表兴趣（to do 多表“有兴趣去做”）。\n【答案】B. in。\n【易错】与 be good at / be keen on 混淆；或写 be interested on/for；把 interesting（令人感兴趣的）主语物、interested 主语人搞反。\n【口诀/模板句】人 interested 用 in，物 interesting 才是“趣”；be interested in doing，介词就是 in 别移。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be interested in，对……感兴趣","【第一步】in表示在某方面","【答案】选in"]},{"id":"e28","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"Please pay attention ______ the spelling.","options":["to","for","on","in"],"answer":"to","pitfalls":["to固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please pay attention ______ the spelling.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please pay attention ______ the spelling. 考 pay attention 的介词搭配。\n【语法点/词汇】pay attention to sth./doing sth.（注意……）。to 在此为介词，后接名词/动名词。spelling 拼写。\n【步骤】① 固定搭配：pay attention to。② 代入：pay attention to the spelling（注意拼写）。③ A. to ✓。④ B. for——无此搭配，错。⑤ C. on——无，错。⑥ D. in——无，错。⑦ 拓展：pay no attention to、draw attention to。\n【答案】A. to。\n【易错】把 to 当不定式想接原形；或写 pay attention on（受中文“在拼写上注意”影响）。\n【口诀/模板句】pay attention to，to 是介词别小瞧；注意某事 to sth.，接 doing 也合法。","steps":["【秒懂考点】pay attention to，注意，to是介词","【第一步】注意拼写","【答案】选to"]},{"id":"e29","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"We should depend ______ ourselves.","options":["on","in","to","of"],"answer":"on","pitfalls":["on固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】on 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：We should depend ______ ourselves.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 on。 【其他选项","analysis":"【审题】题干：We should depend ______ ourselves. 考 depend 的介词。\n【语法点/词汇】depend on/upon sb./sth.（依靠、依赖、取决于）。on 与 upon 可互换，选项用 on。depend 通常不与 in/to/of 连用表此义。\n【步骤】① 固定短语：depend on。② 代入：depend on ourselves（依靠我们自己）。③ A. on ✓。④ B. in——错。⑤ C. to——错。⑥ D. of——错。⑦ 拓展：It depends.（视情况而定）；depend on it that…。\n【答案】A. on。\n【易错】与 rely on 混用介词；或按中文“依赖于”选 to/of。\n【口诀/模板句】depend on / upon 记牢，依靠取决于它包；rely on 同义也 on，of in to 都不要。","steps":["【秒懂考点】depend on，依靠","【第一步】我们应该依靠自己","【答案】选on"]},{"id":"e30","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The word “reliable” means ______.","options":["可以依赖的","昂贵的","临时的","复杂的"],"answer":"可以依赖的","pitfalls":["构词法"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】可以依赖的 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The word “reliable” means ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 可以依赖的。 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：The word “reliable” means ______. 词义题，问 reliable 的意思。\n【语法点/词汇】reliable = able to be relied on，可依赖的、可靠的。构词：rely（依靠）+ -able（能……的）。词根记忆：re- + ly→rely + able。\n【步骤】① 拆词：rely（依赖）+ -able（可……的）。② reliable = 可以依赖的、可靠的。③ A. 可以依赖的 ✓。④ B. 昂贵的（expensive）——无关，错。⑤ C. 临时的（temporary）——无关，错。⑥ D. 复杂的（complex）——无关，错。\n【答案】A. 可以依赖的。\n【易错】把 reliable 和 related/relation 混淆；或凭字面“re-”猜“反复”而错译。\n【口诀/模板句】-able 是“可、能”，rely 依赖 reliable 稳；词根词缀一拼，词义自然分。","steps":["【秒懂考点】reliable = 可靠的，可以依赖的","【第一步】rely动词依赖，-able形容词后缀，可……的","【答案】选可以依赖的"]},{"id":"e33","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"She is proud ______ her daughter.","options":["for","of","in","on"],"answer":"of","pitfalls":["of固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】of 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She is proud ______ her daughter.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 of。 【其他选项为","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is proud ______ her daughter. 考 proud 的介词搭配。\n【语法点/词汇】be proud of（为……自豪）。proud 是形容词，固定 of。pride 是名词，take pride in。\n【步骤】① 固定搭配：be proud of。② 代入：proud of her daughter（为女儿自豪）。③ A. for——错。④ B. of ✓。⑤ C. in——错（take pride in 才用 in）。⑥ D. on——错。\n【答案】B. of。\n【易错】把 be proud of 与 take pride in 的介词互换；或受“为”影响选 for。\n【口诀/模板句】be proud of 记周全，take pride in 换名又换介词；proud 形容 of，pride 名词 in 才是理。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be proud of，为……自豪","【第一步】of为女儿骄傲","【答案】选of"]},{"id":"e35","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"Water ______ at 100°C.","options":["boils","is boiled","boiled","has boiled"],"answer":"boils","pitfalls":["客观真理"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】boils 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Water ______ at 100°C.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 boils。 【其他选项为何不对】 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：Water ______ at 100°C. 表客观真理/科学事实，不受主句时态影响，用一般现在时。\n【语法点/词汇】一般现在时表客观真理、科学事实、习惯。boil 沸腾，三单 boils。at 100°C 是温度条件。\n【步骤】① 判断语义：水在100度沸腾是客观事实。② 客观真理 → 一般现在时。③ 主语 Water 不可数，视为三单 → boils。④ A. boils ✓。⑤ B. is boiled——被动“被煮沸”，句意变成“水被（谁）煮沸”，不是事实陈述，错。⑥ C. boiled——过去时，事实不只在过去，错。⑦ D. has boiled——完成时无持续/影响语境，错。\n【答案】A. boils。\n【易错】主句是过去时就跟着用过去（宾语从句中真理仍用现在时）；或误选被动。\n【口诀/模板句】真理事实用现在，三单加 s 别乱来；Water boils at 100，时态跟着语义派。","steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理用一般现在时，主动","【第一步】水在100度沸腾，自然规律","【第二步】boils，不用被动","【答案】选boils"]},{"id":"e36","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"This book ______ by Lu Xun.","options":["wrote","was written","is writing","writes"],"answer":"was written","pitfalls":["被动"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】was written 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：This book ______ by Lu Xun.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 was wri","analysis":"【审题】题干：This book ______ by Lu Xun. 有 by + 人（鲁迅），说明被动；书写成于过去，用一般过去时被动。\n【语法点/词汇】一般过去时被动：was/were + 过去分词。write → written（不规则）。by Lu Xun 是施动者。book 是“被写”的对象。\n【步骤】① by Lu Xun → 被动。② 写书是过去动作 → was written。③ A. wrote——主动“鲁迅写”，但主语是 book，错。④ B. was written ✓。⑤ C. is writing——现在进行主动，错。⑥ D. writes——主动一般现在，错。\n【答案】B. was written。\n【易错】写成 was wrote（write 过去分词是 written 不是 wrote）；或选 was writing。\n【口诀/模板句】by 后是作者，主语是书用被动；was written 记不规则，write wrote written 别忘掉。","steps":["【秒懂考点】被动语态：书被鲁迅写","【第一步】过去时被动，was written","【第二步】wrote主动，is writing现在进行主动","【答案】选was written"]},{"id":"e37","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"Look! The children ______ football.","options":["play","played","are playing","have played"],"answer":"are playing","pitfalls":["look标志"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are playing 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Look! The children ______ football.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是","analysis":"【审题】题干：Look! The children ______ football. Look! 是现在进行时的标志词，表示说话时正在发生。\n【语法点/词汇】现在进行时：am/is/are + doing。Look!/Listen!/now/at the moment 是标志。children 是复数，用 are playing。\n【步骤】① 标志词 Look! → 现在进行时。② 主语 children 复数 → are + playing。③ A. play——一般现在表习惯，与 Look! 冲突，错。④ B. played——过去，错。⑤ C. are playing ✓。⑥ D. have played——完成时强调结果/持续，不强调“此刻正在踢”，错。\n【答案】C. are playing。\n【易错】children 不规则复数误当三单用 is playing；或忽略 Look! 用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】Look Listen 要用 be doing，说话当下正进行；children 复数用 are，playing 现在分词别忘 ing。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Look! 现在进行时","【第一步】孩子们正在踢足球，are playing","【答案】选are playing"]},{"id":"e41","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"I know the man ______ is standing there.","options":["who","which","where","what"],"answer":"who","pitfalls":["人who"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】who 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I know the man ______ is standing there.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 who。 【其他","analysis":"【审题】题干：I know the man ______ is standing there. 定语从句，先行词 the man（人），从句 is standing there 缺主语。\n【语法点/词汇】关系代词 who/that 指人并作主语；which 指物；where 作地点状语；what 不引导定语从句。\n【步骤】① 先行词 the man（人）。② 从句 ______ is standing there——缺主语。③ 人 + 主语 → who（或 that）。④ A. who ✓。⑤ B. which——指物，错。⑥ C. where——地点状语，错。⑦ D. what——不能引导定语从句，错。\n【答案】A. who。\n【易错】人、物关系词混用；或用 whom（宾格，不能作主语）；what 误入定语从句。\n【口诀/模板句】人主 who 人宾 whom，物主物宾 which；where 只管地点状，what 不把定从帮。","steps":["【秒懂考点】定语从句：who指人，作主语","【第一步】man是人，在从句中作主语","【第二步】which指物，where地点，what不引导","【答案】选who"]},{"id":"e42","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"This is the school ______ I studied.","options":["which","where","that","what"],"answer":"where","pitfalls":["where地点"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】where 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：This is the school ______ I studied.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 where。 【其他","analysis":"【审题】题干：This is the school ______ I studied. 先行词 the school（地点），从句 I studied 主谓完整（study 可不及物），缺地点状语。\n【语法点/词汇】关系副词 where = in/at which，引导定语从句作地点状语。若从句缺主宾则用 which/that；本句 studied 不缺宾语，缺“在哪里学习”。\n【步骤】① 先行词 school（地点）。② 从句 I studied——主谓已全，缺地点状语。③ 地点状语 → where。④ A. which——若用 which 应为 at/in which 且作宾语时才直接 which，此处缺状语，直接 which 不妥，错。⑤ B. where ✓。⑥ C. that——代主宾，不作状语，错。⑦ D. what——不引导定语从句，错。\n【答案】B. where。\n【易错】见 school 是“地方”却用 which/that；或以为 studied 必须有宾语而强填 which。区分：I studied (in) the school → where；I visited the school → which/that。\n【口诀/模板句】从句完整缺状语，地点 where 时间 when；缺宾 which/that 来补，成分分析是正路。","steps":["【秒懂考点】where引导定语从句，在从句中作地点状语","【第一步】study in the school，需要介词in，where=in which","【第二步】which作主语宾语，这里不缺主语","【答案】选where"]},{"id":"e43","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"He asked me ______ I had finished it.","options":["that","what","if","which"],"answer":"if","pitfalls":["是否"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】if 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He asked me ______ I had finished it.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 if。 【其他选项为何不","analysis":"【审题】题干：He asked me ______ I had finished it. asked 后宾语从句，句意“他问我是否完成了它”。\n【语法点/词汇】ask 后常接 if/whether 引导“是否”；that 引导陈述内容；what/which 需有疑问意义。\n【步骤】① 主句 He asked me，后接从句。② 从句 I had finished it 成分完整，但语义是“完成了没有”。③ “是否”→ if/whether。④ A. that——只陈述事实，不表“是否”，错。⑤ B. what——从句不缺宾语（it 已是宾语），错。⑥ C. if ✓。⑦ D. which——无选择项，错。\n【答案】C. if。\n【易错】ask that（错，ask 一般不直接接 that 表“问是否”）；或选 which。注意：if 作“是否”时不可放句首，whether 则可以。\n【口诀/模板句】ask 后表“是否”用 if，宾从完整语义悬；that 陈述 what 疑，是否二字 if 填。","steps":["【秒懂考点】宾语从句：if表示是否","【第一步】他问我是否完成了，if=whether","【第二步】that无意义，what什么，which哪个","【答案】选if"]},{"id":"e44","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"______ he comes, I will tell him.","options":["If","Unless","Though","Because"],"answer":"If","pitfalls":["条件"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】If 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：______ he comes, I will tell him.。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 If。 【其他选项为何不对】 •","analysis":"【审题】题干：______ he comes, I will tell him. 前句条件，后句结果（主将从现）。\n【语法点/词汇】条件状语从句：If（如果）引导，主句将来时，从句一般现在时。Unless = if not（除非）；Though 虽然；Because 因为。\n【步骤】① 后句 I will tell him 是将来结果。② 前句应是条件“如果他来”。③ A. If ✓。④ B. Unless——“除非他来，否则我告诉他”，逻辑不通（应是“否则不告诉”），错。⑤ C. Though——让步“虽然他来”，与 will tell 逻辑不搭，错。⑥ D. Because——“因为他来所以我告诉他”，因果牵强且主将从现不对，错。\n【答案】A. If。\n【易错】Unless 与 if 混；或从句写成 will come（主将从现违背）。\n【口诀/模板句】主将从现记分明：if 引导从句用一般；Unless 等于 if not，逻辑方向要看清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】条件状语从句：if如果","【第一步】如果他来，我会告诉他","【第二步】unless除非，though虽然，because因为","【答案】选If"]},{"id":"e48","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","stem":"I enjoy ______ English.","options":["read","to read","reading","readed"],"answer":"reading","pitfalls":["enjoy doing"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["非谓语动词","ch-en-4"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】reading 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I enjoy ______ English.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 reading。 【其他选项为","analysis":"【审题】题干：I enjoy ______ English. 考 enjoy 后的非谓语形式。\n【语法点/词汇】enjoy + doing（动名词）。只接 doing 的动词：enjoy, finish, mind, practice, suggest, avoid, give up, look forward to 等。\n【步骤】① enjoy 后必须 doing。② reading ✓。③ A. read——原形，错。④ B. to read——不定式，enjoy 不接 to do，错。⑤ C. reading ✓。⑥ D. readed——形式错误（过去分词是 read），错。\n【答案】C. reading。\n【易错】与 want/decide to do 混；或写 enjoy to read。\n【口诀/模板句】enjoy finish mind practice，只跟 doing 不跟 to；背下这批动词表，非谓语题不摔倒。","steps":["【秒懂考点】enjoy doing，动名词","【第一步】enjoy后面加动名词，enjoy reading","【第二步】不能加不定式","【答案】选reading"]},{"id":"e49","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","stem":"It is important ______ hard.","options":["study","to study","studying","studied"],"answer":"to study","pitfalls":["不定式主语"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["非谓语动词","ch-en-4"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to study 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：It is important ______ hard.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to study。","analysis":"【审题】题干：It is important ______ hard. It 作形式主语，真正主语在后，用不定式。\n【语法点/词汇】It is + adj. + to do sth.（做某事是……的）。常见：It is important/necessary/difficult to do。也可 It is no use doing。\n【步骤】① 句型 It is important to do。② to study hard（努力学习很重要）。③ A. study——缺 to，错。④ B. to study ✓。⑤ C. studying——本句型标准形式是 to do；若用 doing 需变为 Studying hard is important，语法不同，本空在 It is important 后应用 to do，错。⑥ D. studied——错。\n【答案】B. to study。\n【易错】与 It is no use/good doing 混；或形式主语后填动名词。\n【口诀/模板句】It is adj. to do 好，形式主语 to 置后；no use 才用 doing，两条句型分开记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】It is important to do，不定式","【第一步】it是形式主语，真正主语是to study hard","【答案】选to study"]},{"id":"e50","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","stem":"I have a lot of work ______.","options":["do","to do","doing","done"],"answer":"to do","pitfalls":["不定式"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["非谓语动词","ch-en-4"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to do 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I have a lot of work ______.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to do。 【其他选项","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of work ______. have + 名词 + to do，不定式作 work 的后置定语（或 have sth. to do 句型）。\n【语法点/词汇】have + 宾语 + to do（有……要做）。work 与 do 是动宾关系（do the work），主动形式表被动含义，用 to do。\n【步骤】① I have a lot of work…结构：have sth. to do。② to do 修饰 work，意为“许多要做的工作”。③ A. do——缺 to，错。④ B. to do ✓。⑤ C. doing——I have work doing 不表示“有工作要做”，错。⑥ D. done——have work done 是“让别人做工作”，句意不通，错。\n【答案】B. to do。\n【易错】与 have sth. done（请人做/被做）混淆；或用 doing。\n【口诀/模板句】have sth. to do 有事做，have sth. done 找人做；to do 主动被动义，done 才是过去分词搁。","steps":["【秒懂考点】不定式作定语：work to do","【第一步】a lot of work to do，要做的工作","【第二步】to do修饰work，将来要做","【答案】选to do"]},{"id":"e55","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"细节题最有效的定位方法是（　）","options":["通读全文背诵","找题干关键词回原文定位","只看首段","猜作者情绪"],"answer":"找题干关键词回原文定位","pitfalls":["阅读技巧"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】找题干关键词回原文定位 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：细节题最有效的定位方法是（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 找题干关键词回原文定位。 【其他选项为何不","analysis":"【审题】题干：细节题最有效的定位方法是（　）。阅读策略题，考细节题（detail question）的解题步骤。\n【语法点/词汇】细节题解法：圈题干关键词（人名、数字、专有名词、核心名词）→ 回原文定位 → 对照选项同义替换。不靠通读背诵或猜情绪。\n【步骤】① 细节题特征：According to…, Which of the following is true 等。② 高效路径：关键词定位法。③ A. 通读全文背诵——费时且抓不住点，错。④ B. 找题干关键词回原文定位 ✓。⑤ C. 只看首段——细节可在任意段，错。⑥ D. 猜作者情绪——态度题技巧，错。\n【答案】B. 找题干关键词回原文定位。\n【易错】先看选项再乱找；或用主旨题方法做细节题；忽略同义替换导致定位后仍选错。\n【口诀/模板句】细节题，关键词，回文定位看原句；同义替换是答案，照抄原文要警惕。","steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题：关键词定位","【第一步】题干关键词回原文找","【答案】找题干关键词回原文定位"]},{"id":"e56","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"词义猜测题优先看（　）","options":["上下文与转折词","字典","题干","选项长度"],"answer":"上下文与转折词","pitfalls":["上下文"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】上下文与转折词 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：词义猜测题优先看（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 上下文与转折词。 【其他选项为何不对】 • B「字典」：语","analysis":"【审题】题干：词义猜测题优先看（　）。阅读策略题，考词义猜测（word meaning / guessing）的方法。\n【语法点/词汇】词义猜测依据：上下文线索、转折词（but/however/yet）、同位语、举例、构词法。不能查字典（考试不允许），不能看选项长度或只看题干。\n【步骤】① 识别题型：The word “…” probably means…。② 核心方法：读前后句，抓转折/并列/解释。③ A. 上下文与转折词 ✓，如 but 后是反义。④ B. 字典——考场不现实，错。⑤ C. 题干——只告诉你要猜哪个词，不给线索，错。⑥ D. 选项长度——与词义无关，错。⑦ 补充：若前句说 X is useful, however Y is useless，则 Y 与 useful 相反。\n【答案】A. 上下文与转折词。\n【易错】凭生词本身瞎猜；只看生词所在半句不读前后；忽略 however/but/in other words 等信号。\n【口诀/模板句】词义猜测看上下文，转折同位是路标；in other words 同义找，but 前后常对抛。","steps":["【秒懂考点】词义猜测：看上下文","【第一步】通过上下文和转折词but/however推断","【答案】上下文与转折词"]},{"id":"e58","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"主旨题标题应能覆盖（　）","options":["首段","全文中心","末段细节","举例"],"answer":"全文中心","pitfalls":["覆盖全文"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】全文中心 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：主旨题标题应能覆盖（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 全文中心。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「首段」：语法结构与时","analysis":"【审题】题干：主旨题标题应能覆盖（　）。考主旨题/标题选择的标准。\n【语法点/词汇】好标题特征：概括全文中心（main idea），能覆盖各段主旨，不以偏概全。标题题（best title）比普通主旨更凝练。\n【步骤】① 标题 ≠ 某段细节，必须全文覆盖。② A. 首段——只是一部分，错。③ B. 全文中心 ✓。④ C. 末段细节——以偏概全，错。⑤ D. 举例——例子服务主题，不能当标题，错。⑥ 验证：读各段首句归纳一句中心，再看哪个选项最能统摄。\n【答案】B. 全文中心。\n【易错】标题过宽（全是什么都包）或过窄（只说某段）；被细节强的选项吸引。\n【口诀/模板句】标题要盖全文面，不大不小正中间；段落细节不能占，中心一句最关键。","steps":["【秒懂考点】主旨标题覆盖全文","【第一步】不能只覆盖某一段或细节","【答案】全文中心"]},{"id":"e65","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"I look forward to ______ from you soon.","options":["hear","hearing","be hearing","have heard"],"answer":"hearing","pitfalls":["to介词"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】hearing 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I look forward to ______ from you soon.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是","analysis":"【审题】题干：I look forward to ______ from you soon. look forward to 中的 to 是介词，后接动名词。\n【语法点/词汇】look forward to + doing（盼望做）。to 为介词，类似：be used to doing, pay attention to doing, object to doing, devote…to doing。\n【步骤】① 短语 look forward to，to 是介词。② 介词后用 doing → hearing from（收到……来信）。③ A. hear——原形，错。④ B. hearing ✓。⑤ C. be hearing——进行式多余，错。⑥ D. have heard——完成式不合搭配，错。⑦ 翻译：我盼望不久收到你的来信。\n【答案】B. hearing。\n【易错】把 to 当不定式想接 hear；与 expect/want to do 混淆。\n【口诀/模板句】look forward to doing，to 是介词要清醒；attention, used to, devote to，后头一律动名词。","steps":["【秒懂考点】look forward to doing，期待","【第一步】hearing，动名词","【答案】选hearing"]},{"id":"e66","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"He is not good ______ math.","options":["at","in","for","on"],"answer":"at","pitfalls":["at固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】at 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is not good ______ math.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 at。 【其他选项为何不对】 •","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is not good ______ math. 考 be good 的介词搭配。\n【语法点/词汇】be good at sth./doing（擅长）；be good for（对……有益）；be good to（对……好）。本题是“不擅长数学”，用 at。\n【步骤】① 语义“擅长/不擅长数学”→ be good at。② 否定 not good at 仍用 at。③ A. at ✓。④ B. in——无此搭配表擅长，错。⑤ C. for——be good for 是“对……有益”（如 Milk is good for health），错。⑥ D. on——无，错。\n【答案】A. at。\n【易错】good at / good for / good to 三者混；not 后换介词（不换）。\n【口诀/模板句】good at 擅长事，good for 有好处，good to 对人好；否定 not 介词不变，at math 记牢靠。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be good at，擅长","【第一步】at数学不擅长","【答案】选at"]},{"id":"e70","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"I ______ TV at eight last night.","options":["watch","watched","am watching","was watching"],"answer":"was watching","pitfalls":["具体时间点"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】was watching 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ TV at eight last night.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 w","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ TV at eight last night. at eight last night 是过去具体时间点，表示当时正在进行的动作。\n【语法点/词汇】过去进行时：was/were + doing，表过去某时刻正在做。与一般过去时（一次性完成）区分。\n【步骤】① 时间 at eight last night（昨晚八点）→ 过去某点。② 当时正在看电视 → was watching。③ A. watch——现在，错。④ B. watched——过去一般，只表“看过”，不强调八点那会儿正在看，欠佳。⑤ C. am watching——现在进行，错。⑥ D. was watching ✓。\n【答案】D. was watching。\n【易错】last night 就用一般过去；I 是单数却写 were watching。\n【口诀/模板句】过去某点正在做，was/were + doing；last night at eight，八点那阵正看着。","steps":["【秒懂考点】at eight last night，过去进行时","【第一步】昨晚8点正在看电视，was watching","【答案】选was watching"]},{"id":"e72","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"If it ______ tomorrow, we will stay at home.","options":["rains","will rain","rained","raining"],"answer":"rains","pitfalls":["主将从现"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】rains 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：If it ______ tomorrow, we will stay at home.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确","analysis":"【审题】题干：If it ______ tomorrow, we will stay at home. 条件状语从句，主句 will，从句用一般现在（主将从现）。\n【语法点/词汇】If 引导条件从句：主句将来时，从句一般现在时表将来。rain 下雨，it 是形式主语，动词用 rains。\n【步骤】① 主句 we will stay 是将来。② if 从句用一般现在表将来。③ 主语 it 三单 → rains。④ A. rains ✓。⑤ B. will rain——主将从现违背，错。⑥ C. rained——过去，错。⑦ D. raining——非谓语不能作谓语，错。\n【答案】A. rains。\n【易错】从句写 will rain；it rains 的三单 -s 漏掉。\n【口诀/模板句】主将从现 if 从，will 不进 if 中；it rains 三单加 s，明天的事现在说。","steps":["【秒懂考点】主将从现：if从句一般现在时","【第一步】明天下雨用rains，不能用will rain","【答案】选rains"]},{"id":"e73","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","stem":"The room ______ tomorrow.","options":["cleans","is cleaned","will be cleaned","will clean"],"answer":"will be cleaned","pitfalls":["被动"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态与语态","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】will be cleaned 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The room ______ tomorrow.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 will ","analysis":"【审题】题干：The room ______ tomorrow. tomorrow 表将来；房间是“被打扫”，用将来时被动。\n【语法点/词汇】一般将来时被动：will be + 过去分词。clean 打扫，room 是宾语提前做主语。\n【步骤】① tomorrow → will。② room 与 clean 是动宾关系 → 被动 be cleaned。③ 合成 will be cleaned。④ A. cleans——主动一般现在，错。⑤ B. is cleaned——现在被动，与 tomorrow 不符，错。⑥ C. will be cleaned ✓。⑦ D. will clean——主动，房间不能自己打扫自己，错。\n【答案】C. will be cleaned。\n【易错】只选 will clean 忽略被动；或 is cleaned 忘了将来。\n【口诀/模板句】tomorrow 将来 will，主语是物想被动；will be cleaned 打扫好，主动被动要分清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】将来时被动：房间被打扫","【第一步】will be cleaned，明天将被打扫","【第二步】will clean主动，is cleaned现在被动","【答案】选will be cleaned"]},{"id":"e79","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"从句","type":"single","stem":"Do you know ______?","options":["where does he live","where he lives","where he does live","he lives where"],"answer":"where he lives","pitfalls":["陈述语序"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["从句","ch-en-3"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】where he lives 【考点】从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Do you know ______?。 ② 定位考点：从句。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 where he lives。 【其","analysis":"【审题】题干：Do you know ______? know 后宾语从句，考语序。\n【语法点/词汇】宾语从句用陈述语序：疑问词 + 主语 + 谓语。where does he live 是疑问语序，错误。\n【步骤】① Do you know + 宾语从句。② 从句要说“他住在哪里”→ where he lives。③ A. where does he live——疑问语序，错。④ B. where he lives ✓。⑤ C. where he does live——强调结构多余且不自然，错。⑥ D. he lives where——where 必须在从句句首，错。⑦ lives 的 -s 因 he 三单，不可漏。\n【答案】B. where he lives。\n【易错】口语语序带进书面；do/does 在宾从里乱加；三单 lives 写成 live。\n【口诀/模板句】宾从语序陈述化，疑问词后主语加；where he lives 要加 s，do does 往出拿。","steps":["【秒懂考点】宾语从句陈述语序","【第一步】where he lives，陈述语序","【答案】选where he lives"]},{"id":"e80","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","stem":"The teacher told us ______ more books.","options":["read","to read","reading","readed"],"answer":"to read","pitfalls":["tell to do"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["非谓语动词","ch-en-4"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to read 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The teacher told us ______ more books.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：The teacher told us ______ more books. 考 tell sb. to do sth. 句型。\n【语法点/词汇】tell/ask/order/want/advise sb. to do（不定式作宾补）。否定：tell sb. not to do。\n【步骤】① 句型 tell us to do。② to read more books（多读书）。③ A. read——缺 to，错。④ B. to read ✓。⑤ C. reading——tell 不接 sb. doing 表命令，错。⑥ D. readed——形式错，错。\n【答案】B. to read。\n【易错】与 make/let/have sb. do（不带 to）混淆；或写 told us reading。\n【口诀/模板句】tell ask want 加 to do，make let have 要裸奔；感官动词也裸，被动还原 to 别昏。","steps":["【秒懂考点】tell sb to do，不定式作宾补","【第一步】told us to read more books","【第二步】tell后面接不定式，不能接动名词","【答案】选to read"]},{"id":"e85","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"阅读时遇生词应（　）","options":["立刻查字典打断","先猜测再继续","跳过全文","只记中文"],"answer":"先猜测再继续","pitfalls":["阅读技巧"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】先猜测再继续 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：阅读时遇生词应（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 先猜测再继续。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「立刻查字典打断」","analysis":"【审题】题干：阅读时遇生词应（　）。考考场阅读生词处理策略。\n【语法点/词汇】正确策略：先根据上下文猜测，继续读下去；不立刻查字典（打断思路且考场无字典）；不能跳过全文；不能只记中文。\n【步骤】① 读到生词先停半秒看上下文。② 猜测大意后继续。③ A. 立刻查字典打断——低效且不可行，错。④ B. 先猜测再继续 ✓。⑤ C. 跳过全文——夸张，丢失主旨，错。⑥ D. 只记中文——不解决理解，错。\n【答案】B. 先猜测再继续。\n【易错】见到生词就慌、回头反复读；把时间耗在不影响做题的生词上。\n【口诀/模板句】生词先猜继续走，回头再想也来得及；影响做题才细究，别让一词卡全篇。","steps":["【秒懂考点】阅读策略：生词先猜","【第一步】先根据上下文猜测，继续阅读不中断","【答案】先猜测再继续"]},{"id":"e86","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"“infer” 在阅读题干中通常指（　）","options":["照抄原文","根据原文推断","举例说明","反驳作者"],"answer":"根据原文推断","pitfalls":["推断"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】根据原文推断 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：“infer” 在阅读题干中通常指（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 根据原文推断。 【其他选项为何不对】 • ","analysis":"【审题】题干：“infer” 在阅读题干中通常指（　）。考推断题（inference）指令词含义。\n【语法点/词汇】infer = 推断、推论，要求根据原文信息得出合理结论，不是照抄。同义指令词：imply（暗示）, suggest, conclude, learn from。\n【步骤】① 题干 What can we infer from…？② 任务是依据原文合理推出。③ A. 照抄原文——那是细节题，错。④ B. 根据原文推断 ✓。⑤ C. 举例说明——例证作用，错。⑥ D. 反驳作者——无关，错。\n【答案】B. 根据原文推断。\n【易错】推断过度（加原文没有的常识）；或原句照搬以为就是推断。原则：有据可依，一步到位，不绝对化。\n【口诀/模板句】infer 推断靠原文，有据一步不能玄；照抄细节 infer 异，绝对极端常是坑。","steps":["【秒懂考点】infer推断，不是照抄","【第一步】基于原文推断，答案不会直接写在原文","【答案】根据原文推断"]},{"id":"e87","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","stem":"段落首句通常是（　）","options":["主题句","举例","反例","参考文献"],"answer":"主题句","pitfalls":["主题句"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"策略","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["阅读策略","ch-en-5"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】主题句 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：段落首句通常是（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 主题句。 【其他选项为何不对】 • B「举例」：语法结构与时态/搭配","analysis":"【审题】题干：段落首句通常是（　）。考英语段落结构常识。\n【语法点/词汇】学术/说明文段落常见结构：主题句（topic sentence，常在首句）+ 支撑细节/举例/解释。首句概括全段，后文展开。\n【步骤】① 英语段落多演绎式：先观点后细节。② 首句通常是主题句。③ A. 主题句 ✓。④ B. 举例——多在主题句之后，错。⑤ C. 反例——更靠后，错。⑥ D. 参考文献——不在段中，错。⑦ 注意：偶尔主题句在末句或隐含，但“通常”首句。\n【答案】A. 主题句。\n【易错】以为首句是背景/例子；或认为每段首句都是主旨题答案（各段主题句共同支撑全文主旨）。\n【口诀/模板句】段首主题后细节，演绎结构最常见；读段先抓首句意，支撑例子后面跟。","steps":["【秒懂考点】首句通常是主题句","【第一步】段落首句概括段落中心","【答案】主题句"]},{"id":"e90","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The work is too hard for him ______.","options":["to do","doing","do","done"],"answer":"to do","pitfalls":["too to"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to do 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The work is too hard for him ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to d","analysis":"【审题】题干：The work is too hard for him ______. 考 too…to…（太……而不能）结构。\n【语法点/词汇】too + adj. + for sb. + to do（对某人来说太……以致不能）。to do 表结果/程度。\n【步骤】① 句型 too hard for him to do。② 工作太难，他做不了。③ A. to do ✓。④ B. doing——too…to 结构用不定式，错。⑤ C. do——缺 to，错。⑥ D. done——被动不合，错。⑦ 同义改写：The work is so hard that he can't do it.\n【答案】A. to do。\n【易错】与 so…that 从句混淆；或写 too hard for him doing。\n【口诀/模板句】too adj. to do 记心间，for sb. 插中间；so…that 可互换，太难以致不能干。","steps":["【秒懂考点】too...to...，太……而不能","【第一步】too hard for him to do，不定式","【答案】选to do"]},{"id":"e91","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"We are proud ______ what we have done.","options":["for","of","to","with"],"answer":"of","pitfalls":["of固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】of 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：We are proud ______ what we have done.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 of。 【","analysis":"【审题】题干：We are proud ______ what we have done. 与 be proud of 同一考点，of 后可接 what 从句。\n【语法点/词汇】be proud of + 名词/代词/doing/what 从句。what we have done = the things that we have done。\n【步骤】① 固定 be proud of。② 代入：proud of what we have done（为我们所做的自豪）。③ A. for——错。④ B. of ✓。⑤ C. to——错。⑥ D. with——错。\n【答案】B. of。\n【易错】看到从句就想换连接词；或写 proud for。\n【口诀/模板句】proud of 不变样，后面名词从句都能装；what 从句当名词，of 仍然站得稳。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be proud of，为……自豪","【第一步】of为我们所做的骄傲","【答案】选of"]},{"id":"e92","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"Please fill the blank with a ______ word.","options":["proper","properly","property","propose"],"answer":"proper","pitfalls":["形容词"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】proper 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please fill the blank with a ______ word.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please fill the blank with a ______ word. 空格修饰 word（名词），需要形容词。\n【语法点/词汇】proper 形容词“恰当的”；properly 副词；property 名词“财产”；propose 动词“提议”。冠词 a + 形容词 + 名词。\n【步骤】① a ______ word，空格作定语修饰 word。② 词性要形容词。③ A. proper ✓（一个恰当的词）。④ B. properly——副词修饰动词/形容词，不修饰名词，错。⑤ C. property——名词，不能作定语修饰 word（应是 property law），且词义不对，错。⑥ D. propose——动词，错。\n【答案】A. proper。\n【易错】词形家族混淆（proper/properly/property）；不看句法位置只看词义。\n【口诀/模板句】名词前面用形容，动修副来名修形；proper 形 properly 副，词性判断第一步。","steps":["【秒懂考点】形容词修饰名词","【第一步】proper形容词，proper word恰当的词","【第二步】properly副词，property名词属性","【答案】选proper"]},{"id":"e93","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"The word “maintain” means ______.","options":["维护","破坏","购买","测量"],"answer":"维护","pitfalls":["词汇"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】维护 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The word “maintain” means ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 维护。 【其他选项为","analysis":"【审题】题干：The word “maintain” means ______. 词义题。\n【语法点/词汇】maintain = 维护、保养、维持、坚持（主张）。常见搭配：maintain equipment（维护设备）, maintain a friendship（维持友谊）。\n【步骤】① 回忆 maintain 核心义：保持可用/良好状态 → 维护。② A. 维护 ✓。③ B. 破坏（destroy）——反义，错。④ C. 购买（purchase）——无关，错。⑤ D. 测量（measure）——无关，错。\n【答案】A. 维护。\n【易错】与 maintain 的另一义“主张”混淆后误选；或字面认不出与 main 相关。\n【口诀/模板句】maintain 维护又维持，设备系统常用之；destroy 是它反义，测量购买不相干。","steps":["【秒懂考点】maintain = 维护、保持","【第一步】maintain the system维护系统","【答案】选维护"]},{"id":"e95","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"Let's ______ the text together.","options":["go over","go on","go out","go up"],"answer":"go over","pitfalls":["go短语"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】go over 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Let's ______ the text together.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 go over","analysis":"【审题】题干：Let's ______ the text together. 考 go 短语动词辨析。\n【语法点/词汇】go over = 复习、仔细检查；go on = 继续；go out = 外出/熄灭；go up = 上升。text 课文，together 一起，符合“一起复习课文”。\n【步骤】① 语境：一起处理课文 → 复习/过一遍。② A. go over ✓。③ B. go on——go on the text 不表复习，错。④ C. go out——外出，不合，错。⑤ D. go up——上升，错。\n【答案】A. go over。\n【易错】go 短语互串；或把 over 当“结束”误解。\n【口诀/模板句】go over 复习检查，go on 继续不断；go out 出去 go up 涨，短语动词分开看。","steps":["【秒懂考点】go over，复习、浏览","【第一步】go over the text复习课文","【第二步】go on继续，go out出去，go up上升","【答案】选go over"]},{"id":"e96","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"He is ______ honest man.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":"an","pitfalls":["看音素"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】an 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is ______ honest man.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 an。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ______ honest man. 考冠词，honest 首字母 h 不发音。\n【语法点/词汇】a/an 的选择看读音（音素）不看字母。honest 读 /ˈɒnɪst/，元音音素开头，用 an。hour, honor, hour 同理。\n【步骤】① 看后词 honest 读音：/ɒ/ 开头。② 元音音素 → an。③ A. a——辅音音素才用，错。④ B. an ✓。⑤ C. the——此处泛指“一个诚实的人”，不特指，错。⑥ D. /（零冠词）——可数单数 man 前需冠词，错。\n【答案】B. an。\n【易错】见 h 字母就用 a；university 用 a（读 /ju:/），hour/honest 用 an。\n【口诀/模板句】a an 看音不看形，honest hour 开头元音；university 却是 a，因为 /ju:/ 是辅音素先。","steps":["【秒懂考点】honest元音音素开头，用an","【第一步】an honest man，h不发音，元音开头","【答案】选an"]},{"id":"e98","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"I prefer tea ______ coffee.","options":["than","to","over","from"],"answer":"to","pitfalls":["to固定"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I prefer tea ______ coffee.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to。 【其他选项为何不对】 •","analysis":"【审题】题干：I prefer tea ______ coffee. 考 prefer 的介词搭配。\n【语法点/词汇】prefer A to B（比起 B 更喜欢 A）；prefer doing to doing；would prefer to do rather than do。\n【步骤】① 句型 prefer tea to coffee。② A. than——比较级用 than，但 prefer 不用 than，错。③ B. to ✓。④ C. over——口语偶见 prefer A over B，但标准固定是 to，考试选 to。⑤ D. from——错。\n【答案】B. to。\n【易错】受“更喜欢”影响选 than；prefer…to 与 compare…with/to 混。\n【口诀/模板句】prefer A to B 标准型，不用 than 来不用 from；比起咖啡更爱茶，to 连接两杯拿。","steps":["【秒懂考点】prefer A to B，更喜欢A而不是B","【第一步】prefer tea to coffee，to固定","【答案】选to"]},{"id":"e100","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","stem":"He made a decision ______ accept the job.","options":["to","for","of","with"],"answer":"to","pitfalls":["不定式"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-english","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["词汇与搭配","ch-en-1"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He made a decision ______ accept the job.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to","analysis":"【审题】题干：He made a decision ______ accept the job. 考名词 decision 后的不定式（同位语/定语）。\n【语法点/词汇】make a decision to do（决定做）。to do 是 decision 的同位语或后置定语，说明决定内容。类似：make a plan to do, have a chance to do。\n【步骤】① decision 表“决定做……”时后接 to do。② to accept the job（接受这份工作）。③ A. to ✓。④ B. for——错。⑤ C. of——错。⑥ D. with——错。\n【答案】A. to。\n【易错】与 decide to do 混（decide 后直接 to do，decision 是名词要用 a decision to do）。\n【口诀/模板句】decision 名词跟 to do，决定内容后面走；decide 动词接 to，名词前加 a decision。","steps":["【秒懂考点】decision to do，不定式作定语","【第一步】decision to accept，决定做某事","【答案】选to"]},{"id":"ex01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He ______ a new bike last week.","options":["buy","buys","bought","buying"],"answer":"bought","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["不规则"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】bought 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He ______ a new bike last week.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 bought。 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ a new bike last week. last week 明确过去时间，用一般过去时。\n【语法点/词汇】一般过去时：动词过去式。buy 的过去式是 bought（不规则，不加 -ed）。\n【步骤】① 时间 last week → 一般过去时。② buy → bought。③ A. buy——原形，错。④ B. buys——现在三单，错。⑤ C. bought ✓。⑥ D. buying——非谓语，缺谓语，错。\n【答案】C. bought。\n【易错】写成 buyed（规则化错误）；或三单 buys 忽略过去时间。\n【口诀/模板句】last week 过去式，buy bought 别加 ed；不规则动词表常背，时间标志定时态。","steps":["【秒懂考点】last week过去时，buy过去式bought","【第一步】buy-bought-bought，不规则","【答案】选bought"]},{"id":"ex02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She ______ TV when I came in.","options":["watched","is watching","was watching","watches"],"answer":"was watching","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["进行时"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】was watching 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She ______ TV when I came in.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 was ","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ TV when I came in. when 引导时间状语从句，came in 是过去某刻，主句应为当时正在发生的动作。\n【语法点/词汇】过去进行时（was/were doing）+ when + 一般过去时：表示“当……时，正在……”。\n【步骤】① 从句 I came in（过去式）。② 主句“她正在看电视”→ was watching。③ A. watched——一般过去，与 when 点状时刻不强调“正在”，错。④ B. is watching——现在进行，时态错。⑤ C. was watching ✓。⑥ D. watches——现在，错。\n【答案】C. was watching。\n【易错】主从句时态都用一般过去；she 用 were。\n【口诀/模板句】when 加过去式，主句 was/were doing；短动作进长动作，正在背景记心中。","steps":["【秒懂考点】came in时正在做，过去进行","【第一步】was watching，when I came in","【答案】选was watching"]},{"id":"ex04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She is good ______ singing.","options":["in","at","on","for"],"answer":"at","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["at"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】at 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She is good ______ singing.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 at。 【其他选项为何不对】 •","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is good ______ singing. be good at doing，考介词。\n【语法点/词汇】be good at + n./doing（擅长）。singing 是动名词。\n【步骤】① 固定 be good at。② A. in——错。③ B. at ✓。④ C. on——错。⑤ D. for——be good for 有益，不合“擅长唱歌”，错。\n【答案】B. at。\n【易错】good at 与 good for 混；doing 前介词写错。\n【口诀/模板句】good at 擅长做，doing 名词都可跟；for 是有益 to 是对人好，三介词义要分好。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be good at，擅长","【第一步】at singing，固定","【答案】选at"]},{"id":"ex05","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ______ to school every day.","options":["go","goes","going","gone"],"answer":"go","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["时态"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】go 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ to school every day.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 go。 【其他选项为何不对】","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ to school every day. every day 表习惯，一般现在时；主语 I 用原形。\n【语法点/词汇】一般现在时表习惯/经常性动作。I + 动词原形 go。every day 是标志。\n【步骤】① every day → 一般现在。② 主语 I → go（不加 s）。③ A. go ✓。④ B. goes——三单，I 不是三单，错。⑤ C. going——非谓语，错。⑥ D. gone——过去分词，错。\n【答案】A. go。\n【易错】三单过度使用 goes；every day 与 yesterday 时态混。\n【口诀/模板句】every day 现在时，I 后原形不加 s；he she it 才加 es，主谓一致别忽视。","steps":["【秒懂考点】every day一般现在时，I用go","【第一步】go to school，第一人称原形","【答案】选go"]},{"id":"ex10","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"There ______ many students in the classroom.","options":["is","are","be","was"],"answer":"are","tags":["主谓"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["就近"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：There ______ many students in the classroom.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案","analysis":"【审题】题干：There ______ many students in the classroom. there be 句型，be 与后面名词保持一致。\n【语法点/词汇】There be 就近/一致原则：be 的单复数与最近的名词一致；students 复数 → are。many students 前无 a。\n【步骤】① 句型 There be。② 表语中心词 students 复数。③ A. is——单数，错。④ B. are ✓。⑤ C. be——原形不能作谓语，错。⑥ D. was——过去时，无过去时间，错。\n【答案】B. are。\n【易错】就近原则在 a book and two pens 用 is；本句 many students 直接复数用 are。\n【口诀/模板句】there be 看后面，单数 is 复数 are；就近原则记在心，two pens and a book 用 is 要分清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】there be句型，students复数，are","【第一步】many students是复数，be用are","【答案】选are"]},{"id":"ex11","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Can you ______ me your pen?","options":["lend","borrow","lending","borrowing"],"answer":"lend","tags":["词汇"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["方向"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】lend 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Can you ______ me your pen?。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 lend。 【其他选项为何不","analysis":"【审题】题干：Can you ______ me your pen? 考 lend 与 borrow 的方向。\n【语法点/词汇】lend sb. sth. = lend sth. to sb.（把……借给某人，借出）；borrow sth. from sb.（从某人借入）。me 是间接宾语，lend 双宾语。\n【步骤】① 结构：Can you + 动词 + me + your pen。② “你能把笔借给我吗？”= 你借出 → lend。③ A. lend ✓。④ B. borrow——borrow 应说 borrow your pen from you，不接 me your pen 双宾语表借入，错。⑤ C. lending——can 后原形，错。⑥ D. borrowing——错。\n【答案】A. lend。\n【易错】中文“借”不分方向；borrow/lend 互换。\n【口诀/模板句】lend 借出 borrow 借入，方向不对全糊涂；lend me your pen，borrow from you 记清楚。","steps":["【秒懂考点】lend借出，borrow借入，方向相反","【第一步】you lend me，你借给我，主语you借出","【第二步】Can后动词原形，lend","【答案】选lend"]},{"id":"ex13","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"My father is ______ engineer.","options":["a","an","the","two"],"answer":"an","tags":["冠词"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["an"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】an 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：My father is ______ engineer.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 an。 【其他选项为何不对】","analysis":"【审题】题干：My father is ______ engineer. engineer 元音音素开头，用 an。\n【语法点/词汇】an + 元音音素开头的可数单数。engineer /ˌendʒɪˈnɪə/ 以 /e/ 开头。\n【步骤】① engineer 读音元音开头。② 用 an。③ A. a——错。④ B. an ✓。⑤ C. the——此处泛指职业，不特指，错。⑥ D. two——father 是单数，错。\n【答案】B. an。\n【易错】以字母 e 看形不听音；职业前漏冠词。\n【口诀/模板句】engineer 前用 an，元音音素是关键；职业身份说 a/an，特指才把 the 添。","steps":["【秒懂考点】engineer元音音素开头，an","【第一步】engineer发音e开头，用an","【答案】选an"]},{"id":"ex15","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"How ______ is the book? — 20 yuan.","options":["many","much","old","long"],"answer":"much","tags":["疑问词"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["much"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】much 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：How ______ is the book? — 20 yuan.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 much。 【","analysis":"【审题】题干：How ______ is the book? — 20 yuan. 答句是价格，问“多少钱”。\n【语法点/词汇】How much 问价格/不可数数量；How many 问可数数量；How old 问年龄；How long 问时长/长度。\n【步骤】① 答 20 yuan（价格）→ How much。② A. many——后接可数复数，问数量，错。③ B. much ✓。④ C. old——问年龄，答 years old，错。⑤ D. long——问时间/长度，错。\n【答案】B. much。\n【易错】much/many 不分；或问价用 how price（错）。\n【口诀/模板句】问价多少 how much，可数数量 how many；价格数字 yuan 答，much 开头问价法。","steps":["【秒懂考点】问价格how much，不可数","【第一步】20 yuan，问多少钱，how much","【第二步】how many问数量，how old年龄，how long长度","【答案】选much"]},{"id":"ex19","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"主旨题通常关注（　）","options":["首段与各段首句","生词表","页脚","插图"],"answer":"首段与各段首句","tags":["阅读"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["阅读"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】首段与各段首句 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：主旨题通常关注（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 首段与各段首句。 【其他选项为何不对】 • B「生词表」：语","analysis":"【审题】题干：主旨题通常关注（　）。与 e19 类似，考主旨题阅读焦点。\n【语法点/词汇】主旨来源：首段引言、各段首句（topic sentences）、末段总结。生词表/页脚/插图不是主线。\n【步骤】① 主旨题找全文中心。② A. 首段与各段首句 ✓。③ B. 生词表——无关，错。④ C. 页脚——无关，错。⑤ D. 插图——辅助，不是主旨，错。\n【答案】A. 首段与各段首句。\n【易错】被版式元素干扰；主旨看零散细节。\n【口诀/模板句】主旨首段段首句，末段收束也可依；插图页脚靠边站，全文中心是第一。","steps":["【秒懂考点】主旨题，首段和各段首句","【答案】首段与各段首句"]},{"id":"er01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ______ a student.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":"am","tags":["be"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["be动词"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】am 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ a student.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 am。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「is」：语","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ a student. 主语 I，be 动词用 am。\n【语法点/词汇】be 动词现在时：I am / you are / he-she-it is / we-you-they are。\n【步骤】① 主语 I。② 对应 am。③ A. is——三单用，错。④ B. am ✓。⑤ C. are——复数/you，错。⑥ D. be——原形，错。\n【答案】B. am。\n【易错】I 后写 is/are；be 动词缩写形式混淆。\n【口诀/模板句】I am you are he is，单数 is 复数 are；be 动词随主语变，表口诀就三句记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】I搭配am","【答案】选am"]},{"id":"er02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She ______ from China.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":"is","tags":["be"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["is"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】is 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She ______ from China.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 is。 【其他选项为何不对】 • B「am","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ from China. 主语 She，be 用 is。\n【语法点/词汇】be from = come from。She 三单 → is。\n【步骤】① 主语 She 三单 → be 动词用 is。② A. is ✓。③ B. am——配 I，错。④ C. are——配 you/复数，错。⑤ D. be——原形，错。⑥ 翻译：她来自中国。\n【答案】A. is。\n【易错】she is 缩写 she's；或用 are。\n【口诀/模板句】she he it 都用 is，来自某地 is from；I 是 am 你是 are，三个形式要分清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】she第三人称单数，is","【答案】选is"]},{"id":"er03","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"They ______ happy.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":"are","tags":["be"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["are"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：They ______ happy.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 are。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「is」：","analysis":"【审题】题干：They ______ happy. 主语 They（复数），be 动词用 are。\n【语法点/词汇】复数主语 + are；happy 是形容词作表语。\n【步骤】① 主语 They 复数。② 对应 are。③ A. is——单数，错。④ B. am——只配 I，错。⑤ C. are ✓。⑥ D. be——原形不能作谓语，错。\n【答案】C. are。\n【易错】they is；或把 are 缩写 're 忘记还原。\n【口诀/模板句】we you they 全用 are，复数主语统一它；单数 is I am，三句口诀不会差。","steps":["【秒懂考点】they复数，are","【答案】选are"]},{"id":"er04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He ______ to work by bus.","options":["go","goes","going","gone"],"answer":"goes","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["goes"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】goes 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He ______ to work by bus.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 goes。 【其他选项为何不对】","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ to work by bus. 主语 He 三单，一般现在时，动词加 -es（go→goes）。\n【语法点/词汇】一般现在时三单：动词 + s/es。go 以 o 结尾 → goes。by bus 表方式。\n【步骤】① He 三单，习惯动作。② go → goes。③ A. go——缺 -es，错。④ B. goes ✓。⑤ C. going——非谓语，错。⑥ D. gone——过去分词，错。\n【答案】B. goes。\n【易错】go 加 s 写成 gos（应为 goes）；I/you 后误加 s。\n【口诀/模板句】he she it 动词加 s，go 结尾 o 加 es；goes to work by bus，三单变化要落实。","steps":["【秒懂考点】he第三人称单数，一般现在时goes","【第一步】go to work，he goes","【答案】选goes"]},{"id":"er05","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Birds can ______.","options":["fly","flying","flew","flies"],"answer":"fly","tags":["情态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["can原形"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】fly 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Birds can ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 fly。 【其他选项为何不对】 • B「flyin","analysis":"【审题】题干：Birds can ______. 情态动词 can 后接动词原形。\n【语法点/词汇】can/could/will/would/should/may/might/must + 动词原形（不带 to）。\n【步骤】① can 后用原形 fly。② A. fly ✓。③ B. flying——错。④ C. flew——过去式，错。⑤ D. flies——三单，错。\n【答案】A. fly。\n【易错】can 后用 to fly 或 flying；flies 拼写（fly→flies）。\n【口诀/模板句】情态动词跟原形，can may will must 清；后头不带 to 也不变，fly 原形最标准。","steps":["【秒懂考点】can后动词原形","【第一步】Birds can fly，鸟会飞","【答案】选fly"]},{"id":"er06","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The book ______ on the desk.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":"is","tags":["be"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["is"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】is 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The book ______ on the desk.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 is。 【其他选项为何不对】 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book ______ on the desk. 主语 The book 单数，be 用 is。\n【语法点/词汇】单数主语 + is；on the desk 是地点状语。\n【步骤】① The book 三单单数。② A. is ✓。③ B. am——只配 I，错。④ C. are——复数，错。⑤ D. be——原形，错。\n【答案】A. is。\n【易错】there be 与主系表混；book 后写 are。\n【口诀/模板句】the book 单数用 is，主系表里 be 随主语；一本书在桌上，is 站在名词后。","steps":["【秒懂考点】book单数，is","【答案】选is"]},{"id":"er13","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"They ______ students.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":"are","tags":["be"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["are"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：They ______ students.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 are。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「i","analysis":"【审题】题干：They ______ students. 主语 They，be 用 are。\n【语法点/词汇】They + are；students 是表语。\n【步骤】① They 复数。② A. is——错。③ B. am——错。④ C. are ✓。⑤ D. be——错。\n【答案】C. are。\n【易错】there are 与 they are 混；或漏 be。\n【口诀/模板句】they are students 对，主语复数 are 跟；I am he is they are，三个搭配不能混。","steps":["【秒懂考点】they are，复数","【答案】选are"]},{"id":"er14","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ______ TV now.","options":["watch","watched","am watching","watches"],"answer":"am watching","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["am watching"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】am watching 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ TV now.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 am watching。 【其他选项","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ TV now. now 是现在进行时标志。\n【语法点/词汇】现在进行时：am/is/are + doing。I + am watching。\n【步骤】① now → 现在进行。② I → am watching。③ A. watch——一般现在，错。④ B. watched——过去，错。⑤ C. am watching ✓。⑥ D. watches——三单一般现在，错。\n【答案】C. am watching。\n【易错】now 用一般现在；I 后用 is watching。\n【口诀/模板句】now look listen 用进行，be doing 结构清；I am watching TV now，标志词把时态定。","steps":["【秒懂考点】now现在进行时，am watching","【答案】am watching"]},{"id":"er15","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He ______ to school yesterday.","options":["go","goes","went","going"],"answer":"went","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["went"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】went 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He ______ to school yesterday.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 went。 【其他选项","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ to school yesterday. yesterday 是过去时间，用一般过去时。\n【语法点/词汇】go 的过去式 went（不规则）。\n【步骤】① yesterday → 过去时。② go → went。③ A. go——错。④ B. goes——现在三单，错。⑤ C. went ✓。⑥ D. going——错。\n【答案】C. went。\n【易错】goed（不存在）；yesterday 漏过去式。\n【口诀/模板句】yesterday 用过去式，go went 不规则；went to school 表昨天，时间副词定时态。","steps":["【秒懂考点】yesterday过去时，go过去式went","【答案】went"]},{"id":"er16","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The sun ______ in the east.","options":["rise","rises","rose","rising"],"answer":"rises","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["rises"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】rises 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The sun ______ in the east.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 rises。 【其他选项为","analysis":"【审题】题干：The sun ______ in the east. 客观真理，一般现在时；主语 sun 三单。\n【语法点/词汇】rise 升起，三单 rises；in the east 表地点。科学事实用一般现在。\n【步骤】① 太阳从东方升起是真理。② 一般现在 + 三单 → rises。③ A. rise——缺 -s，错。④ B. rises ✓。⑤ C. rose——过去，真理不用过去，错。⑥ D. rising——非谓语，错。\n【答案】B. rises。\n【易错】rise/raise 不分（raise 及物）；三单 -s 漏。\n【口诀/模板句】真理事实现在时，sun rises 三单 s；rise 不及物 raise 及物，东方升起用 rises。","steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理，一般现在时，sun第三人称rises","【答案】rises"]},{"id":"er17","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Please open ______ door.","options":["a","an","the","this"],"answer":"the","tags":["冠词"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["the"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】the 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please open ______ door.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 the。 【其他选项为何不对】 • ","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please open ______ door. 双方共知的门（那扇门），用定冠词 the。\n【语法点/词汇】the 表特指（双方都知道或上文提到）；a/an 泛指。open the door 是常见祈使句。\n【步骤】① 语境是“把门打开”，特指眼前那扇门。② 用 the。③ A. a——泛指一扇，错。④ B. an——错。⑤ C. the ✓。⑥ D. this——this door 也说得通，但祈使句 open the door 是固定说法，且 the 最中性标准，本题答案 the。\n【答案】C. the。\n【易错】a door（随便一扇）与 the door（那扇）混；this 强于 the。\n【口诀/模板句】特指双方都知道，定冠词 the 要用好；open the door 祈使句，眼前那扇不用 a。","steps":["【秒懂考点】特指双方知道的门，the","【答案】the"]},{"id":"er19","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I have ______ apple and ______ banana.","options":["a;a","an;a","the;the","an;an"],"answer":"an;a","tags":["冠词"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["an;a"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】an;a 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I have ______ apple and ______ banana.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 an;","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have ______ apple and ______ banana. 两个不定冠词分别修饰 apple、banana。\n【语法点/词汇】apple 元音音素 /æ/ → an；banana 辅音 /b/ → a。并列各配各的冠词。\n【步骤】① apple → an。② banana → a。③ 合成 an apple and a banana。④ A. a;a——apple 应 an，错。⑤ B. an;a ✓。⑥ C. the;the——非特指，错。⑦ D. an;an——banana 应 a，错。\n【答案】B. an;a。\n【易错】并列名词共用一个冠词；或 banana 也写 an。\n【口诀/模板句】apple 元音 an 打头，banana 辅音 a 跟走；并列各自配冠词，an apple and a banana。","steps":["【秒懂考点】apple元音an，banana辅音a","【答案】an;a"]},{"id":"er23","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Let's ______ football.","options":["play","plays","playing","to play"],"answer":"play","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["play"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】play 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Let's ______ football.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 play。 【其他选项为何不对】 • ","analysis":"【审题】题干：Let's ______ football. Let's = Let us，后接动词原形（省略 to 的不定式）。\n【语法点/词汇】let sb. do sth.（让某人做）；Let's do = 让我们一起做。play football 踢足球。\n【步骤】① Let's 后用原形 play。② A. play ✓。③ B. plays——三单，错。④ C. playing——错。⑤ D. to play——let 后不带 to，错。\n【答案】A. play。\n【易错】Let's to play；或 Let's playing。\n【口诀/模板句】let's 后面用原形，to 不能往中间停；Let's play football，邀请建议一起行。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Let's后动词原形，play","【答案】play"]},{"id":"er24","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Thank you ______ your help.","options":["for","of","to","at"],"answer":"for","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["for"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】for 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Thank you ______ your help.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 for。 【其他选项为何不对】","analysis":"【审题】题干：Thank you ______ your help. 考 thank 的介词。\n【语法点/词汇】Thank you for sth./doing（因……感谢）。for 表原因。\n【步骤】① 感谢原因 → for。② A. for ✓。③ B. of——错。④ C. to——thank to 不表感谢原因，错。⑤ D. at——错。\n【答案】A. for。\n【易错】Thanks to（多亏）与 Thank you for 混。\n【口诀/模板句】thank you for 表原因，多亏是 thanks to 两回事；your help 是感谢对象，for 跟在 thanks 后。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Thank you for，为……感谢","【答案】for"]},{"id":"er25","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Listen! Someone ______ singing.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":"is","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["is"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】is 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Listen! Someone ______ singing.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 is。 【其他选项为何不","analysis":"【审题】题干：Listen! Someone ______ singing. Listen! 现在进行时；someone 单数，be 用 is。\n【语法点/词汇】现在进行时 am/is/are + doing。someone/everyone/no one 作主语视为单数。\n【步骤】① Listen! → 进行时。② Someone 单数 → is singing。③ A. is ✓。④ B. are——someone 后不用 are，错。⑤ C. am——只配 I，错。⑥ D. be——原形，错。\n【答案】A. is。\n【易错】someone 被当复数用 are；Listen 用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】Listen! Look! 用进行，someone 单数 is 顶；someone is singing 正在唱，复合不定代词看作单。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Listen! 现在进行，someone单数is","【答案】is"]},{"id":"enx2","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She ______ her homework last night.","options":["does","did","do","doing"],"answer":"did","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["did"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】did 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：She ______ her homework last night.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 did。 【其","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ her homework last night. last night 过去时间，一般过去时；do→did。\n【语法点/词汇】do 的过去式 did；her homework 作宾语。\n【步骤】① last night → 过去时。② do → did。③ A. does——现在三单，错。④ B. did ✓。⑤ C. do——原形，错。⑥ D. doing——错。\n【答案】B. did。\n【易错】did 后又加 s；或用 have done（无 for/since）。\n【口诀/模板句】last night 用 did，do did done 三级记；did her homework 表做完，一般过去最合适。","steps":["【秒懂考点】last night过去，do过去式did","【答案】did"]},{"id":"enx3","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"There ______ a book and two pens on the desk.","options":["is","are","be","am"],"answer":"is","tags":["主谓"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["is"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】is 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：There ______ a book and two pens on the desk.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案","analysis":"【审题】题干：There ______ a book and two pens on the desk. there be 就近原则，靠近 be 的是 a book（单数）。\n【语法点/词汇】There be 就近一致：be 与最近的名词一致。a book 单数 → is。\n【步骤】① there be 句型。② 最近名词 a book 单数。③ A. is ✓。④ B. are——被 two pens 干扰，但就近原则用 is，错。⑤ C. be——原形，错。⑥ D. am——错。\n【答案】A. is。\n【易错】只看 two pens 用 are；忽略就近原则。\n【口诀/模板句】there be 就近看，a book and two pens 用 is；two pens and a book 才用 are，位置先后定单双。","steps":["【秒懂考点】there be就近，a book单数is","【答案】is"]},{"id":"enx4","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He is ______ than his brother.","options":["tall","taller","tallest","more tall"],"answer":"taller","tags":["比较级"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["taller"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】taller 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is ______ than his brother.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 taller。 【","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ______ than his brother. than 是比较级标志。\n【语法点/词汇】tall → taller（单音节加 -er）。than 前必须比较级。\n【步骤】① than → 比较级。② tall → taller。③ A. tall——原级，错。④ B. taller ✓。⑤ C. tallest——最高级，错。⑥ D. more tall——tall 单音节不用 more，错。\n【答案】B. taller。\n【易错】more tall（错）；tall 与 short 逻辑反了（题干就是 taller）。\n【口诀/模板句】than 前比较级，单音节加 er 多音节 more；tall taller tallest，三级变化要熟悉。","steps":["【秒懂考点】than比较级，taller","【答案】taller"]},{"id":"enx5","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"This is ______ interesting film.","options":["a","an","the","two"],"answer":"an","tags":["冠词"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["an"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】an 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：This is ______ interesting film.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 an。 【其他选项为何","analysis":"【审题】题干：This is ______ interesting film. interesting 以元音音素 /ɪ/ 开头，用 an。\n【语法点/词汇】an + 元音音素；interesting /ˈɪntrəstɪŋ/。\n【步骤】① interesting 元音音素开头。② an。③ A. a——错。④ B. an ✓。⑤ C. the——此处是泛指“一部有趣的电影”，this is an… 是介绍，错。⑥ D. two——单数 film，错。\n【答案】B. an。\n【易错】interesting 以 i 字母看成辅音；或写 a interesting。\n【口诀/模板句】interesting 元音开头 an，音素原则记心间；a university a hour 对比记，看音不看字母面。","steps":["【秒懂考点】interesting元音，an","【答案】an"]},{"id":"enx6","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Look! The children ______ on the playground.","options":["play","plays","are playing","played"],"answer":"are playing","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["are playing"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are playing 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Look! The children ______ on the playground.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配","analysis":"【审题】题干：Look! The children ______ on the playground. Look! 进行时；children 复数。\n【语法点/词汇】are + playing。\n【步骤】① Look! → 现在进行。② children 复数 → are playing。③ A. play——错。④ B. plays——三单，错。⑤ C. are playing ✓。⑥ D. played——过去，错。\n【答案】C. are playing。\n【易错】children 当单数 is playing；Look 用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】Look! 说话正进行，children 复数 are 跟；are playing on the playground，现在分词加 ing。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Look! 现在进行，children复数are playing","【答案】are playing"]},{"id":"enx14","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语动词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I want ______ a doctor when I grow up.","options":["be","to be","being","been"],"answer":"to be","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["to be"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to be 【考点】非谓语动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I want ______ a doctor when I grow up.。 ② 定位考点：非谓语动词。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to","analysis":"【审题】题干：I want ______ a doctor when I grow up. want to do sth.\n【语法点/词汇】want to do（想做）。grow up 长大。\n【步骤】① want to do。② to be a doctor（成为医生）。③ A. be——缺 to，错。④ B. to be ✓。⑤ C. being——错。⑥ D. been——错。\n【答案】B. to be。\n【易错】want doing（英式“需要被”）与 want to do 混。\n【口诀/模板句】want to do 想要做，to be 名词职业跟；want 一般接 to do，to be a doctor 表长大后的身份。","steps":["【秒懂考点】want to be想成为，to be","【答案】to be"]},{"id":"enx15","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Please turn ______ the light. It's dark.","options":["on","off","up","down"],"answer":"on","tags":["短语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["on"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】on 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please turn ______ the light. It's dark.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 on。","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please turn ______ the light. It's dark. 天黑需要开灯，turn on（打开）。\n【语法点/词汇】turn on 打开（电器）；turn off 关闭；turn up 调大；turn down 调小/拒绝。\n【步骤】① It's dark → 需要开灯。② turn on the light。③ A. on ✓。④ B. off——关灯与 dark 矛盾，错。⑤ C. up——调大亮度通常说 turn up the light 也可，但“开灯”标准是 turn on，且 dark 明确需要打开，错。⑥ D. down——调小，错。\n【答案】A. on。\n【易错】turn on/off/up/down 四短语互串；dark 不看语境乱选 off。\n【口诀/模板句】turn on 开 turn off 关，turn up 大 turn down 小；It's dark 开灯用 on，电器开关成对记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】turn on打开，天黑开灯","【答案】on"]},{"id":"enx17","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"My parents are proud ______ me.","options":["at","of","for","to"],"answer":"of","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["of"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】of 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：My parents are proud ______ me.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 of。 【其他选项为何不","analysis":"【审题】题干：My parents are proud ______ me. be proud of，考介词。\n【语法点/词汇】be proud of sb./sth.。\n【步骤】① 固定 of。② A. at——错。③ B. of ✓。④ C. for——错。⑤ D. to——错。\n【答案】B. of。\n【易错】proud for/to；parents 复数后用 are 正确。\n【口诀/模板句】proud of 不分人和事，父母为我 of me；介词固定多背诵，at for to 都不对。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be proud of为……自豪，of","【答案】of"]},{"id":"enx19","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"阅读策略","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"细节题定位最有效的方法是（　）","options":["凭印象","找关键词回原文","只看标题","看选项长短"],"answer":"找关键词回原文","tags":["阅读"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["找关键词回原文"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】找关键词回原文 【考点】阅读策略 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：细节题定位最有效的方法是（ ）。 ② 定位考点：阅读策略。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 找关键词回原文。 【其他选项为何不对】 • A「凭","analysis":"【审题】题干：细节题定位最有效的方法是（　）。与 e55 同考点。\n【语法点/词汇】关键词定位：圈专有名词/数字/核心名词→回文找同义替换。\n【步骤】① 细节题要快准。② A. 凭印象——易错，错。③ B. 找关键词回原文 ✓。④ C. 只看标题——覆盖不了细节，错。⑤ D. 看选项长短——无关，错。\n【答案】B. 找关键词回原文。\n【易错】凭印象做题；选项诱导。\n【口诀/模板句】细节定位关键词，回文扫描对原句；印象长短都不算，原文证据才是力。","steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题关键词定位","【答案】找关键词回原文"]},{"id":"enx21","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ______ my homework already.","options":["finish","finishes","have finished","finished"],"answer":"have finished","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["have finished"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】have finished 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ my homework already.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 hav","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ my homework already. already 是现在完成时标志。\n【语法点/词汇】现在完成时 have/has + 过去分词。already/just/yet/ever/never 是标志。finish → finished。\n【步骤】① already → 现在完成。② I → have finished。③ A. finish——现在，错。④ B. finishes——三单，错。⑤ C. have finished ✓。⑥ D. finished——过去，不强调对现在的影响，欠佳。\n【答案】C. have finished。\n【易错】already 用一般过去；finished 写成 finish（过去分词同形）。\n【口诀/模板句】already just yet 用完成，have/has + 过去分；I have finished 表已完成，对现在有影响明。","steps":["【秒懂考点】already现在完成，have finished","【答案】have finished"]},{"id":"enx22","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"We should keep our classroom ______.","options":["clean","cleaning","cleaned","to clean"],"answer":"clean","tags":["词性"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["clean"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】clean 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：We should keep our classroom ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 clea","analysis":"【审题】题干：We should keep our classroom ______. keep + 宾语 + 形容词（宾补），保持某种状态。\n【语法点/词汇】keep sth. + adj.（keep the room clean）；keep sb. doing（让一直做）。\n【步骤】① keep our classroom + 状态。② clean 形容词作宾补。③ A. clean ✓。④ B. cleaning——keep classroom cleaning 语法别扭，应 clean，错。⑤ C. cleaned——被动分词不表状态，错。⑥ D. to clean——不定式表目的，不作宾补状态，错。\n【答案】A. clean。\n【易错】keep + doing 与 keep + adj. 混。\n【口诀/模板句】keep sth. 加形容，保持状态最常用；keep him waiting 是 doing，宾补形式看词性。","steps":["【秒懂考点】keep sth+形容词，keep clean保持干净","【答案】clean"]},{"id":"enx26","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He is responsible ______ the plan.","options":["to","for","of","at"],"answer":"for","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["for"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】for 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is responsible ______ the plan.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 for。 【其他","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is responsible ______ the plan. 与 e25 同，responsible for。\n【语法点/词汇】be responsible for sth.。\n【步骤】① for the plan（对计划负责）。② A. to——向人负责，错。③ B. for ✓。④ C. of——错。⑤ D. at——错。\n【答案】B. for。\n【易错】responsible to/for 混。\n【口诀/模板句】responsible for 负责事，responsible to 对人称；plan 是事情用 for，介词搭配要上心。","steps":["【秒懂考点】be responsible for，for","【答案】for"]},{"id":"enx27","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Let's ______ the classroom together.","options":["clean","cleaning","cleans","to clean"],"answer":"clean","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["clean"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】clean 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Let's ______ the classroom together.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 clea","analysis":"【审题】题干：Let's ______ the classroom together. Let's + 原形。\n【语法点/词汇】Let's do sth.。\n【步骤】① Let's clean（一起打扫）。② A. clean ✓。③ B. cleaning——错。④ C. cleans——错。⑤ D. to clean——错。\n【答案】A. clean。\n【易错】Let's to clean。\n【口诀/模板句】Let's 后面动词原，to 不能加中间；Let's clean the classroom，建议一起做某事。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Let's原形，clean","【答案】clean"]},{"id":"enx30","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"How much ______ the shoes?","options":["is","are","be","am"],"answer":"are","tags":["主谓"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["are"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】are 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：How much ______ the shoes?。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 are。 【其他选项为何不对】 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：How much ______ the shoes? shoes 复数，be 用 are；问价。\n【语法点/词汇】How much are…? 复数；How much is…? 单数。\n【步骤】① the shoes 复数。② are。③ A. is——单数，错。④ B. are ✓。⑤ C. be——原形，错。⑥ D. am——错。\n【答案】B. are。\n【易错】how much 一律用 is；shoes 成对名词当单数。\n【口诀/模板句】how much 问价随名词，shoes 复数用 are；a pair of shoes 才用 is，中心词性定 be 动。","steps":["【秒懂考点】shoes复数，are","【答案】are"]},{"id":"enx33","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The sun ______ in the east and sets in the west.","options":["rise","rises","rose","rising"],"answer":"rises","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["rises"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】rises 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The sun ______ in the east and sets in the west.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ","analysis":"【审题】题干：The sun ______ in the east and sets in the west. 客观真理，一般现在；and 并列 rises 与 sets。\n【语法点/词汇】rise → rises（三单）；set → sets。\n【步骤】① 真理用一般现在。② sun 三单 → rises。③ A. rise——缺 -s，错。④ B. rises ✓。⑤ C. rose——过去，错。⑥ D. rising——错。\n【答案】B. rises。\n【易错】rise/raise；三单漏 -s。\n【口诀/模板句】太阳东升西边落，真理现在三单 s；rises and sets 对仗，客观事实不改变。","steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理rises，第三人称","【答案】rises"]},{"id":"enx34","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I prefer coffee ______ tea.","options":["than","to","over","for"],"answer":"to","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["to"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I prefer coffee ______ tea.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to。 【其他选项为何不对】 •","analysis":"【审题】题干：I prefer coffee ______ tea. prefer A to B。\n【语法点/词汇】prefer…to…。\n【步骤】① 固定 to。② A. than——错。③ B. to ✓。④ C. over——非标准考点答案，错。⑤ D. for——错。\n【答案】B. to。\n【易错】than/over 干扰。\n【口诀/模板句】prefer A to B 记法，咖啡比起茶；than 不用 over 少，标准搭配 to 最佳。","steps":["【秒懂考点】prefer to固定","【答案】to"]},{"id":"enx39","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Don't forget ______ your homework tomorrow.","options":["bring","to bring","bringing","brought"],"answer":"to bring","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["to bring"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to bring 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Don't forget ______ your homework tomorrow.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ ","analysis":"【审题】题干：Don't forget ______ your homework tomorrow. forget to do（忘记去做，还没做）；forget doing（忘记做过）。\n【语法点/词汇】tomorrow 表明作业还没做，用 forget to bring（别忘了带）。\n【步骤】① tomorrow → 动作未发生。② forget to bring。③ A. bring——缺 to，错。④ B. to bring ✓。⑤ C. bringing——forget bringing 是“忘了曾经带过”，与 tomorrow 矛盾，错。⑥ D. brought——错。\n【答案】B. to bring。\n【易错】forget to do / forget doing 混。\n【口诀/模板句】forget to do 忘去做，forget doing 忘做过；tomorrow 将来没做，to bring 才不会错。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Don't forget to do，记得去做，to bring","【答案】to bring"]},{"id":"enx41","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态与语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Water ______ at 100 degrees Celsius.","options":["boils","is boiled","boiled","boiling"],"answer":"boils","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["boils"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】boils 【考点】时态与语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Water ______ at 100 degrees Celsius.。 ② 定位考点：时态与语态。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 boil","analysis":"【审题】题干：Water ______ at 100 degrees Celsius. 客观真理，一般现在；water 不可数，三单 boils。\n【语法点/词汇】boil → boils。degrees Celsius 摄氏度。\n【步骤】① 科学事实。② A. boils ✓。③ B. is boiled——被动不对，错。④ C. boiled——过去，错。⑤ D. boiling——非谓语，错。\n【答案】A. boils。\n【易错】is boiled。\n【口诀/模板句】水沸 100 度真，一般现在三单 s；boils at 100 degrees，客观事实用 boils。","steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理boils，主动","【答案】boils"]},{"id":"enx42","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I saw him ______ across the street just now.","options":["walk","walking","to walk","walked"],"answer":"walking","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["walking"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】walking 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I saw him ______ across the street just now.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ ","analysis":"【审题】题干：I saw him ______ across the street just now. see sb. doing（看见某人正在做）vs see sb. do（看见全过程）。\n【语法点/词汇】just now 刚才；across the street 正在横穿马路，强调正在进行 → walking。\n【步骤】① 语境“看见他正在过马路”。② see him walking。③ A. walk——强调看见整个过程，本题更强调当时动作，但 two answers possible… 本题答案 walking（进行片段）。④ B. walking ✓。⑤ C. to walk——see 后不加 to，错。⑥ D. walked——错。\n【答案】B. walking。\n【易错】see sb. do 与 doing 混。\n【口诀/模板句】see sb. do 全过程，see sb. doing 片段中；just now 正在穿，walking 现在分词用。","steps":["【秒懂考点】see sb doing，看到正在走，walking","【答案】walking"]},{"id":"enx44","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He has ______ friends than I.","options":["many","more","much","most"],"answer":"more","tags":["比较级"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["more"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】more 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He has ______ friends than I.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 more。 【其他选项为","analysis":"【审题】题干：He has ______ friends than I. than 比较级；many → more。\n【语法点/词汇】many much → more → most。friends 可数，many friends。\n【步骤】① than → 比较级 more。② A. many——原级，错。③ B. more ✓。④ C. much——不可数原级，错。⑤ D. most——最高级，错。\n【答案】B. more。\n【易错】more friends than I（口语 than me）；much/more 词形。\n【口诀/模板句】than 前比较级 more，many much 都变它；more friends than I，不规则比较要记下。","steps":["【秒懂考点】than比较级more","【答案】more"]},{"id":"enx45","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Please be quiet. The baby ______.","options":["sleep","sleeps","is sleeping","slept"],"answer":"is sleeping","tags":["时态"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["is sleeping"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】is sleeping 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Please be quiet. The baby ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 i","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please be quiet. The baby ______. 请安静，因为宝宝正在睡觉，现在进行时。\n【语法点/词汇】is sleeping；baby 三单。\n【步骤】① be quiet 暗示正在进行。② A. sleep——现在，错。③ B. sleeps——习惯，错。④ C. is sleeping ✓。⑤ D. slept——过去，错。\n【答案】C. is sleeping。\n【易错】用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】be quiet 提示进行时，the baby is sleeping；现在分词 sleeping，背景动作要共鸣。","steps":["【秒懂考点】请安静，婴儿正在睡，is sleeping","【答案】is sleeping"]},{"id":"enx47","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The box is too heavy for me ______.","options":["to carry","carry","carrying","carried"],"answer":"to carry","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["to carry"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to carry 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：The box is too heavy for me ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 to","analysis":"【审题】题干：The box is too heavy for me ______. too…to…（太重搬不动）。\n【语法点/词汇】too + adj. + for sb. + to do。\n【步骤】① too heavy for me to carry。② A. to carry ✓。③ B. carry——缺 to，错。④ C. carrying——错。⑤ D. carried——错。\n【答案】A. to carry。\n【易错】too…to 与 so…that 混。\n【口诀/模板句】too heavy to carry 记，for me 插进里；太重以致不能搬，不定式 to 要齐。","steps":["【秒懂考点】too...to，to carry","【答案】to carry"]},{"id":"enx49","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I am looking forward to ______ you again.","options":["see","seeing","saw","sees"],"answer":"seeing","tags":["搭配"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["seeing"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】seeing 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I am looking forward to ______ you again.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am looking forward to ______ you again. look forward to doing。\n【语法点/词汇】to 是介词，seeing you。\n【步骤】① to + doing。② A. see——错。③ B. seeing ✓。④ C. saw——错。⑤ D. sees——错。\n【答案】B. seeing。\n【易错】look forward to see。\n【口诀/模板句】look forward to doing，to 介词动名词；seeing you again 期待，介词后 ing 要清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】look forward to doing，seeing","【答案】seeing"]},{"id":"enx50","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"词汇与搭配","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He is old enough ______ to school by himself.","options":["go","to go","going","goes"],"answer":"to go","tags":["非谓语"],"source":"batch","pitfalls":["to go"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】to go 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：He is old enough ______ to school by himself.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is old enough ______ to school by himself. enough 修饰形容词时后置，enough to do（足够……能做）。\n【语法点/词汇】adj. + enough + to do。\n【步骤】① old enough to go。② A. go——缺 to，错。③ B. to go ✓。④ C. going——错。⑤ D. goes——错。\n【答案】B. to go。\n【易错】enough to do 位置；enough to 与 too…to 混。\n【口诀/模板句】形容 enough to do，足够才能做得到；old enough to go，反义 too young to go 记牢。","steps":["【秒懂考点】adj enough to do，足够……去做，to go","【答案】to go"]},{"id":"en201","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"现在完成时","type":"single","stem":"I ______ in this city for ten years.","options":["live","lived","have lived","am living"],"answer":"have lived","pitfalls":["have lived"],"difficulty":1,"source":"highfreq","typeLabel":"单选","video":"v-en","difficultyLabel":"基础","tags":["时态","现在完成时","ch-en-2"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ in this city for ten years. for ten years 现在完成时。\n【语法点/词汇】have lived（live→lived）。\n【步骤】① for + 时间段。② have lived。③ A. live——错。④ B. lived——错。⑤ C. have lived ✓。⑥ D. am living——进行不表持续十年，错。\n【答案】C. have lived。\n【易错】for ten years 用一般过去。\n【口诀/模板句】for ten years 用完成，have lived 表从过去至今；现在完成 have/has done，持续时间做证明。","steps":["【秒懂考点】for ten years现在完成，have lived","【答案】have lived"]},{"id":"en1102","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Please ____ the TV. The baby is sleeping.","options":["turn off","turn on","turn up","turn down"],"answer":"turn off","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","短语动词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ the TV. The baby is sleeping. 宝宝睡觉，需要关电视（声音/光）。\n【语法点/词汇】turn off 关闭；turn on 打开；turn up 调大；turn down 调小。\n【步骤】① sleeping → 需要安静 → turn off。② A. turn off ✓。③ B. turn on——开会吵，错。④ C. turn up——更大声，错。⑤ D. turn down——调小也可以但 turn off 更彻底，且语境是不要吵，关掉最合适，本题答案 turn off。\n【答案】A. turn off。\n【易错】turn off/down 都可减音，但 sleeping 语境用 off。\n【口诀/模板句】baby sleeping 关电视，turn off 最合适；turn down 只调小，关闭开关 off 持。","steps":["【秒懂考点】重复turn off","【答案】turn off"],"pitfalls":["turn off"]},{"id":"en1103","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"形容词比较级","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"This book is ____ than that one.","options":["more interesting","interesting","most interesting","interestinger"],"answer":"more interesting","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","比较级"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：This book is ____ than that one. than 比较级；interesting 多音节 → more interesting。\n【语法点/词汇】多音节形容词比较级 more + 原级；interestinger 不存在。\n【步骤】① than → 比较级。② more interesting。③ A. more interesting ✓。④ B. interesting——原级，错。⑤ C. most interesting——最高级，错。⑥ D. interestinger——错误构词，错。\n【答案】A. more interesting。\n【易错】多音节加 -er；more 与 -er 并用。\n【口诀/模板句】多音节 more 加原形，interesting 不能 er；more interesting than，比较级里 more 行。","steps":["【秒懂考点】than比较，more interesting","【答案】more interesting"],"pitfalls":["more interesting"]},{"id":"en1104","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"最高级","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"She is ____ student in our class.","options":["the tallest","tallest","taller","tall"],"answer":"the tallest","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","最高级"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：She is ____ student in our class. in our class 是最高级范围标志。\n【语法点/词汇】最高级：the + 最高级 + in/of 范围。tall → taller → (the) tallest。\n【步骤】① in our class → 最高级。② the tallest student。③ A. the tallest ✓。④ B. tallest——缺 the，错。⑤ C. taller——比较级无 than，错。⑥ D. tall——原级，错。\n【答案】A. the tallest。\n【易错】最高级漏 the；tall 双写 l 加 -est 正确（tallest）。\n【口诀/模板句】in the class 最高级，the + est 别忘记；the tallest student 最高，范围里面第一名。","steps":["【秒懂考点】in class最高级，the tallest","【答案】the tallest"],"pitfalls":["the tallest"]},{"id":"en1108","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"borrow/lend/keep","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Can I ____ your pen?","options":["borrow","lend","keep","return"],"answer":"borrow","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","借"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Can I ____ your pen? 问“我能否借用你的笔”，借入用 borrow。\n【语法点/词汇】borrow（借入）from；lend（借出）to；keep 保留；return 归还。\n【步骤】① 我借你的笔 → borrow。② A. borrow ✓。③ B. lend——是你借给我才 lend me，主语 I 应 borrow，错。④ C. keep——语义“保留”不合请求，错。⑤ D. return——归还，错。\n【答案】A. borrow。\n【易错】lend/borrow 方向；Can I lend your pen 逻辑反。\n【口诀/模板句】I borrow you lend，借入借出方向明；Can I borrow your pen，请求借入用 borrow。","steps":["【秒懂考点】我借入，borrow","【答案】borrow"],"pitfalls":["borrow"]},{"id":"en1110","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"bring/take/fetch/carry","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Please ____ your homework here tomorrow.","options":["bring","take","fetch","carry"],"answer":"bring","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","拿"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ your homework here tomorrow. here 表示带到说话人这里，bring（带来）。\n【语法点/词汇】bring 带来（朝说话人）；take 带走；fetch 去取来；carry 搬运（无方向）。\n【步骤】① here → 带到这里 → bring。② A. bring ✓。③ B. take——带去别处，错。④ C. fetch——先去取再回来，语境不要求往返，错。⑤ D. carry——不强调方向，欠佳。\n【答案】A. bring。\n【易错】bring/take 以说话人方向为准。\n【口诀/模板句】bring 来 take 去，here 配 bring 记心里；fetch 取来 carry 抱，方向语境要看清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】bring here带来，bring","【答案】bring"],"pitfalls":["bring"]},{"id":"en2103","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"被动语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"The bridge ____ two years ago.","options":["was built","built","is built","builds"],"answer":"was built","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["语态","被动"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：The bridge ____ two years ago. two years ago 过去时间；桥被建，过去被动。\n【语法点/词汇】was/were + 过去分词。build → built。\n【步骤】① 过去时间。② 被动 was built。③ A. was built ✓。④ B. built——主动，桥不能建自己，错。⑤ C. is built——现在被动，错。⑥ D. builds——主动现在，错。\n【答案】A. was built。\n【易错】was built 与 built 混；build 过去分词 built（不双写）。\n【口诀/模板句】ago 过去被动式，was built 记心识；桥被建好 two years ago，by 施动可省略。","steps":["【秒懂考点】两年前被建，被动was built","【答案】was built"],"pitfalls":["was built"]},{"id":"en3104","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"条件状语从句","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"If it ____ tomorrow, we will stay at home.","options":["rains","will rain","rained","rain"],"answer":"rains","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["从句","条件状语"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：If it ____ tomorrow, we will stay at home. 主将从现。\n【语法点/词汇】if 从句一般现在表将来；it 三单 rains。\n【步骤】① 主句 will stay。② 从句 rains。③ A. rains ✓。④ B. will rain——错。⑤ C. rained——错。⑥ D. rain——缺 -s，错。\n【答案】A. rains。\n【易错】if 从句用 will。\n【口诀/模板句】主将从现 if 从句，一般现在表将来；it rains 三单 s，will 不进 if 里。","steps":["【秒懂考点】if主将从现，rains","【答案】rains"],"pitfalls":["rains"]},{"id":"en4104","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"it作形式主语","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"It is important ____ English well.","options":["to learn","learning","learn","learned"],"answer":"to learn","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["非谓语","it用法"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：It is important ____ English well. It 形式主语，to learn 真正主语。\n【语法点/词汇】It is + adj. + to do。\n【步骤】① 句型 It is important to learn。② A. to learn ✓。③ B. learning——本句型标准 to do，错。④ C. learn——缺 to，错。⑤ D. learned——错。\n【答案】A. to learn。\n【易错】It is important learning。\n【口诀/模板句】It is adj. to do，学好英语 important；形式主语 to 不可少，to learn English well。","steps":["【秒懂考点】It is important to do，to learn","【答案】to learn"],"pitfalls":["to learn"]},{"id":"en5101","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"细节题","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"According to the passage, which of the following is true?","options":["细节理解","主旨大意","词义猜测","推理判断"],"answer":"细节理解","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["阅读","题型"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：According to the passage, which of the following is true? 题干指令词 According to + which is true，是细节题。\n【语法点/词汇】题型判断：细节题（detail）；主旨 main idea；词义 word meaning；推断 inference。\n【步骤】① According to the passage = 原文依据。② which is true = 细节判断。③ A. 细节理解 ✓。④ B. 主旨大意——问 mainly，错。⑤ C. 词义猜测——问 means，错。⑥ D. 推理判断——问 infer，错。\n【答案】A. 细节理解。\n【易错】见到选项长就当推断；According to 是细节标志。\n【口诀/模板句】According to 原文找，which is true 细节考；mainly 主题 infer 推，means 猜词四套分开。","steps":["【秒懂考点】which true，细节题回原文核对","【答案】细节理解"],"pitfalls":["细节理解"]},{"id":"en1112","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"动词辨析","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"It ____ me two hours to finish my homework.","options":["took","spent","cost","paid"],"answer":"took","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","花费"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：It ____ me two hours to finish my homework. It took sb. time to do。\n【语法点/词汇】take 的过去式 took；spend 主语是人；cost 主语是物；pay 主语是人+for。\n【步骤】① It 作主语 → took。② A. took ✓。③ B. spent——I spent two hours (in) doing，主语应是 I，错。④ C. cost——The book cost me…，错。⑤ D. paid——I paid…for，错。\n【答案】A. took。\n【易错】take/spend/cost/pay 四花费混用。\n【口诀/模板句】It takes/took sb. time to do，spend 人 doing/from；cost 物值多少钱，pay 人 for 才对头。","steps":["【秒懂考点】It takes time，took","【答案】took"],"pitfalls":["took"]},{"id":"en1113","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"介词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"We usually have lunch ____ 12 o'clock.","options":["at","in","on","for"],"answer":"at","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","介词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：We usually have lunch ____ 12 o'clock. 钟点前用 at。\n【语法点/词汇】at + 时刻；in + 年月季节上午下午；on + 具体某日星期。\n【步骤】① 12 o'clock 时刻。② A. at ✓。③ B. in——in the morning，错。④ C. on——on Monday，错。⑤ D. for——for lunch 表“作为午饭”，不表时间点，错。\n【答案】A. at。\n【易错】in 12 o'clock。\n【口诀/模板句】at 点 in 段 on 日天，时间介词三句言；at 12 o'clock 正午，have lunch 在饭点。","steps":["【秒懂考点】具体时刻at，12点","【答案】at"],"pitfalls":["at"]},{"id":"en1114","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"代词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Help ____ to some fish, kids.","options":["yourselves","yourself","you","your"],"answer":"yourselves","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","代词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Help ____ to some fish, kids. kids 复数，help yourselves（随便吃）。\n【语法点/词汇】Help yourself/yourselves to sth.（请自便吃/用）。oneself 随主语变化。\n【步骤】① kids → yourselves。② A. yourselves ✓。③ B. yourself——单数，错。④ C. you——宾格不反身，错。⑤ D. your——所有格，错。\n【答案】A. yourselves。\n【易错】kids 复数仍用 yourself。\n【口诀/模板句】Help yourselves to，复数 kids 用反身；yourself 单 yourselves 双，请自便吃不用愁。","steps":["【秒懂考点】help yourselves，kids复数，yourselves","【答案】yourselves"],"pitfalls":["yourselves"]},{"id":"en1115","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"many/much","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"There isn't ____ milk in the glass.","options":["much","many","few","a few"],"answer":"much","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","形容词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：There isn't ____ milk in the glass. milk 不可数，否定句用 much。\n【语法点/词汇】much + 不可数；many + 可数复数；few/a few + 可数复数；little/a little + 不可数。\n【步骤】① milk 不可数。② isn't 否定，用 much。③ A. much ✓。④ B. many——接可数，错。⑤ C. few——接可数，错。⑥ D. a few——接可数，错。\n【答案】A. much。\n【易错】milk 可数化；否定 much/many 不分。\n【口诀/模板句】much 不可 many 可，few a few 也跟复；milk 牛奶不可数，isn't much 是正路。","steps":["【秒懂考点】milk不可数，much，否定","【答案】much"],"pitfalls":["much"]},{"id":"en1117","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"enough用法","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"He is ____ to go to school.","options":["old enough","enough old","older enough","enough older"],"answer":"old enough","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","enough"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ____ to go to school. enough 修饰形容词要后置。\n【语法点/词汇】adj. + enough + to do；enough 修饰名词前置（enough money）。\n【步骤】① old enough to go。② A. old enough ✓。③ B. enough old——顺序错，错。④ C. older enough——结构错，错。⑤ D. enough older——错。\n【答案】A. old enough。\n【易错】enough 前置后置；名词前/形容词后。\n【口诀/模板句】enough 名词前形容后，old enough to go；enough money 对，old enough 对，位置口诀要背熟。","steps":["【秒懂考点】enough放在形容词后，old enough","【答案】old enough"],"pitfalls":["old enough"]},{"id":"en1118","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"also/too/either","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I don't know it, ____.","options":["either","too","also","so"],"answer":"either","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","也"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I don't know it, ____. 否定句末“也”用 either。\n【语法点/词汇】too 肯定句末；either 否定句末；also 句中；so 表“如此/所以”。\n【步骤】① 否定句。② either。③ A. either ✓。④ B. too——肯定，错。⑤ C. also——位置句中，错。⑥ D. so——语义不对，错。\n【答案】A. either。\n【易错】否定句用 too。\n【口诀/模板句】too 肯定 either 否，also 句中中间走；I don't know it either，否定句末 either 留。","steps":["【秒懂考点】否定句末\"也\"，either","【答案】either"],"pitfalls":["either"]},{"id":"en1119","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"already/yet","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Have you finished your work ____?","options":["yet","already","still","just"],"answer":"yet","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","现在完成时"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Have you finished your work ____? 疑问句中“已经……了吗”用 yet。\n【语法点/词汇】yet 疑问/否定句末“已经/还”；already 多用于肯定；still 仍；just 刚刚。\n【步骤】① 疑问句。② yet。③ A. yet ✓。④ B. already——多在肯定，错。⑤ C. still——仍，语义不同，错。⑥ D. just——刚刚，错。\n【答案】A. yet。\n【易错】疑问句用 already。\n【口诀/模板句】疑问否定用 yet，already 肯定排；Have you finished yet，问句末尾 yet 安。","steps":["【秒懂考点】疑问句末\"已经\"，yet","【答案】yet"],"pitfalls":["yet"]},{"id":"en1120","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"spend time","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I often spend an hour ____ English every day.","options":["reading","to read","read","reads"],"answer":"reading","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","spend"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I often spend an hour ____ English every day. spend time doing。\n【语法点/词汇】spend + 时间 + (in) doing / on sth.。\n【步骤】① spend an hour reading。② A. reading ✓。③ B. to read——spend 不接 to do，错。④ C. read——错。⑤ D. reads——错。\n【答案】A. reading。\n【易错】spend to read。\n【口诀/模板句】spend time doing 好，an hour reading 不少；spend on sth. 也常用，to read 不要往里搞。","steps":["【秒懂考点】spend time doing，reading","【答案】reading"],"pitfalls":["reading"]},{"id":"en1121","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"how long/how often","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"____ have you studied English?","options":["How long","How often","How soon","How far"],"answer":"How long","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","疑问词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：____ have you studied English? 可问时长（多久）也可问频率，但 studied 是完成/持续，最标准问“学了多久”用 How long。\n【语法点/词汇】How long 多久（时长）；How often 多久一次（频率）；How soon 多久以后；How far 多远。\n【步骤】① have you studied 可表持续。② How long（问时长）最契合。③ A. How long ✓。④ B. How often——问频率“每周几次”，答次数，错。⑤ C. How soon——问将来多久，错。⑥ D. How far——问距离，错。\n【答案】A. How long。\n【易错】How long/How often 混。\n【口诀/模板句】How long 时长 How often 次，How soon 将来 How far 距；have studied 问多久，How long 打头最合适。","steps":["【秒懂考点】问多久，How long","【答案】How long"],"pitfalls":["How long"]},{"id":"en2106","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"You ____ finish your homework first.","options":["must","can","may","might"],"answer":"must","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["情态动词","义务"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：You ____ finish your homework first. first 表示“必须先”，语气强，用 must。\n【语法点/词汇】must 必须（义务）；can 能；may 可以；might 可能。\n【步骤】① 作业先完成是义务。② must。③ A. must ✓。④ B. can——只表能力，错。⑤ C. may——请求许可，错。⑥ D. might——可能性，错。\n【答案】A. must。\n【易错】can/may 弱化语气。\n【口诀/模板句】must 必须义务强，can 能 may 许可商量；homework first 要求明，must finish 不彷徨。","steps":["【秒懂考点】必须先完成，must","【答案】must"],"pitfalls":["must"]},{"id":"en3107","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"感叹句","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"____ nice day it is today!","options":["What a","What","How","How a"],"answer":"What a","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["句型","感叹句"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：____ nice day it is today! 感叹句，中心词 day 可数单数名词，用 What a。\n【语法点/词汇】What + (a/an) + adj. + n. (+ 主谓)！How + adj./adv. (+ 主谓)！\n【步骤】① day 可数单数 → What a nice day。② A. What a ✓。③ B. What——单数缺 a，错。④ C. How——How 后直接 adj.，应 How nice a day 或 How nice the day is，结构不同，错。⑤ D. How a——不存在，错。\n【答案】A. What a。\n【易错】What/How 混；What 后漏 a。\n【口诀/模板句】What a adj. 名词奇，How adj. 副词提；What a nice day it is，名词感叹 What 挤。","steps":["【秒懂考点】What a+名词，day可数","【答案】What a"],"pitfalls":["What a"]},{"id":"en1201","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"The plane ____ on time yesterday.","options":["took off","took up","took in","took after"],"answer":"took off","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","短语动词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：The plane ____ on time yesterday. 飞机“起飞”take off。\n【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞/脱下；take up 占据；take in 吸收；take after 像。yesterday 过去 → took off。\n【步骤】① plane 起飞。② take off。③ yesterday → took off。④ A. took off ✓。⑤ B. took up——占据，错。⑥ C. took in——吸收，错。⑦ D. took after——像，错。\n【答案】A. took off。\n【易错】take 短语互串。\n【口诀/模板句】take off 起飞脱衣，take up 占据；take in 吸收 take after 像，took off 过去式。","steps":["【秒懂考点】yesterday飞机起飞，took off","【答案】took off"],"pitfalls":["took off"]},{"id":"en1202","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"介词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"We go to school ____ Monday to Friday.","options":["from","on","in","at"],"answer":"from","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","介词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：We go to school ____ Monday to Friday. from…to…（从……到……）。\n【语法点/词汇】from + 起点 + to + 终点。\n【步骤】① from Monday to Friday。② A. from ✓。③ B. on——on Monday，错。④ C. in——错。⑤ D. at——错。\n【答案】A. from。\n【易错】on Monday to Friday（错）。\n【口诀/模板句】from A to B 成对用，从周一周到周五；from…to…两头定，介词搭配要牢记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】from...to，从周一到周五","【答案】from"],"pitfalls":["from"]},{"id":"en1204","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Listen! Someone ____ at the door.","options":["is knocking","knocks","knocked","knock"],"answer":"is knocking","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["时态","现在进行时"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Listen! Someone ____ at the door. Listen! 现在进行时。\n【语法点/词汇】is knocking；someone 单数。\n【步骤】① Listen! → 进行。② A. is knocking ✓。③ B. knocks——习惯，错。④ C. knocked——过去，错。⑤ D. knock——原形，错。\n【答案】A. is knocking。\n【易错】Listen 用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】Listen! 正在敲，is knocking at the door；someone 单数 is 跟，现在进行用分词。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Listen! 正在敲门，is knocking","【答案】is knocking"],"pitfalls":["is knocking"]},{"id":"en1206","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-3","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"The girl ____ is singing is my sister.","options":["who","which","whom","whose"],"answer":"who","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["从句","定语从句"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：The girl ____ is singing is my sister. 定语从句，先行词 girl（人），从句缺主语。\n【语法点/词汇】who 指人作主语；whom 作宾语；whose 所有格。\n【步骤】① girl 人。② 从句缺主语。③ A. who ✓。④ B. which——物，错。⑤ C. whom——宾格，错。⑥ D. whose——“谁的”，错。\n【答案】A. who。\n【易错】who/whom 不分。\n【口诀/模板句】人作主语用 who，宾格 whom 跟在后；the girl who is singing，主谓齐了句子通。","steps":["【秒懂考点】girl人作主语，who","【答案】who"],"pitfalls":["who"]},{"id":"en1207","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I have a lot of homework ____.","options":["to do","doing","do","did"],"answer":"to do","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["非谓语","不定式"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of homework ____. have sth. to do。\n【语法点/词汇】to do 作 homework 后置定语。\n【步骤】① have homework to do。② A. to do ✓。③ B. doing——错。④ C. do——错。⑤ D. did——错。\n【答案】A. to do。\n【易错】homework to do 与 homework doing。\n【口诀/模板句】have homework to do，有作业要做；不定式后置修饰 sth.，to do 结构最常见。","steps":["【秒懂考点】homework to do，不定式","【答案】to do"],"pitfalls":["to do"]},{"id":"en1208","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"疑问词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"____ is the weather like today?","options":["What","How","Which","Why"],"answer":"What","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","疑问词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：____ is the weather like today? 天气怎么样，What…like?。\n【语法点/词汇】What is the weather like?（固定）；How is the weather?（另一形式）。\n【步骤】① like 前用 What。② A. What ✓。③ B. How——若无 like 才用 How is the weather，错。④ C. Which——错。⑤ D. Why——错。\n【答案】A. What。\n【易错】How is the weather like（错）。\n【口诀/模板句】What is the weather like，问天气 like 前 What 挤；How is the weather 也对，like 在就用 What。","steps":["【秒懂考点】What is weather like，固定","【答案】What"],"pitfalls":["What"]},{"id":"en1210","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"被动语态","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"The work ____ tomorrow.","options":["will be finished","will finish","is finished","finishes"],"answer":"will be finished","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["语态","被动"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：The work ____ tomorrow. tomorrow 将来；工作被完成，将来被动。\n【语法点/词汇】will be finished。\n【步骤】① tomorrow → will。② 被动 be finished。③ A. will be finished ✓。④ B. will finish——主动，错。⑤ C. is finished——现在，错。⑥ D. finishes——主动现在，错。\n【答案】A. will be finished。\n【易错】will finish 忽略被动。\n【口诀/模板句】tomorrow 将来被动式，will be finished 就是它；工作被做完 will be done，主动被动要看清。","steps":["【秒懂考点】明天被完成，will be finished","【答案】will be finished"],"pitfalls":["will be finished"]},{"id":"en1005","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"形容词辨析","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"It is ____ of you to help me carry the box.","options":["kind","kindly","kindness","kinds"],"answer":"kind","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","形容词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：It is ____ of you to help me carry the box. It is kind of sb. to do（你真好……）。\n【语法点/词汇】It is + adj. + of sb. + to do（评价人的品质）；It is + adj. + for sb. + to do（评价事情）。\n【步骤】① kind of you（你好心）。② A. kind ✓。③ B. kindly——副词，错。④ C. kindness——名词，错。⑤ D. kinds——错。\n【答案】A. kind。\n【易错】kindly/kind 词性；of you 与 for you。\n【口诀/模板句】kind of you 品质评，for you 事情性；It is kind of you to help，of sb. 记分明。","steps":["【秒懂考点】It is kind of，kind品质，kind","【答案】kind"],"pitfalls":["kind"]},{"id":"en1006","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"副词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"He runs very ____.","options":["fast","fastly","fasting","faster"],"answer":"fast","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","副词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：He runs very ____. 修饰动词 runs 用副词。\n【语法点/词汇】fast 兼形容词/副词；无 fastly。\n【步骤】① very 后修饰 runs 的副词。② A. fast ✓。③ B. fastly——不存在，错。④ C. fasting——斋戒/禁食，无关，错。⑤ D. faster——比较级无 than，错。\n【答案】A. fast。\n【易错】加 -ly 造 fastly。\n【口诀/模板句】fast 形副一体，fastly 没这个形；runs very fast 跑得快，very 修饰副词性。","steps":["【秒懂考点】fast形副同形，fast","【答案】fast"],"pitfalls":["fast"]},{"id":"en1007","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-1","knowledgePoint":"连词","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"Hurry up, ____ you will be late.","options":["or","and","but","so"],"answer":"or","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["词汇","连词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：Hurry up, ____ you will be late. “快点，否则你会迟到”，or 表“否则”。\n【语法点/词汇】or 否则/或者；and 并列/那么；but 但是；so 所以。\n【步骤】① 后果“会迟到”→ 否则。② A. or ✓。③ B. and——“和”，逻辑不对，错。④ C. but——转折，错。⑤ D. so——因果，错。\n【答案】A. or。\n【易错】祈使句 + or = 否则；and 表结果时主句主语不同。\n【口诀/模板句】Hurry up or 你会迟，or 表否则要记识；祈使句 or 结果，and then 意义别乱使。","steps":["【秒懂考点】or否则，or","【答案】or"],"pitfalls":["or"]},{"id":"en2001","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"现在完成时","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I ____ my homework already.","options":["have finished","finished","finish","will finish"],"answer":"have finished","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["时态","现在完成时"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ my homework already. already 现在完成时。\n【语法点/词汇】have finished。\n【步骤】① already → 完成。② A. have finished ✓。③ B. finished——过去，欠佳。④ C. finish——现在，错。⑤ D. will finish——将来，错。\n【答案】A. have finished。\n【易错】already 用过去式。\n【口诀/模板句】already 标完成，have/has done 要清；I have finished my homework，完成时态对现在有反应。","steps":["【秒懂考点】already现在完成，have finished","【答案】have finished"],"pitfalls":["have finished"]},{"id":"en2002","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-2","knowledgePoint":"过去进行时","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"What ____ you ____ at 8 o'clock last night?","options":["were; doing","did; do","are; doing","do; do"],"answer":"were; doing","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["时态","过去进行时"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：What ____ you ____ at 8 o'clock last night? 过去某时刻正在做什么，过去进行时疑问。\n【语法点/词汇】What were you doing? 过去进行时：was/were + doing。you 用 were。\n【步骤】① at 8 last night → 过去进行。② What were you doing。③ A. were; doing ✓。④ B. did; do——一般过去，问做了什么（已结束），错。⑤ C. are; doing——现在，错。⑥ D. do; do——现在，错。\n【答案】A. were; doing。\n【易错】did you do 与 were you doing。\n【口诀/模板句】过去某点问正在，What were you doing；were 配 you 配复数，doing 进行要带 ing。","steps":["【秒懂考点】昨晚8点过去进行，were doing","【答案】were; doing"],"pitfalls":["were; doing"]},{"id":"ne1","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The company will ____ a new branch in Guangzhou.","options":["open","open up","open on","open out"],"answer":"open up","analysis":"【审题】题干：The company will ____ a new branch in Guangzhou. 公司在广州“开办/新开”一个分部。\n【语法点/词汇】open up a branch（开办、开辟）；open 打开；open on 不搭配；open out 展开。branch 分公司。\n【步骤】① 语义“开一家新分公司”。② open up（开办）。③ A. open——打开门等，不表开设机构，欠佳。④ B. open up ✓。⑤ C. open on——错。⑥ D. open out——展开，错。\n【答案】B. open up。\n【易错】open/open up 辨析：open the door 打开门，open up a business 开业。\n【口诀/模板句】open up 开办新机构，open 打开具体物；open up a branch，开辟新店用 up。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】open up开设分公司，open up","【答案】open up"],"pitfalls":["open up"]},{"id":"ne2","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Please ____ your address on the form.","options":["fill in","fill out","fill up","fill with"],"answer":"fill in","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ your address on the form. 在表格上填地址。\n【语法点/词汇】fill in 填入（空）；fill out 填完整表；fill up 装满；fill with 充满。本题 address on the form，标准用 fill in。\n【步骤】① 填地址进表格。② fill in your address。③ A. fill in ✓。④ B. fill out——也可表填表，但 fill in the address 更地道填空项，且本题答案 in。⑤ C. fill up——装满，错。⑥ D. fill with——充满，错。\n【答案】A. fill in。\n【易错】fill in/out 都可“填”，考试以答案为准记住搭配。\n【口诀/模板句】fill in 填入空，fill out 填整表；fill up 装满 with 充，address 用 in 记牢。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】fill in填写地址","【答案】fill in"],"pitfalls":["fill in"]},{"id":"ne3","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The meeting has been ____ until next Friday.","options":["put off","put up","put on","put out"],"answer":"put off","analysis":"【审题】题干：The meeting has been ____ until next Friday. 会议被“推迟”到下周五。\n【语法点/词汇】put off 推迟；put up 挂/搭建；put on 穿上；put out 扑灭。has been + 过去分词，被动完成。\n【步骤】① until next Friday → 推迟。② put off。③ A. put off ✓。④ B. put up——错。⑤ C. put on——错。⑥ D. put out——错。\n【答案】A. put off。\n【易错】put 短语互串。\n【口诀/模板句】put off 推迟 off 走，put up 挂起 put on 穿；put out 扑火灭，meeting put off 到下周五。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】put off推迟会议","【答案】put off"],"pitfalls":["put off"]},{"id":"ne4","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ____ my old friend in the street yesterday.","options":["ran into","ran out","ran over","ran away"],"answer":"ran into","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ my old friend in the street yesterday. 在街上“偶遇”老朋友。\n【语法点/词汇】run into = run across 偶然遇见；run out 用完；run over 碾过；run away 逃跑。yesterday → ran into。\n【步骤】① 偶遇 → run into。② yesterday → ran into。③ A. ran into ✓。④ B. ran out——用完，错。⑤ C. ran over——碾压，错。⑥ D. ran away——逃跑，错。\n【答案】A. ran into。\n【易错】run 短语互串。\n【口诀/模板句】run into 偶遇他，run out 用完啦；run over 碾压 run away 逃，ran into 过去加 a。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】ran into偶遇，yesterday","【答案】ran into"],"pitfalls":["ran into"]},{"id":"ne7","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"介词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She is good ____ playing the piano.","options":["at","in","on","for"],"answer":"at","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is good ____ playing the piano. be good at doing。\n【语法点/词汇】be good at + doing。\n【步骤】① at playing。② A. at ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. on——错。⑤ D. for——错。\n【答案】A. at。\n【易错】good at 与 good for。\n【口诀/模板句】good at 擅长 playing，at 加动名词；be good at doing 记，in on for 都不行。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["介词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be good at，at","【答案】at"],"pitfalls":["at"]},{"id":"ne8","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"介词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He has been in Beijing ____ 2020.","options":["for","since","from","in"],"answer":"since","analysis":"【审题】题干：He has been in Beijing ____ 2020. has been 是现在完成时，2020 是过去时间点，用 since。\n【语法点/词汇】since + 时间点；for + 时间段。\n【步骤】① 2020 时间点。② A. for——接时间段，错。③ B. since ✓。④ C. from——from 2020 一般不与现在完成时 has been 独用表“自从”，标准 since，错。⑤ D. in——in 2020 一般过去，与 has been 不配，错。\n【答案】B. since。\n【易错】since/for 混。\n【口诀/模板句】since 点 for 段，完成时态两搭档；since 2020 从那年，for ten years 才是段。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["介词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】since+时间点，2020","【答案】since"],"pitfalls":["since"]},{"id":"ne9","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"介词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"We usually go to school ____ bus.","options":["by","on","with","in"],"answer":"by","analysis":"【审题】题干：We usually go to school ____ bus. 乘公共汽车 by bus。\n【语法点/词汇】by + 交通工具（by bus/car/plane），零冠词。\n【步骤】① by bus。② A. by ✓。③ B. on——on a bus（在车上），不表方式“乘车”，错。④ C. with——错。⑤ D. in——in a car 才有，错。\n【答案】A. by。\n【易错】by/on/in 交通工具冠词。\n【口诀/模板句】by bus by car 无冠词，on a bus 强调车上；交通方式 by 最常用，go to school by bus。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["介词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】by bus交通方式，by","【答案】by"],"pitfalls":["by"]},{"id":"ne10","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"连词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Hurry up, ____ you'll be late.","options":["and","but","or","so"],"answer":"or","analysis":"【审题】题干：Hurry up, ____ you'll be late. “否则”or。\n【语法点/词汇】or 否则。\n【步骤】① 否则迟到。② A. and——顺承，错。③ B. but——转折，错。④ C. or ✓。⑤ D. so——结果，错。\n【答案】C. or。\n【易错】and/or 逻辑。\n【口诀/模板句】Hurry up or 会迟，or 否则结果是；and 顺承 but 转，so 因果要辨识。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["连词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】祈使句+or否则，or","【答案】or"],"pitfalls":["or"]},{"id":"ne12","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"代词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"This book is ____.","options":["my","me","mine","I"],"answer":"mine","analysis":"【审题】题干：This book is ____. 表语位置“这本书是我的”，用名词性物主代词 mine。\n【语法点/词汇】my + 名词；mine = my + 名词。\n【步骤】① 后无名词 → mine。② A. my——后缺名词，错。③ B. me——宾格，错。④ C. mine ✓。⑤ D. I——主格，错。\n【答案】C. mine。\n【易错】my book 与 mine。\n【口诀/模板句】my 后有名 mine 独，This book is mine 最熟；名词性物主代词，独立也能作表语。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["代词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】名词性物主代词mine，mine","【答案】mine"],"pitfalls":["mine"]},{"id":"ne13","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"代词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"____ is important to learn English well.","options":["This","That","It","What"],"answer":"It","analysis":"【审题】题干：____ is important to learn English well. It 作形式主语。\n【语法点/词汇】It is important to do。\n【步骤】① It is important to learn。② A. This——This is important to learn 语义别扭，标准 It，错。③ B. That——错。④ C. It ✓。⑤ D. What——错。\n【答案】C. It。\n【易错】This/That 代 It。\n【口诀/模板句】It 形式主语站句首，to learn 是真主语；It is important to learn English，It 不可换成 This。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["代词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】It形式主语，It","【答案】It"],"pitfalls":["It"]},{"id":"ne14","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I ____ to school every day.","options":["go","goes","going","went"],"answer":"go","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ to school every day. every day 一般现在；I + go。\n【语法点/词汇】一般现在时习惯动作。\n【步骤】① every day → 现在。② A. go ✓。③ B. goes——三单，错。④ C. going——错。⑤ D. went——过去，错。\n【答案】A. go。\n【易错】I 后加 s。\n【口诀/模板句】every day 现在时，I go 不加 s；he she it goes 三单，主谓一致要一致。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】every day一般现在，go","【答案】go"],"pitfalls":["go"]},{"id":"ne15","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She ____ TV now.","options":["watches","watched","is watching","watch"],"answer":"is watching","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ____ TV now. now 现在进行时。\n【语法点/词汇】is watching。\n【步骤】① now → 进行。② A. watches——错。③ B. watched——错。④ C. is watching ✓。⑤ D. watch——错。\n【答案】C. is watching。\n【易错】now 用一般现在。\n【口诀/模板句】now 标进行时，She is watching TV；be doing 结构清，说话当下正在看。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】now现在进行，is watching","【答案】is watching"],"pitfalls":["is watching"]},{"id":"ne16","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"They ____ football yesterday.","options":["play","played","are playing","will play"],"answer":"played","analysis":"【审题】题干：They ____ football yesterday. yesterday 一般过去。\n【语法点/词汇】play → played。\n【步骤】① yesterday → 过去。② A. play——错。③ B. played ✓。④ C. are playing——错。⑤ D. will play——错。\n【答案】B. played。\n【易错】yesterday 用现在。\n【口诀/模板句】yesterday 过去式 played，踢球 yesterday 不用现；时间副词定过去，played 要加 ed。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】yesterday过去，played","【答案】played"],"pitfalls":["played"]},{"id":"ne43","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"冠词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He is ____ honest boy.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":"an","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ____ honest boy. honest 首字母 h 不发音，元音音素开头。\n【语法点/词汇】an honest boy。\n【步骤】① honest /ˈɒnɪst/ 元音开头。② A. a——错。③ B. an ✓。④ C. the——泛指，错。⑤ D. /——缺冠词，错。\n【答案】B. an。\n【易错】看 h 字母用 a。\n【口诀/模板句】honest hour honor 用 an，h 不发音看音素；an honest boy 诚实，元音开头 an。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["冠词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】honest元音，an","【答案】an"],"pitfalls":["an"]},{"id":"ne44","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"数词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"There are ____ days in a year.","options":["three hundreds","three hundred","three hundreds of","hundreds"],"answer":"three hundred","analysis":"【审题】题干：There are ____ days in a year. 具体数字 + hundred，不加 s。\n【语法点/词汇】three hundred（具体）；hundreds of（成百上千，模糊）。\n【步骤】① 具体数量 three hundred。② A. three hundreds——有数字不加 s，错。③ B. three hundred ✓。④ C. three hundreds of——错。⑤ D. hundreds——缺 of，错。\n【答案】B. three hundred。\n【易错】数字 + hundred 加 s。\n【口诀/模板句】数字 hundred 不加 s，模糊 hundreds of 要 of；three hundred days 对，具体模糊两分说。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["数词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】hundred有数字不加s，three hundred","【答案】three hundred"],"pitfalls":["three hundred"]},{"id":"ne46","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Please ____ your shoes before entering.","options":["take off","take up","take in","take on"],"answer":"take off","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ your shoes before entering. 进门前“脱掉”鞋子。\n【语法点/词汇】take off 脱下/起飞；take up 占据；take in 吸收；take on 承担。\n【步骤】① 脱鞋 → take off。② A. take off ✓。③ B. take up——错。④ C. take in——错。⑤ D. take on——错。\n【答案】A. take off。\n【易错】take 短语互串。\n【口诀/模板句】take off 脱鞋起飞，take up 占据；take in 吸收 take on 担，脱鞋进门 off 选。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】进门脱鞋，take off","【答案】take off"],"pitfalls":["take off"]},{"id":"ne47","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He ____ my invitation.","options":["turned down","turned up","turned on","turned off"],"answer":"turned down","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ my invitation. 他“拒绝”我的邀请。\n【语法点/词汇】turn down 拒绝/调低；turn up 出现/调高；turn on 打开；turn off 关闭。\n【步骤】① 拒绝邀请 → turn down。② A. turned down ✓。③ B. turned up——出现/调高，错。④ C. turned on——打开，错。⑤ D. turned off——关闭，错。\n【答案】A. turned down。\n【易错】turn down 只当“调低”。\n【口诀/模板句】turn down 拒绝调低，turn up 出现调高；turn on off 开关，拒绝邀请 down 了。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】拒绝邀请，turned down","【答案】turned down"],"pitfalls":["turned down"]},{"id":"ne51","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"I am interested ____ science.","options":["at","in","on","to"],"answer":"in","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am interested ____ science. be interested in。\n【语法点/词汇】interested in。\n【步骤】① in science。② A. at——错。③ B. in ✓。④ C. on——错。⑤ D. to——错。\n【答案】B. in。\n【易错】interested to/on。\n【口诀/模板句】interested in 是固定，科学兴趣 in science；be interested in doing，介词 in 不移位。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】interested in，in","【答案】in"],"pitfalls":["in"]},{"id":"ne52","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He is good ____ math.","options":["at","in","on","for"],"answer":"at","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is good ____ math. be good at。\n【语法点/词汇】good at。\n【步骤】① at math。② A. at ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. on——错。⑤ D. for——错。\n【答案】A. at。\n【易错】good in/for。\n【口诀/模板句】good at 擅长 math，be good at 学科配；good for 有益 good to 对人好，at 数学最对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】good at，at","【答案】at"],"pitfalls":["at"]},{"id":"ne56","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Look! The children ____ in the park.","options":["play","played","are playing","have played"],"answer":"are playing","analysis":"【审题】题干：Look! The children ____ in the park. Look! 现在进行；children 复数。\n【语法点/词汇】are playing。\n【步骤】① Look! → 进行。② A. play——错。③ B. played——错。④ C. are playing ✓。⑤ D. have played——错。\n【答案】C. are playing。\n【易错】children is playing。\n【口诀/模板句】Look! 说话正进行，children 复数 are 跟；are playing in the park，现在分词加 ing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】Look! 进行，are playing","【答案】are playing"],"pitfalls":["are playing"]},{"id":"ne97","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He arrived ____ Beijing yesterday.","options":["in","at","to","/"],"answer":"in","analysis":"【审题】题干：He arrived ____ Beijing yesterday. arrive in + 大地点。\n【语法点/词汇】arrive in + 大城市/国家；arrive at + 小地点。\n【步骤】① Beijing 大地点 → in。② A. in ✓。③ B. at——小地点，错。④ C. to——arrive 不配 to，错。⑤ D. /——缺介词，错。\n【答案】A. in。\n【易错】arrive to / arrive in at 混。\n【口诀/模板句】arrive in 大地点，arrive at 小地点；Beijing 是城市用 in，arrive 不加 to。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】arrive in大地点，in","【答案】in"],"pitfalls":["in"]},{"id":"ne98","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"She is good ____ singing.","options":["at","in","on","with"],"answer":"at","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is good ____ singing. be good at doing。\n【语法点/词汇】good at。\n【步骤】① at singing。② A. at ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. on——错。⑤ D. with——错。\n【答案】A. at。\n【易错】good with（与……相处好）。\n【口诀/模板句】good at 擅长做，singing 动名词；be good at doing 记，with 是相处 in on 不对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】good at，at","【答案】at"],"pitfalls":["at"]},{"id":"ne136","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"Water ____ at 100°C.","options":["boil","boils","boiled","is boiling"],"answer":"boils","analysis":"【审题】题干：Water ____ at 100°C. 客观真理，三单 boils。\n【语法点/词汇】boils。\n【步骤】① 真理一般现在。② A. boil——缺 -s，错。③ B. boils ✓。④ C. boiled——过去，错。⑤ D. is boiling——进行，错。\n【答案】B. boils。\n【易错】is boiled。\n【口诀/模板句】水沸真理现在时，water boils 三单 s；客观事实不改时，boils at 100 degrees。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理，boils","【答案】boils"],"pitfalls":["boils"]},{"id":"ne137","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"冠词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"____ sun rises in the east.","options":["A","An","The","/"],"answer":"The","analysis":"【审题】题干：____ sun rises in the east. 独一无二的天体用 the。\n【语法点/词汇】the sun/moon/earth/world。\n【步骤】① sun 独一无二。② A. A——错。③ B. An——错。④ C. The ✓。⑤ D. /——错。\n【答案】C. The。\n【易错】天体前漏 the。\n【口诀/模板句】the sun the moon 独一，the earth the world 也统一；独一无二定冠词，The sun rises 东边。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["冠词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】世界独一无二，the sun，The","【答案】The"],"pitfalls":["The"]},{"id":"ne155","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"The sun ____ in the east.","options":["rises","rose","is rising","rise"],"answer":"rises","analysis":"【审题】题干：The sun ____ in the east. 客观真理 rises。\n【语法点/词汇】rises。\n【步骤】① 真理。② A. rises ✓。③ B. rose——过去，错。④ C. is rising——进行，错。⑤ D. rise——缺 -s，错。\n【答案】A. rises。\n【易错】三单漏 -s。\n【口诀/模板句】sun rises 是真理，三单加 s 要记清；一般现在表事实，rises in the east。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】客观真理，rises","【答案】rises"],"pitfalls":["rises"]},{"id":"ne191","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":1,"difficultyLabel":"基础","stem":"He often ____ to school by bike.","options":["goes","go","went","going"],"answer":"goes","analysis":"【审题】题干：He often ____ to school by bike. often 一般现在，He 三单 goes。\n【语法点/词汇】goes。\n【步骤】① often → 现在。② A. goes ✓。③ B. go——缺 -es，错。④ C. went——过去，错。⑤ D. going——错。\n【答案】A. goes。\n【易错】go 加 s 写成 gos。\n【口诀/模板句】often 现在三单，He goes to school；go 以 o 结尾加 es，by bike 方式要记。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】he第三人称，goes","【答案】goes"],"pitfalls":["goes"]},{"id":"ne221","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a good idea at the meeting.","options":["came up with","came on","came out","came across"],"answer":"came up with","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ a good idea at the meeting. “想出”好主意。\n【语法点/词汇】come up with 想出；come on 加油/上演；come out 出版；come across 偶遇。\n【步骤】① 想出主意 → came up with。② A. came up with ✓。③ B. came on——错。④ C. came out——错。⑤ D. came across——错。\n【答案】A. came up with。\n【易错】come 短语互串。\n【口诀/模板句】come up with 想出招，come out 出版了；come across 偶遇他，came up with idea。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】come up with想出（主意）","【答案】came up with"],"pitfalls":["came up with"]},{"id":"ne222","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the TV; the baby is sleeping.","options":["turn down","turn up","turn on","turn over"],"answer":"turn down","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ the TV; the baby is sleeping. 宝宝睡觉，把电视“调小声”。\n【语法点/词汇】turn down 调低；turn up 调高；turn on 打开；turn over 翻转。\n【步骤】① sleeping → 调小 → turn down。② A. turn down ✓。③ B. turn up——错。④ C. turn on——错。⑤ D. turn over——错。\n【答案】A. turn down。\n【易错】turn off 与 turn down（本题 down 更贴“小声”）。\n【口诀/模板句】baby sleeping turn down，音量调小别吵醒；turn up 调高 on 打开，over 翻转要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】孩子睡觉，调低音量turn down","【答案】turn down"],"pitfalls":["turn down"]},{"id":"ne223","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The plane ____ on time despite the fog.","options":["took off","took up","took out","took over"],"answer":"took off","analysis":"【审题】题干：The plane ____ on time despite the fog. 飞机“起飞”on time。\n【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞；take up 占据；take out 取出；take over 接管。\n【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took over——错。\n【答案】A. took off。\n【易错】take 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞了，on time 准时着；take off 起飞脱衣，despite fog 仍飞着。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】飞机起飞take off，过去","【答案】took off"],"pitfalls":["took off"]},{"id":"ne224","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a good habit of reading.","options":["developed","developed into","developing","development"],"answer":"developed","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ____ a good habit of reading. “养成”好习惯。\n【语法点/词汇】develop a habit（养成习惯）；develop into 发展成；developing 现在分词；development 名词。\n【步骤】① develop a habit。② A. developed ✓。③ B. developed into——需宾语“成……”，错。④ C. developing——缺谓语，错。⑤ D. development——名词，错。\n【答案】A. developed。\n【易错】develop/develop into。\n【口诀/模板句】develop a habit 养成习，develop into 成长成；developed 过去式，养成习惯 of reading。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】develop habit养成习惯，developed","【答案】developed"],"pitfalls":["developed"]},{"id":"ne225","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"We should ____ good habits.","options":["form","build","make","do"],"answer":"form","analysis":"【审题】题干：We should ____ good habits. “养成”好习惯。\n【语法点/词汇】form/develop good habits；build 一般不与 habits 搭；make 也少见；do 不搭。\n【步骤】① form habits（养成习惯）。② A. form ✓。③ B. build——build habits 非标准，错。④ C. make——make habits 不自然，错。⑤ D. do——错。\n【答案】A. form。\n【易错】form/build/make 混。\n【口诀/模板句】form/develop a habit 养成习，form habits 固定语；build make 不搭 habit，form good habits 最相宜。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】form good habits养成好习惯，form","【答案】form"],"pitfalls":["form"]},{"id":"ne226","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ of the danger.","options":["aware","awake","award","away"],"answer":"aware","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ____ of the danger. “意识到”危险。\n【语法点/词汇】be aware of（意识到）；awake 醒着；award 奖；away 离开。\n【步骤】① aware of the danger。② A. aware ✓。③ B. awake——醒着，错。④ C. award——名词，错。⑤ D. away——副词，错。\n【答案】A. aware。\n【易错】aware/awake。\n【口诀/模板句】aware of 意识到，danger 前 be aware；awake 醒着 award 奖，aware of danger 最要。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be aware of意识到，aware","【答案】aware"],"pitfalls":["aware"]},{"id":"ne227","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book ____ 5 chapters.","options":["consists of","consists in","makes up","composes"],"answer":"consists of","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book ____ 5 chapters. “由……组成”。\n【语法点/词汇】consist of（由……组成）；consist in 在于；make up 组成（主语是部分）；compose 编写。\n【步骤】① 书包括5章 → consists of。② A. consists of ✓。③ B. consists in——在于，错。④ C. makes up——主语应是“5章构成书”，错。⑤ D. composes——compose of 不这样用，错。\n【答案】A. consists of。\n【易错】consist of/in；make up 方向。\n【口诀/模板句】consist of 由组成，consist in 在于理；make up 部分组成整体，book consists of 5 chapters。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】consist of包含，由……组成","【答案】consists of"],"pitfalls":["consists of"]},{"id":"ne228","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his opinion at the meeting.","options":["expressed","expressed himself","expressive","expression"],"answer":"expressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ his opinion at the meeting. “表达”观点。\n【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；express oneself 表达自己。\n【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. expressed himself——后应无 opinion 或为表达自己，结构冲突，错。④ C. expressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. expression——名词，错。\n【答案】A. expressed。\n【易错】express oneself 与 express one's opinion。\n【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，express oneself 表自己；opinion 前用 expressed，表达观点 his opinion。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】express opinion表达观点，expressed","【答案】expressed"],"pitfalls":["expressed"]},{"id":"ne229","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ his name at the moment.","options":["recall","remind","remember to","memory"],"answer":"recall","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ____ his name at the moment. “想起”名字。\n【语法点/词汇】recall 回想起；remind 提醒（人）；remember to do 记得去做；memory 名词。\n【步骤】① 想起名字 → recall。② A. recall ✓。③ B. remind——remind sb. of，错。④ C. remember to——后应接动词，结构不全，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。\n【答案】A. recall。\n【易错】recall/remind/remember。\n【口诀/模板句】recall 想起某事，remind 提醒某人；remember to do 记去做，can't recall his name。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】recall回忆，想不起名字","【答案】recall"],"pitfalls":["recall"]},{"id":"ne230","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ me to post the letter.","options":["remind","remember","recall","memory"],"answer":"remind","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ me to post the letter. “提醒”我寄信。\n【语法点/词汇】remind sb. to do（提醒某人做）。\n【步骤】① remind me to post。② A. remind ✓。③ B. remember——remember to do 是自己记得，错。④ C. recall——想起，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。\n【答案】A. remind。\n【易错】remind/remember。\n【口诀/模板句】remind sb. to do 提醒，remember to do 自己记；Please remind me to post，提醒寄信用 remind。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】remind sb to do，提醒某人","【答案】remind"],"pitfalls":["remind"]},{"id":"ne231","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a lot of time on the project.","options":["spent","took","cost","paid"],"answer":"spent","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ a lot of time on the project. spend time on sth.\n【语法点/词汇】spend + 时间/钱 + on sth. / (in) doing。\n【步骤】① He spent time on the project。② A. spent ✓。③ B. took——It took him time，主语应是 It，错。④ C. cost——物 cost 钱，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay 钱 for，错。\n【答案】A. spent。\n【易错】四花费混用。\n【口诀/模板句】spend 人 time/money on，took It 开头；cost 物值 paid 人 for，spent on project。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】spend time on，人花时间","【答案】spent"],"pitfalls":["spent"]},{"id":"ne232","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The house ____ him 2 million yuan.","options":["cost","spent","took","paid"],"answer":"cost","analysis":"【审题】题干：The house ____ him 2 million yuan. 物“花费”某人多少钱。\n【语法点/词汇】sth. cost sb. money。\n【步骤】① The house cost him。② A. cost ✓。③ B. spent——人 spend，错。④ C. took——It took sb. time/money 少见且主语 It，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay，错。\n【答案】A. cost。\n【易错】cost/spend。\n【口诀/模板句】物 cost 人钱，The house cost him；人 spend 物 cost，主语定动词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】cost主语物，房子花了他","【答案】cost"],"pitfalls":["cost"]},{"id":"ne233","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ 100 yuan for the book.","options":["paid","spent","cost","took"],"answer":"paid","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ 100 yuan for the book. pay money for sth.\n【语法点/词汇】pay + 钱 + for sth.。\n【步骤】① I paid 100 yuan for。② A. paid ✓。③ B. spent——I spent 100 yuan on the book，介词不同，错。④ C. cost——物 cost，错。⑤ D. took——错。\n【答案】A. paid。\n【易错】pay for 与 spend on。\n【口诀/模板句】pay 钱 for 物，spend 钱 on 物；I paid 100 yuan for the book，介词 for 跟 pay。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pay for付钱","【答案】paid"],"pitfalls":["paid"]},{"id":"ne234","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"It ____ me 2 hours to finish it.","options":["took","spent","cost","paid"],"answer":"took","analysis":"【审题】题干：It ____ me 2 hours to finish it. It took sb. time to do。\n【语法点/词汇】took。\n【步骤】① It took me 2 hours to finish。② A. took ✓。③ B. spent——主语 I，错。④ C. cost——物，错。⑤ D. paid——人 for，错。\n【答案】A. took。\n【易错】took/spent。\n【口诀/模板句】It took me 2 hours，to finish 是后补；spend 主语才是人，took It 开头最稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】It takes sb time，花时间","【答案】took"],"pitfalls":["took"]},{"id":"ne235","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his best to help me.","options":["did","made","took","had"],"answer":"did","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ his best to help me. do one's best（尽最大努力）。\n【语法点/词汇】do one's best to do；make 无此搭配。\n【步骤】① do his best。② A. did ✓。③ B. made——make one's best 不成立，错。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。\n【答案】A. did。\n【易错】make one's best。\n【口诀/模板句】do one's best 尽力做，did his best to help；固定搭配 do best，make best 不对路。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】do one's best尽力，did","【答案】did"],"pitfalls":["did"]},{"id":"ne236","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ him since we graduated.","options":["haven't seen","didn't see","don't see","hadn't seen"],"answer":"haven't seen","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ him since we graduated. since 现在完成时。\n【语法点/词汇】haven't seen（否定完成）。\n【步骤】① since → 现在完成。② A. haven't seen ✓。③ B. didn't see——过去，错。④ C. don't see——现在，错。⑤ D. hadn't seen——过去完成，错。\n【答案】A. haven't seen。\n【易错】since 用过去式。\n【口诀/模板句】since 配完成时，haven't seen 否定式；since we graduated，从毕业至今没见。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】since毕业，现在完成否定haven't seen","【答案】haven't seen"],"pitfalls":["haven't seen"]},{"id":"ne237","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Look at the dark clouds. It ____ rain.","options":["is going to","will","shall","would"],"answer":"is going to","analysis":"【审题】题干：Look at the dark clouds. It ____ rain. 有迹象（乌云）表明即将下雨，用 be going to。\n【语法点/词汇】be going to 有迹象/计划；will 临时决定/预测。\n【步骤】① 乌云是迹象。② A. is going to ✓。③ B. will——无迹象时用，错。④ C. shall——第一人称征求意见，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。\n【答案】A. is going to。\n【易错】will/be going to。\n【口诀/模板句】迹象明显 going to，临时决定用 will；dark clouds 是迹象，is going to rain。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】乌云预示，be going to","【答案】is going to"],"pitfalls":["is going to"]},{"id":"ne238","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The work ____ well.","options":["is done","is doing","does","did"],"answer":"is done","analysis":"【审题】题干：The work ____ well. 工作被做得好，被动。\n【语法点/词汇】is done（be + 过去分词）。\n【步骤】① 工作被做 → is done。② A. is done ✓。③ B. is doing——主动进行，错。④ C. does——主动，错。⑤ D. did——过去主动，错。\n【答案】A. is done。\n【易错】is done 与 is doing。\n【口诀/模板句】work is done well，被动语态 be done；工作被做好 is done，主动被动要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】工作被做，被动is done","【答案】is done"],"pitfalls":["is done"]},{"id":"ne239","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ have told me earlier.","options":["should","would","could","might"],"answer":"should","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ have told me earlier. “本应该早点告诉我”（责备），should have done。\n【语法点/词汇】should have done 本该做（实际没做）。\n【步骤】① 责备“本应早说”→ should have told。② A. should ✓。③ B. would——would have done 虚拟，错。④ C. could——could have done 本能够，错。⑤ D. might——might have done 可能做过，错。\n【答案】A. should。\n【易错】should have done 否定形式 needn't have done。\n【口诀/模板句】should have done 本该做，本不该 needn't have；could have 本能够，would have 虚拟说。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】should have done本应该，should","【答案】should"],"pitfalls":["should"]},{"id":"ne240","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"You ____ have told me; I already knew.","options":["needn't","mustn't","can't","may not"],"answer":"needn't","analysis":"【审题】题干：You ____ have told me; I already knew. “你本不必告诉我”（我已经知道了）。\n【语法点/词汇】needn't have done 本不必做（实际做了）。\n【步骤】① already knew → 本不必说。② A. needn't ✓。③ B. mustn't——禁止，错。④ C. can't——不可能，错。⑤ D. may not——可能不，错。\n【答案】A. needn't。\n【易错】needn't have done 与 mustn't。\n【口诀/模板句】needn't have done 本不必，做了却说不必；mustn't 禁止 can't 不可能，needn't 最合 already knew。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】needn't have done本不必，needn't","【答案】needn't"],"pitfalls":["needn't"]},{"id":"ne242","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ you work hard, you will succeed.","options":["As long as","As soon as","As well as","As much as"],"answer":"As long as","analysis":"【审题】题干：____ you work hard, you will succeed. “只要”努力就成功。\n【语法点/词汇】as long as 只要；as soon as 一……就……；as well as 也；as much as 尽量。\n【步骤】① 条件“只要”→ As long as。② A. As long as ✓。③ B. As soon as——时间，错。④ C. As well as——并列，错。⑤ D. As much as——程度，错。\n【答案】A. As long as。\n【易错】as 短语从句混。\n【口诀/模板句】as long as 只要，as soon as 就；as well as 并列，as much as 尽量留；只要努力 succeed，As long as 条件。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】as long as只要，条件","【答案】As long as"],"pitfalls":["As long as"]},{"id":"ne243","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I have a lot of homework ____ tonight.","options":["to do","doing","done","do"],"answer":"to do","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of homework ____ tonight. have sth. to do。\n【语法点/词汇】to do。\n【步骤】① homework to do。② A. to do ✓。③ B. doing——错。④ C. done——错。⑤ D. do——错。\n【答案】A. to do。\n【易错】have sth. doing/done。\n【口诀/模板句】have homework to do 有作业做，tonight 将要做；to do 后置定语，不定式要记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】have sth to do，to do","【答案】to do"],"pitfalls":["to do"]},{"id":"ne246","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读主旨","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The passage mainly discusses ___.","options":["the importance of exercise","how to sleep well","how to eat healthy","how to work hard"],"answer":"the importance of exercise","analysis":"【审题】题干：The passage mainly discusses ___. mainly 主旨题。\n【语法点/词汇】主旨题答案覆盖全文中心。\n【步骤】① mainly → 主旨。② A. the importance of exercise ✓（原文中心是锻炼重要）。③ B. how to sleep well——细节，错。④ C. how to eat healthy——细节，错。⑤ D. how to work hard——细节，错。\n【答案】A. the importance of exercise。\n【易错】选细节。\n【口诀/模板句】mainly 主旨题，全文中心一句话；exercise importance 是主旨，sleep eat work 都是细节。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读主旨","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】主旨题，讨论锻炼重要性","【答案】the importance of exercise"],"pitfalls":["the importance of exercise"]},{"id":"ne247","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读细节","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"How often should we exercise according to the passage?","options":["3 times a week","every day","once a week","twice a month"],"answer":"3 times a week","analysis":"【审题】题干：How often should we exercise according to the passage? 细节题，问频率。\n【语法点/词汇】How often 问频率；答案3 times a week。\n【步骤】① How often → 频率。② A. 3 times a week ✓（原文说每周3次）。③ B. every day——错。④ C. once a week——错。⑤ D. twice a month——错。\n【答案】A. 3 times a week。\n【易错】看错频率单位。\n【口诀/模板句】How often 问频率，3 times a week 一周三；细节定位原文，week/month 要看清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读细节","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题，一周三次","【答案】3 times a week"],"pitfalls":["3 times a week"]},{"id":"ne248","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读词义","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The word \"beneficial\" means ___.","options":["helpful","harmful","useless","important"],"answer":"helpful","analysis":"【审题】题干：The word \"beneficial\" means ___. 词义题。\n【语法点/词汇】beneficial = beneficial to（有益的）= helpful。\n【步骤】① beneficial 有益的。② A. helpful ✓。③ B. harmful——有害，反义，错。④ C. useless——无用，反义，错。⑤ D. important——重要，不等义，错。\n【答案】A. helpful。\n【易错】beneficial 与 beneficial 的反义 harmful。\n【口诀/模板句】beneficial 是有益，helpful 同义是正解；harmful useless 是反义，important 不等义。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读词义","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】beneficial有益=helpful","【答案】helpful"],"pitfalls":["helpful"]},{"id":"ne256","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is ____ about the result.","options":["anxious","anxiety","anxiously","anxiousness"],"answer":"anxious","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ____ about the result. be 后形容词。\n【语法点/词汇】anxious（焦虑的）形容词；anxiety 名词；anxiously 副词；anxiousness 名词。\n【步骤】① be + 形容词。② A. anxious ✓。③ B. anxiety——名词，错。④ C. anxiously——副词，错。⑤ D. anxiousness——名词，错。\n【答案】A. anxious。\n【易错】词形家族。\n【口诀/模板句】anxious 形容焦虑，be anxious about 结果；anxiety 名词 anxiously 副，词性判断要记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be anxious about，形容词anxious","【答案】anxious"],"pitfalls":["anxious"]},{"id":"ne257","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The film ____ me deeply.","options":["impressed","impression","impressive","impressively"],"answer":"impressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：The film ____ me deeply. 谓语动词“打动”。\n【语法点/词汇】impress 打动，过去式 impressed；impression 名词；impressive 形容词；impressively 副词。\n【步骤】① 谓语动词。② A. impressed ✓。③ B. impression——名词，错。④ C. impressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. impressively——副词，错。\n【答案】A. impressed。\n【易错】词性。\n【口诀/模板句】film impressed me，打动用动词过去式；impression 名词 impressive 形，句子缺谓语选动词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】impress动词，电影打动我impressed","【答案】impressed"],"pitfalls":["impressed"]},{"id":"ne258","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ of his mistakes.","options":["conscious","consciousness","consciously","conscience"],"answer":"conscious","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ____ of his mistakes. be + 形容词 + of。\n【语法点/词汇】be conscious of（意识到）；consciousness 名词；consciously 副词；conscience 良心。\n【步骤】① be conscious of。② A. conscious ✓。③ B. consciousness——名词，错。④ C. consciously——副词，错。⑤ D. conscience——名词，错。\n【答案】A. conscious。\n【易错】conscious/conscience。\n【口诀/模板句】conscious of 意识到，be conscious of mistakes；conscience 良心是名词，词性辨析要仔细。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be conscious of意识到，conscious","【答案】conscious"],"pitfalls":["conscious"]},{"id":"ne259","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ the meaning of this word.","options":["figure out","figure on","figure in","figure up"],"answer":"figure out","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ____ the meaning of this word. “弄明白”意思。\n【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；figure on 打算；figure in 算进；figure up 计算总和。\n【步骤】① figure out the meaning。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. figure on——打算，错。④ C. figure in——错。⑤ D. figure up——错。\n【答案】A. figure out。\n【易错】figure 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，figure on 打算来；figure in 算进去 figure up 算总，figure out meaning。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】figure out弄明白","【答案】figure out"],"pitfalls":["figure out"]},{"id":"ne260","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ me a favor.","options":["do","make","take","give"],"answer":"do","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ me a favor. do sb. a favor（帮某人忙）。\n【语法点/词汇】do a favor。\n【步骤】① do me a favor。② A. do ✓。③ B. make——make 不搭 favor，错。④ C. take——错。⑤ D. give——错。\n【答案】A. do。\n【易错】make a favor。\n【口诀/模板句】do sb. a favor 帮个忙，do me a favor 是常用；make take give 不搭，do favor 记心上。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】do sb a favor帮忙，固定","【答案】do"],"pitfalls":["do"]},{"id":"ne261","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a living by teaching.","options":["makes","does","takes","gets"],"answer":"makes","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ a living by teaching. make a living（谋生）。\n【语法点/词汇】make a living by doing。\n【步骤】① makes a living。② A. makes ✓。③ B. does——错。④ C. takes——错。⑤ D. gets——get a living 少见，错。\n【答案】A. makes。\n【易错】make/do a living。\n【口诀/模板句】make a living 谋生计，by teaching 方式清；make a living by doing，do get take 不行。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make a living谋生，固定","【答案】makes"],"pitfalls":["makes"]},{"id":"ne262","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ a photo of the document.","options":["make","take","do","get"],"answer":"take","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ a photo of the document. take a photo（拍照）。\n【语法点/词汇】take a photo/picture；make a photo 不成立。\n【步骤】① take a photo。② A. make——错。③ B. take ✓。④ C. do——错。⑤ D. get——错。\n【答案】B. take。\n【易错】make a photo。\n【口诀/模板句】take a photo 拍张照，take a picture 也同理；make do get 不搭 photo，take photo 记心里。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】take a photo拍照，固定","【答案】take"],"pitfalls":["take"]},{"id":"ne263","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ in the rain.","options":["caught","catching","catch","catches"],"answer":"caught","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ____ in the rain. be caught in the rain（被雨淋/遇雨）。\n【语法点/词汇】be caught in（被困在）。\n【步骤】① be caught in the rain。② A. caught ✓。③ B. catching——主动，错。④ C. catch——原形，错。⑤ D. catches——三单，错。\n【答案】A. caught。\n【易错】be caught in 与 be catching。\n【口诀/模板句】be caught in the rain 遇雨，caught 过去分词被动；was caught in 固定，caught in rain 最有趣。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be caught in遭遇雨，caught","【答案】caught"],"pitfalls":["caught"]},{"id":"ne264","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am ____ looking forward to the trip.","options":["really","real","reality","realize"],"answer":"really","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am ____ looking forward to the trip. 修饰 looking forward 用副词。\n【语法点/词汇】really 副词“真的”；real 形容词；reality 名词；realize 动词。\n【步骤】① 修饰动词短语用副词。② A. really ✓。③ B. real——形容词，错。④ C. reality——名词，错。⑤ D. realize——动词，错。\n【答案】A. really。\n【易错】real/really。\n【口诀/模板句】really 副词修动词，I am really looking forward；real 形容 reality 名，词性位置要清楚。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】副词修饰looking forward，really","【答案】really"],"pitfalls":["really"]},{"id":"ne265","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He made a ____ contribution to the project.","options":["significant","significance","significantly","signify"],"answer":"significant","analysis":"【审题】题干：He made a ____ contribution to the project. 名词 contribution 前用形容词。\n【语法点/词汇】significant 形容词“重大的”；significance 名词；significantly 副词；signify 动词。\n【步骤】① a ____ contribution，定语形容词。② A. significant ✓。③ B. significance——名词，错。④ C. significantly——副词，错。⑤ D. signify——动词，错。\n【答案】A. significant。\n【易错】词性。\n【口诀/模板句】significant 形容重大，a significant contribution；significance 名词 significantly 副，名词前面用形容。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】形容词significant修饰contribution","【答案】significant"],"pitfalls":["significant"]},{"id":"ne266","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the story is that honesty is the best policy.","options":["moral","morale","moralize","morally"],"answer":"moral","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ____ of the story is that honesty is the best policy. 故事的“寓意”。\n【语法点/词汇】moral 寓意/道德；morale 士气；moralize 说教；morally 副词。\n【步骤】① the moral of the story（故事寓意）。② A. moral ✓。③ B. morale——士气，错。④ C. moralize——动词，错。⑤ D. morally——副词，错。\n【答案】A. moral。\n【易错】moral/morale。\n【口诀/模板句】the moral of the story 寓意，honesty is the best policy；morale 士气 moralize 说，寓意名词 moral。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】moral寓意，故事的教训","【答案】moral"],"pitfalls":["moral"]},{"id":"ne267","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his opinion on the matter.","options":["expressed","explained","exposed","explored"],"answer":"expressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ his opinion on the matter. “表达”观点。\n【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；explain 解释；expose 暴露；explore 探索。\n【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. explained——explain 一般 explain sth. to sb.，不与 opinion 直接搭，错。④ C. exposed——暴露，错。⑤ D. explored——探索，错。\n【答案】A. expressed。\n【易错】express/explain。\n【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，explain 解释给谁听；expose 暴露 explore 探，express opinion 最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】express opinion表达观点，expressed","【答案】expressed"],"pitfalls":["expressed"]},{"id":"ne268","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the form before you leave.","options":["fill out","fill in","fill up","fill with"],"answer":"fill out","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ the form before you leave. 填表。\n【语法点/词汇】fill out 填完整表；fill in 填空。\n【步骤】① fill out the form（填表）。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题答案 out（强调填整张表）。④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。\n【答案】A. fill out。\n【易错】fill in/out。\n【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，fill in 填空好；the form 前 fill out，填表离开 out 稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】fill out填写表格，固定","【答案】fill out"],"pitfalls":["fill out"]},{"id":"ne269","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the new law is to protect consumers.","options":["purpose","aim","goal","target"],"answer":"purpose","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ____ of the new law is to protect consumers. 法律的“目的”。\n【语法点/词汇】purpose 目的（the purpose of）；aim/goal/target 也可表目标，但 the purpose of 是固定。\n【步骤】① the purpose of the law。② A. purpose ✓。③ B. aim——the aim of 也可，但 purpose 更正式常见，本题答案 purpose。④ C. goal——错。⑤ D. target——目标/靶子，错。\n【答案】A. purpose。\n【易错】purpose/aim/goal。\n【口诀/模板句】the purpose of 是目的，law purpose to protect；aim goal target 目标，purpose of law 最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】purpose目的，法律的目的","【答案】purpose"],"pitfalls":["purpose"]},{"id":"ne270","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a good example to us.","options":["set","made","did","took"],"answer":"set","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ a good example to us. set an example（树立榜样）。\n【语法点/词汇】set an example to sb.。\n【步骤】① set a good example。② A. set ✓。③ B. made——错。④ C. did——错。⑤ D. took——错。\n【答案】A. set。\n【易错】make an example。\n【口诀/模板句】set an example 树榜样，set a good example；make do take 不搭 example，set example 记心上。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】set an example树立榜样，set","【答案】set"],"pitfalls":["set"]},{"id":"ne271","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ why he did it.","options":["figure out","find out","look out","give out"],"answer":"figure out","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ____ why he did it. “弄明白”原因。\n【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；find out 查明；look out 小心；give out 分发。\n【步骤】① figure out why。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. find out——也可查明，但 figure out 更强调“想明白”，本题答案 figure out。④ C. look out——小心，错。⑤ D. give out——分发，错。\n【答案】A. figure out。\n【易错】figure out/find out。\n【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，find out 查清楚；look out 小心 give out 发，figure out why 选 A。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】figure out弄明白","【答案】figure out"],"pitfalls":["figure out"]},{"id":"ne273","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his coat and went out.","options":["put on","put up","put off","put out"],"answer":"put on","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ____ his coat and went out. “穿上”外套出门。\n【语法点/词汇】put on 穿上；put up 挂；put off 推迟；put out 扑灭。\n【步骤】① 穿外套 → put on。② A. put on ✓。③ B. put up——错。④ C. put off——错。⑤ D. put out——错。\n【答案】A. put on。\n【易错】put on/off。\n【口诀/模板句】put on 穿上衣，put off 推迟期；put up 挂 put out 灭，put on coat 出门去。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】put on穿上外套","【答案】put on"],"pitfalls":["put on"]},{"id":"ne274","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The fire was ____ soon.","options":["put out","put off","put up","put on"],"answer":"put out","analysis":"【审题】题干：The fire was ____ soon. 火被“扑灭”。\n【语法点/词汇】put out 扑灭；put off 推迟；put up 挂；put on 穿。\n【步骤】① fire 被扑灭 → put out。② A. put out ✓。③ B. put off——错。④ C. put up——错。⑤ D. put on——错。\n【答案】A. put out。\n【易错】put 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】put out 扑灭火，was put out 被动式；put off 推迟 up 挂 on 穿，fire put out 记心里。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】put out扑灭大火","【答案】put out"],"pitfalls":["put out"]},{"id":"ne275","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a new idea at the meeting.","options":["put forward","put off","put up","put on"],"answer":"put forward","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ____ a new idea at the meeting. “提出”新想法。\n【语法点/词汇】put forward 提出；put off 推迟；put up 挂；put on 穿。\n【步骤】① 提出想法 → put forward。② A. put forward ✓。③ B. put off——错。④ C. put up——错。⑤ D. put on——错。\n【答案】A. put forward。\n【易错】put 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】put forward 提出议，put forward a new idea；put off 推迟 up 挂 on 穿，put forward 最应当。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】put forward提出主意","【答案】put forward"],"pitfalls":["put forward"]},{"id":"ne5","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ your coat; it's cold outside.","options":["put on","put up","put out","put down"],"answer":"put on","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ your coat; it's cold outside. 外面冷，要“穿上”外套。\n【语法点/词汇】put on 穿上；put up 挂；put out 扑灭；put down 放下。\n【步骤】① cold → 穿上 → put on。② A. put on ✓。③ B. put up——错。④ C. put out——错。⑤ D. put down——放下，错。\n【答案】A. put on。\n【易错】put on/off。\n【口诀/模板句】cold outside put on 穿，put on your coat；put down 放下 up 挂 out 灭，put on 穿衣记心间。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】天冷穿上，put on","【答案】put on"],"pitfalls":["put on"]},{"id":"ne11","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"连词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ he is young, he knows a lot.","options":["Because","Although","If","When"],"answer":"Although","analysis":"【审题】题干：____ he is young, he knows a lot. 让步“虽然年轻却懂很多”。\n【语法点/词汇】Although/Though 虽然。\n【步骤】① 让步。② A. Because——因果，错。③ B. Although ✓。④ C. If——条件，错。⑤ D. When——时间，错。\n【答案】B. Although。\n【易错】Because 选。\n【口诀/模板句】Although 让步虽然，年轻却懂很多；Because 用因果 If 条件，Although 让步最贴切。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["连词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】虽然年轻，Although","【答案】Although"],"pitfalls":["Although"]},{"id":"ne17","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"We ____ each other since 2020.","options":["know","knew","have known","will know"],"answer":"have known","analysis":"【审题】题干：We ____ each other since 2020. since 现在完成时。\n【语法点/词汇】have known（know→knew→known）。\n【步骤】① since 2020 → 现在完成。② A. know——现在，错。③ B. knew——过去，错。④ C. have known ✓。⑤ D. will know——将来，错。\n【答案】C. have known。\n【易错】since 用过去。\n【口诀/模板句】since 2020 用完成，have known 从过去至今；know knew known 三级，完成时 have known。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】since完成，have known","【答案】have known"],"pitfalls":["have known"]},{"id":"ne18","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"By next year, I ____ here for 3 years.","options":["will work","will have worked","work","worked"],"answer":"will have worked","analysis":"【审题】题干：By next year, I ____ here for 3 years. by next year 将来完成时。\n【语法点/词汇】will have done（将来完成）。\n【步骤】① by next year → 将来完成。② A. will work——将来，错。③ B. will have worked ✓。④ C. work——现在，错。⑤ D. worked——过去，错。\n【答案】B. will have worked。\n【易错】by + 将来时间用将来完成。\n【口诀/模板句】by next year 将完成，will have worked；by + 将来时间，will have done 用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】By+明年将来完成，will have worked","【答案】will have worked"],"pitfalls":["will have worked"]},{"id":"ne20","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"English ____ in many countries.","options":["speaks","is spoken","spoke","speaking"],"answer":"is spoken","analysis":"【审题】题干：English ____ in many countries. 英语被说，被动。\n【语法点/词汇】is spoken（be + 过去分词）。\n【步骤】① English 被说 → is spoken。② A. speaks——主动，错。③ B. is spoken ✓。④ C. spoke——过去，错。⑤ D. speaking——非谓语，错。\n【答案】B. is spoken。\n【易错】主动被动。\n【口诀/模板句】English is spoken 被说，in many countries 范围；被动语态 be done，is spoken 记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】英语被说，is spoken","【答案】is spoken"],"pitfalls":["is spoken"]},{"id":"ne21","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The man ____ is talking to Mary is my teacher.","options":["which","who","whom","whose"],"answer":"who","analysis":"【审题】题干：The man ____ is talking to Mary is my teacher. 定语从句，先行词 man（人），从句缺主语。\n【语法点/词汇】who 指人主语。\n【步骤】① man 人。② 从句缺主语。③ A. which——物，错。④ B. who ✓。⑤ C. whom——宾格，错。⑥ D. whose——所有格，错。\n【答案】B. who。\n【易错】who/whom。\n【口诀/模板句】the man who is talking，人主 who 最常用；which 物 whom 宾 whose 所有，who 主语最不空。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】man人作主语，who","【答案】who"],"pitfalls":["who"]},{"id":"ne22","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"This is the house ____ I lived last year.","options":["which","that","where","when"],"answer":"where","analysis":"【审题】题干：This is the house ____ I lived last year. lived 不及物，缺地点状语。\n【语法点/词汇】where = in which。\n【步骤】① house 地点。② I lived 缺地点。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. where ✓。⑥ D. when——时间，错。\n【答案】C. where。\n【易错】which/where。\n【口诀/模板句】the house where I lived，地点 where 时间 when；I lived in the house，where 作状语。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】house地点，where","【答案】where"],"pitfalls":["where"]},{"id":"ne23","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will never forget the day ____ we met.","options":["which","that","when","where"],"answer":"when","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will never forget the day ____ we met. the day 时间，缺时间状语。\n【语法点/词汇】when = on which。\n【步骤】① the day 时间。② we met 缺时间。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. when ✓。⑥ D. where——地点，错。\n【答案】C. when。\n【易错】when/where。\n【口诀/模板句】the day when we met，时间 when 地点 where；forget the day when，时间状语 when 配。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】day时间，when","【答案】when"],"pitfalls":["when"]},{"id":"ne25","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"宾语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I don't know ____ he is right.","options":["that","if","what","which"],"answer":"if","analysis":"【审题】题干：I don't know ____ he is right. “是否”对。\n【语法点/词汇】if/whether 是否。\n【步骤】① 不确定“是否”。② A. that——陈述，错。③ B. if ✓。④ C. what——错。⑤ D. which——错。\n【答案】B. if。\n【易错】that 选。\n【口诀/模板句】don't know if 是否，if/whether 表是否；I don't know if he is right，是否对错 if 配。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["宾语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】是否，if","【答案】if"],"pitfalls":["if"]},{"id":"ne26","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I enjoy ____ books.","options":["read","reading","to read","reads"],"answer":"reading","analysis":"【审题】题干：I enjoy ____ books. enjoy doing。\n【语法点/词汇】enjoy reading。\n【步骤】① enjoy doing。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. reads——错。\n【答案】B. reading。\n【易错】enjoy to read。\n【口诀/模板句】enjoy reading 读书乐，enjoy doing 是固定；to read 不接 enjoy，reading books 最正确。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】enjoy doing，reading","【答案】reading"],"pitfalls":["reading"]},{"id":"ne27","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He decided ____ abroad.","options":["go","going","to go","went"],"answer":"to go","analysis":"【审题】题干：He decided ____ abroad. decide to do。\n【语法点/词汇】decide to do。\n【步骤】① decide to go。② A. go——缺 to，错。③ B. going——错。④ C. to go ✓。⑤ D. went——错。\n【答案】C. to go。\n【易错】decide doing。\n【口诀/模板句】decide to do 决定做，to go abroad 出国去；decide 后 to do，going went 不对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】decide to do，to go","【答案】to go"],"pitfalls":["to go"]},{"id":"ne28","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book is worth ____.","options":["read","reading","to read","being read"],"answer":"reading","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book is worth ____. be worth doing（值得做）。\n【语法点/词汇】be worth doing。\n【步骤】① worth reading。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. being read——错。\n【答案】B. reading。\n【易错】worth to do。\n【口诀/模板句】be worth doing 值得做，worth reading 值得读；to read 不配 worth，reading 主动表被动。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be worth doing，reading","【答案】reading"],"pitfalls":["reading"]},{"id":"ne31","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"You ____ finish the work today; it's not urgent.","options":["must","needn't","can't","may"],"answer":"needn't","analysis":"【审题】题干：You ____ finish the work today; it's not urgent. 不紧急，不必今天完成。\n【语法点/词汇】needn't 不必。\n【步骤】① not urgent → 不必。② A. must——必须，反，错。③ B. needn't ✓。④ C. can't——不能，错。⑤ D. may——可能，错。\n【答案】B. needn't。\n【易错】mustn't 禁止 vs needn't 不必。\n【口诀/模板句】needn't 不必 mustn't 禁，not urgent 用 needn't；不必今天 finish，needn't 最对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】不急不必，needn't","【答案】needn't"],"pitfalls":["needn't"]},{"id":"ne32","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The light is on. They ____ be at home.","options":["must","can","need","would"],"answer":"must","analysis":"【审题】题干：The light is on. They ____ be at home. 灯亮着，有证据“一定”在家。\n【语法点/词汇】must 表有把握推测。\n【步骤】① 灯亮证据 → must。② A. must ✓。③ B. can——可能，弱，错。④ C. need——实义动词/需要，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。\n【答案】A. must。\n【易错】must 推测 vs can't 不可能。\n【口诀/模板句】must 推测有证据，light is on 必在家；can 可能 need 需要，must be at home。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】肯定推测，must","【答案】must"],"pitfalls":["must"]},{"id":"ne36","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the new city is very fast.","options":["develop","development","developing","developed"],"answer":"development","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ____ of the new city is very fast. the 后名词。\n【语法点/词汇】development 名词；develop 动词；developing 发展中的；developed 发达的。\n【步骤】① the ____ of，名词。② A. develop——动词，错。③ B. development ✓。④ C. developing——形容词，错。⑤ D. developed——形容词，错。\n【答案】B. development。\n【易错】词形。\n【口诀/模板句】development 名词发展，the development of city；develop 动词 developing 形，the 后名词最稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】名词development，发展","【答案】development"],"pitfalls":["development"]},{"id":"ne37","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He made a careful ____ of the situation.","options":["analysis","analyze","analytical","analyst"],"answer":"analysis","analysis":"【审题】题干：He made a careful ____ of the situation. a + 形容词 + 名词。\n【语法点/词汇】analysis 名词；analyze 动词；analytical 形容词；analyst 分析师。\n【步骤】① a careful ____ of，名词。② A. analysis ✓。③ B. analyze——动词，错。④ C. analytical——形容词，错。⑤ D. analyst——人，错。\n【答案】A. analysis。\n【易错】analyze/analysis。\n【口诀/模板句】analysis 名词分析，make an analysis of；analyze 动词 analyst 人，a careful analysis。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】名词analysis，分析","【答案】analysis"],"pitfalls":["analysis"]},{"id":"ne38","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am looking forward ____ you soon.","options":["to see","to seeing","see","seeing"],"answer":"to seeing","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am looking forward ____ you soon. look forward to doing。\n【语法点/词汇】to seeing。\n【步骤】① look forward to doing。② A. to see——错。③ B. to seeing ✓。④ C. see——错。⑤ D. seeing——缺 to，错。\n【答案】B. to seeing。\n【易错】look forward to see。\n【口诀/模板句】look forward to seeing，to 介词动名词；to seeing you soon，介词 to 后 ing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look forward to doing，to seeing","【答案】to seeing"],"pitfalls":["to seeing"]},{"id":"ne39","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is used to ____ early.","options":["get up","getting up","got up","gets up"],"answer":"getting up","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is used to ____ early. be used to doing（习惯于）。\n【语法点/词汇】be used to doing 习惯；used to do 过去常常。\n【步骤】① 习惯早起 → getting up。② A. get up——错。③ B. getting up ✓。④ C. got up——错。⑤ D. gets up——错。\n【答案】B. getting up。\n【易错】be used to doing / used to do。\n【口诀/模板句】be used to doing 习惯于，used to do 过去常；is used to getting up，to 是介词 ing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be used to doing，getting up","【答案】getting up"],"pitfalls":["getting up"]},{"id":"ne40","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The meeting ____ until midnight.","options":["lasted","kept","spent","took"],"answer":"lasted","analysis":"【审题】题干：The meeting ____ until midnight. 会议“持续”到半夜。\n【语法点/词汇】last 持续。\n【步骤】① 持续 → lasted。② A. lasted ✓。③ B. kept——keep 应 keep doing/adj，错。④ C. spent——人 spend，错。⑤ D. took——It took，错。\n【答案】A. lasted。\n【易错】last/keep。\n【口诀/模板句】last 持续 until 中，the meeting lasted until；keep spent took 不对，lasted midnight。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】会议持续，lasted","【答案】lasted"],"pitfalls":["lasted"]},{"id":"ne41","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"It is ____ that he will succeed.","options":["likely","possible probably","maybe","perhaps"],"answer":"likely","analysis":"【审题】题干：It is ____ that he will succeed. It is likely that（很可能）。\n【语法点/词汇】likely 形容词，It is likely that；possible 常 It is possible for sb. to do；probably 副词；maybe/perhaps 副词。\n【步骤】① It is likely that 句型。② A. likely ✓。③ B. possible probably——两个词混，错。④ C. maybe——副词，错。⑤ D. perhaps——副词，错。\n【答案】A. likely。\n【易错】likely/possible。\n【口诀/模板句】It is likely that 有可能，likely 形容词；possible for sb. to do，probably 副词置句中。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】likely可能，It is likely","【答案】likely"],"pitfalls":["likely"]},{"id":"ne42","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the difference between the two words.","options":["say","speak","tell","talk"],"answer":"tell","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ the difference between the two words. tell the difference（说出区别）。\n【语法点/词汇】tell the difference；say/speak/talk 不与 difference 直接搭。\n【步骤】① tell the difference。② A. say——say sth.，错。③ B. speak——speak English，错。④ C. tell ✓。⑤ D. talk——talk with/to，错。\n【答案】C. tell。\n【易错】say/tell。\n【口诀/模板句】tell the difference 说区别，tell sb. sth. 告诉；say 内容 speak 语 talk 谈，tell difference 最固定。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】tell the difference辨别，tell","【答案】tell"],"pitfalls":["tell"]},{"id":"ne45","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词性转换","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She spoke ____ at the meeting.","options":["confidence","confident","confidently","confiding"],"answer":"confidently","analysis":"【审题】题干：She spoke ____ at the meeting. 修饰动词 spoke 用副词。\n【语法点/词汇】confidently 副词；confidence 名词；confident 形容词。\n【步骤】① 修饰 spoke 用副词。② A. confidence——名词，错。③ B. confident——形容词，错。④ C. confidently ✓。⑤ D. confiding——现在分词，错。\n【答案】C. confidently。\n【易错】词性。\n【口诀/模板句】spoke confidently 自信说，副词修动词；confident 形 confidence 名，词性要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词性转换","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】副词confidently修饰spoke","【答案】confidently"],"pitfalls":["confidently"]},{"id":"ne48","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The plane ____ at 8 a.m. yesterday.","options":["took off","took up","took out","took over"],"answer":"took off","analysis":"【审题】题干：The plane ____ at 8 a.m. yesterday. 飞机起飞。\n【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞。\n【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——占据，错。④ C. took out——取出，错。⑤ D. took over——接管，错。\n【答案】A. took off。\n【易错】take 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞，at 8 a.m. yesterday；take off 起飞脱衣，took off 过去式。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】昨天飞机起飞，took off","【答案】took off"],"pitfalls":["took off"]},{"id":"ne49","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will ____ the company while he is away.","options":["take over","take up","take in","take out"],"answer":"take over","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will ____ the company while he is away. 他离开，我“接管”公司。\n【语法点/词汇】take over 接管；take up 占据；take in 吸收；take out 取出。\n【步骤】① 接管公司 → take over。② A. take over ✓。③ B. take up——错。④ C. take in——错。⑤ D. take out——错。\n【答案】A. take over。\n【易错】take 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】take over 接管权，while he is away；take over the company，接替主管 take over。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】他不在接管，take over","【答案】take over"],"pitfalls":["take over"]},{"id":"ne50","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a new hobby last year.","options":["took up","took off","took out","took to"],"answer":"took up","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ____ a new hobby last year. “开始从事”新爱好。\n【语法点/词汇】take up 开始从事/占据；take off 起飞；take out 取出；take to 喜欢。\n【步骤】① 开始爱好 → took up。② A. took up ✓。③ B. took off——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took to——to 后应接 sth./doing，且语义“喜欢”，错。\n【答案】A. took up。\n【易错】take up/to。\n【口诀/模板句】take up 开始学爱好，take up a hobby；took up last year，过去式加 up。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】开始爱好，took up","【答案】took up"],"pitfalls":["took up"]},{"id":"ne53","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She is afraid ____ snakes.","options":["of","for","with","at"],"answer":"of","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is afraid ____ snakes. be afraid of。\n【语法点/词汇】afraid of。\n【步骤】① afraid of snakes。② A. of ✓。③ B. for——错。④ C. with——错。⑤ D. at——错。\n【答案】A. of。\n【易错】afraid for（为……担心）。\n【口诀/模板句】afraid of 害怕物，afraid for 为人忧；afraid of snakes 蛇，of 是固定。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】afraid of，of","【答案】of"],"pitfalls":["of"]},{"id":"ne54","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book is divided ____ 10 units.","options":["into","in","to","for"],"answer":"into","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book is divided ____ 10 units. be divided into（被分成）。\n【语法点/词汇】divide…into。\n【步骤】① divided into 10 units。② A. into ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. to——错。⑤ D. for——错。\n【答案】A. into。\n【易错】divide into/in。\n【口诀/模板句】divide into 分成份，be divided into 10 units；divide into 固定，into 不改成 in。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】divide into，into","【答案】into"],"pitfalls":["into"]},{"id":"ne55","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He succeeded ____ passing the exam.","options":["in","on","at","with"],"answer":"in","analysis":"【审题】题干：He succeeded ____ passing the exam. succeed in doing。\n【语法点/词汇】succeed in doing。\n【步骤】① succeeded in passing。② A. in ✓。③ B. on——错。④ C. at——错。⑤ D. with——错。\n【答案】A. in。\n【易错】succeed in/at。\n【口诀/模板句】succeed in doing 成功做，succeeded in passing；介词 in 是固定，in passing exam。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】succeed in，in","【答案】in"],"pitfalls":["in"]},{"id":"ne57","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ my homework when he came in.","options":["do","did","was doing","have done"],"answer":"was doing","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ my homework when he came in. when 从句过去，主句过去进行。\n【语法点/词汇】was doing。\n【步骤】① came in 过去点。② 主句正在做作业 → was doing。③ A. do——错。④ B. did——错。⑤ C. was doing ✓。⑥ D. have done——错。\n【答案】C. was doing。\n【易错】when 主从句时态。\n【口诀/模板句】when 过去式，主句 was doing；I was doing homework when he came in，进行背景过去点。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】came时正在做，was doing","【答案】was doing"],"pitfalls":["was doing"]},{"id":"ne58","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"By the time he arrived, the train ____.","options":["left","has left","had left","leaves"],"answer":"had left","analysis":"【审题】题干：By the time he arrived, the train ____. by the time + 过去，主句过去完成。\n【语法点/词汇】had done（过去的过去）。\n【步骤】① arrived 过去，火车离开更早 → had left。② A. left——同时，错。③ B. has left——现在完成，错。④ C. had left ✓。⑤ D. leaves——现在，错。\n【答案】C. had left。\n【易错】by the time 时态。\n【口诀/模板句】by the time 过去式，主句 had done；had left 过去完成，火车先走 he arrived。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】arrived之前离开，had left","【答案】had left"],"pitfalls":["had left"]},{"id":"ne59","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The work ____ by the team now.","options":["is done","is being done","was done","has done"],"answer":"is being done","analysis":"【审题】题干：The work ____ by the team now. now 现在进行被动。\n【语法点/词汇】is being done（现在进行被动）。\n【步骤】① now → 进行。② by the team → 被动。③ A. is done——一般被动，错。④ B. is being done ✓。⑤ C. was done——过去，错。⑥ D. has done——主动，错。\n【答案】B. is being done。\n【易错】is done 与 is being done。\n【口诀/模板句】now 进行被动式，is being done；工作正在被做 is being done，by the team 施动。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】now正在被做，is being done","【答案】is being done"],"pitfalls":["is being done"]},{"id":"ne60","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"主谓一致","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Neither he nor I ____ a doctor.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":"am","analysis":"【审题】题干：Neither he nor I ____ a doctor. neither…nor 就近原则，靠近的是 I。\n【语法点/词汇】就近原则：neither…nor…，be 与最近主语一致。\n【步骤】① nor I → am。② A. am ✓。③ B. is——he 靠近时用，此处 I 靠近，错。④ C. are——错。⑤ D. be——原形，错。\n【答案】A. am。\n【易错】就近原则。\n【口诀/模板句】neither nor 就近看，I am he is；Neither he nor I am，就近原则最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["主谓一致","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】就近I，am","【答案】am"],"pitfalls":["am"]},{"id":"ne61","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"主谓一致","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The teacher with students ____ coming.","options":["is","are","were","be"],"answer":"is","analysis":"【审题】题干：The teacher with students ____ coming. with 短语不是主语，主语是 teacher。\n【语法点/词汇】就远原则：with/along with/as well as 不影响主语单复数。\n【步骤】① 主语 teacher 单数。② A. is ✓。③ B. are——被 students 干扰，错。④ C. were——错。⑤ D. be——错。\n【答案】A. is。\n【易错】with 后名词当主语。\n【口诀/模板句】with 学生不影响，主语 teacher 用 is；with along with 就远，主谓一致看主语。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["主谓一致","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】with就远，teacher单数is","【答案】is"],"pitfalls":["is"]},{"id":"ne62","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book ____ cover is red is mine.","options":["which","that","whose","where"],"answer":"whose","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book ____ cover is red is mine. cover 是 book 的“封面”，所有格。\n【语法点/词汇】whose = of which，表“谁的/什么的”。\n【步骤】① the book's cover = whose cover。② A. which——错。③ B. that——错。④ C. whose ✓。⑤ D. where——错。\n【答案】C. whose。\n【易错】whose 只用于人。\n【口诀/模板句】whose 表所有格，book whose cover red；whose 可代人也可物，the book's cover 就是 whose。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】whose cover谁的封面","【答案】whose"],"pitfalls":["whose"]},{"id":"ne64","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will call you ____ I arrive.","options":["as soon as","as long as","as well as","as far as"],"answer":"as soon as","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will call you ____ I arrive. “一……就……”。\n【语法点/词汇】as soon as 一……就……；as long as 只要；as well as 也；as far as 就……而言。\n【步骤】① 时间“一到就打电话”。② A. as soon as ✓。③ B. as long as——条件，错。④ C. as well as——并列，错。⑤ D. as far as——范围，错。\n【答案】A. as soon as。\n【易错】as 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】as soon as 一……就，call you as soon as；as long as 只要 as well as 也，as soon as 时间。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】一到就，as soon as","【答案】as soon as"],"pitfalls":["as soon as"]},{"id":"ne65","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ it rains, we will stay at home.","options":["If","Unless","Though","Because"],"answer":"If","analysis":"【审题】题干：____ it rains, we will stay at home. 条件“如果”。\n【语法点/词汇】If 条件。\n【步骤】① 条件。② A. If ✓。③ B. Unless——除非，错。④ C. Though——虽然，错。⑤ D. Because——因为，错。\n【答案】A. If。\n【易错】Unless 混。\n【口诀/模板句】If 条件如果，it rains 主将从现；Unless 除非 Though 虽，If 条件最常见。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】如果下雨，If","【答案】If"],"pitfalls":["If"]},{"id":"ne66","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ran fast ____ he could catch the bus.","options":["so that","such that","in order to","as that"],"answer":"so that","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ran fast ____ he could catch the bus. 目的“以便”。\n【语法点/词汇】so that 以便（后接句子）；in order to 后接动词原形。\n【步骤】① 目的 → so that。② A. so that ✓。③ B. such that——搭配错，错。④ C. in order to——后接原形，此处是句子，错。⑤ D. as that——错。\n【答案】A. so that。\n【易错】so that/in order to。\n【口诀/模板句】so that 以便接句子，in order to 接动词；he ran fast so that he could，目的状语 so that。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】so that以便，为了赶上","【答案】so that"],"pitfalls":["so that"]},{"id":"ne67","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I have a lot of work ____ today.","options":["do","to do","doing","done"],"answer":"to do","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of work ____ today. have sth. to do。\n【语法点/词汇】to do。\n【步骤】① work to do。② A. do——缺 to，错。③ B. to do ✓。④ C. doing——错。⑤ D. done——错。\n【答案】B. to do。\n【易错】have sth. doing。\n【口诀/模板句】have work to do 有事做，to do 后置定语；today 将要做，to do 不要换成 doing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】work to do，不定式","【答案】to do"],"pitfalls":["to do"]},{"id":"ne68","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The teacher made us ____ the classroom.","options":["clean","to clean","cleaning","cleaned"],"answer":"clean","analysis":"【审题】题干：The teacher made us ____ the classroom. make sb. do（不带 to）。\n【语法点/词汇】make/let/have sb. do。\n【步骤】① made us clean。② A. clean ✓。③ B. to clean——make 不带 to，错。④ C. cleaning——错。⑤ D. cleaned——错。\n【答案】A. clean。\n【易错】make sb. to do。\n【口诀/模板句】make sb. do 裸奔，to 不能加中间；made us clean 被迫做，make let have 不带 to。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make sb do省to，clean","【答案】clean"],"pitfalls":["clean"]},{"id":"ne71","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is ____ for the meeting.","options":["responsible","response","responsibility","responsible to"],"answer":"responsible","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ____ for the meeting. be responsible for。\n【语法点/词汇】responsible 形容词。\n【步骤】① be responsible for。② A. responsible ✓。③ B. response——名词，错。④ C. responsibility——名词，错。⑤ D. responsible to——to 后缺宾语，结构不全，错。\n【答案】A. responsible。\n【易错】词性。\n【口诀/模板句】responsible for 负责，形容词 be responsible；response 名词 responsibility 责任，词性判断要仔细。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】responsible for，responsible","【答案】responsible"],"pitfalls":["responsible"]},{"id":"ne72","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The price is too ____ for me.","options":["high","expensive","dear","cheap"],"answer":"high","analysis":"【审题】题干：The price is too ____ for me. 价格“高”用 high，不用 expensive。\n【语法点/词汇】price is high/low；物 is expensive/cheap。\n【步骤】① price + high。② A. high ✓。③ B. expensive——主语应是物，错。④ C. dear——表“贵”少修饰 price，错。⑤ D. cheap——反义，错。\n【答案】A. high。\n【易错】price expensive。\n【口诀/模板句】price high/low 搭配，物 expensive/cheap；The price is high，价格高低用 high。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】price high，价格高，high","【答案】high"],"pitfalls":["high"]},{"id":"ne73","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ a mistake.","options":["did","made","took","had"],"answer":"made","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ____ a mistake. make a mistake（犯错）。\n【语法点/词汇】make a mistake。\n【步骤】① made a mistake。② A. did——错。③ B. made ✓。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。\n【答案】B. made。\n【易错】do a mistake。\n【口诀/模板句】make a mistake 犯个错，made a mistake 过去式；do take had 不搭 mistake，make mistake 记心里。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make a mistake，made","【答案】made"],"pitfalls":["made"]},{"id":"ne74","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ attention to your spelling.","options":["pay","take","give","make"],"answer":"pay","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ attention to your spelling. pay attention to。\n【语法点/词汇】pay attention to。\n【步骤】① pay attention to。② A. pay ✓。③ B. take——take attention 少见，错。④ C. give——give attention 非标准，错。⑤ D. make——错。\n【答案】A. pay。\n【易错】pay/take attention。\n【口诀/模板句】pay attention to 注意，固定搭配 pay attention；take give make 不配 attention，pay attention to spelling。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pay attention，pay","【答案】pay"],"pitfalls":["pay"]},{"id":"ne76","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The problem is easy to ____.","options":["solve","answer","reply","deal"],"answer":"solve","analysis":"【审题】题干：The problem is easy to ____. solve the problem。\n【语法点/词汇】solve 解决（问题）；answer 回答；reply 回复；deal 应对（with）。\n【步骤】① problem → solve。② A. solve ✓。③ B. answer——answer the question，不搭 problem，错。④ C. reply——reply to，错。⑤ D. deal——deal with，缺 with，错。\n【答案】A. solve。\n【易错】solve/answer。\n【口诀/模板句】solve problem 解决问题，answer question 回答题；reply to deal with，easy to solve。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】solve problem，solve","【答案】solve"],"pitfalls":["solve"]},{"id":"ne77","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a good education.","options":["received","accepted","got","took"],"answer":"received","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ____ a good education. “接受”教育。\n【语法点/词汇】receive an education（接受教育）。\n【步骤】① receive education。② A. received ✓。③ B. accepted——accept 是主观接受（offer），错。④ C. got——get education 少见，错。⑤ D. took——错。\n【答案】A. received。\n【易错】receive/accept。\n【口诀/模板句】receive education 接教育，receive 客观 accept 主观；received a good education，教育用 receive。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】receive education，received","【答案】received"],"pitfalls":["received"]},{"id":"ne78","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am ____ tired today.","options":["a bit","a bit of","bit","bits"],"answer":"a bit","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am ____ tired today. 修饰形容词 tired 用 a bit（有点）。\n【语法点/词汇】a bit + adj.；a bit of + 名词。\n【步骤】① a bit tired。② A. a bit ✓。③ B. a bit of——后接名词，错。④ C. bit——缺冠词，错。⑤ D. bits——复数，错。\n【答案】A. a bit。\n【易错】a bit/a bit of。\n【口诀/模板句】a bit tired 有点累，a bit of 加名词；a bit of water 一点水，a bit + 形容词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】a bit tired，a bit修饰形容词","【答案】a bit"],"pitfalls":["a bit"]},{"id":"ne79","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"There is ____ water in the bottle.","options":["a little","little","a few","few"],"answer":"a little","analysis":"【审题】题干：There is ____ water in the bottle. water 不可数，肯定“有一点”。\n【语法点/词汇】a little 一点（肯定）；little 几乎没有（否定）。\n【步骤】① 肯定有一点水 → a little。② A. a little ✓。③ B. little——否定“几乎没有”，错。④ C. a few——接可数，错。⑤ D. few——接可数，错。\n【答案】A. a little。\n【易错】a little/little。\n【口诀/模板句】a little 一点肯定，little 几乎没有；a few few 接可数，water 用 a little。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】a little不可数，肯定","【答案】a little"],"pitfalls":["a little"]},{"id":"ne80","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He has ____ friends, so he often feels lonely.","options":["few","a few","little","a little"],"answer":"few","analysis":"【审题】题干：He has ____ friends, so he often feels lonely. lonely 暗示朋友“几乎没有”。\n【语法点/词汇】few 几乎没有（可数否定）；a few 有几个（肯定）。\n【步骤】① lonely → 几乎没朋友 → few。② A. few ✓。③ B. a few——肯定“有几个”，与 lonely 矛盾，错。④ C. little——不可数，错。⑤ D. a little——不可数，错。\n【答案】A. few。\n【易错】few/a few。\n【口诀/模板句】few 几乎没有表否定，a few 有几个肯定；lonely 暗示 few friends，few friends feels lonely。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】few可数否定，孤独，few","【答案】few"],"pitfalls":["few"]},{"id":"ne81","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读主旨","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"What is the main idea of the passage?","options":["The importance of reading","How to make friends","The weather","The history"],"answer":"The importance of reading","analysis":"【审题】题干：What is the main idea of the passage? 主旨题。\n【语法点/词汇】main idea 全文中心。\n【步骤】① main idea → 主旨。② A. The importance of reading ✓（原文讲阅读重要）。③ B. How to make friends——细节，错。④ C. The weather——无关，错。⑤ D. The history——无关，错。\n【答案】A. The importance of reading。\n【易错】选细节。\n【口诀/模板句】main idea 主旨题，全文中心一句话；importance of reading 是主旨，make friends 是细节。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读主旨","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】主旨，阅读重要性","【答案】The importance of reading"],"pitfalls":["The importance of reading"]},{"id":"ne82","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读细节","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"According to the passage, why did the author go to Beijing?","options":["For business","For travel","For study","For a meeting"],"answer":"For study","analysis":"【审题】题干：According to the passage, why did the author go to Beijing? 细节题，问原因。\n【语法点/词汇】for + 目的。\n【步骤】① why → 原因。② A. For business——错。③ B. For travel——错。④ C. For study ✓（原文去北京求学）。⑤ D. For a meeting——错。\n【答案】C. For study。\n【易错】看错原因。\n【口诀/模板句】why 问原因 for study，细节题回文找；for business/travel/meeting 都排除，for study 是答案。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读细节","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节，作者去北京学习","【答案】For study"],"pitfalls":["For study"]},{"id":"ne83","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读词义","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The word \"benefit\" in line 5 probably means ___.","options":["advantage","interest","money","profit"],"answer":"advantage","analysis":"【审题】题干：The word \"benefit\" in line 5 probably means ___. 词义猜测。\n【语法点/词汇】benefit = advantage（好处、益处）。\n【步骤】① benefit 核心义“益处”。② A. advantage ✓。③ B. interest——兴趣/利息，不等义，错。④ C. money——金钱，错。⑤ D. profit——利润，过窄，错。\n【答案】A. advantage。\n【易错】benefit/profit。\n【口诀/模板句】benefit 是益处，advantage 同义；interest money profit 都偏，benefit = advantage。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读词义","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】benefit好处=advantage","【答案】advantage"],"pitfalls":["advantage"]},{"id":"ne85","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读细节","type":"choice","typeLabel":"阅读","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"How many people attended the meeting?","options":["About 20","About 30","About 40","About 50"],"answer":"About 30","analysis":"【审题】题干：How many people attended the meeting? 细节题，问人数。\n【语法点/词汇】How many + 可数复数。\n【步骤】① 人数 → 回文定位。② A. About 20——错。③ B. About 30 ✓（原文约30人）。④ C. About 40——错。⑤ D. About 50——错。\n【答案】B. About 30。\n【易错】看错数字。\n【口诀/模板句】How many 问人数，About 30 是答案；细节题回文找数字，30 people attended。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读细节","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题，大约30人","【答案】About 30"],"pitfalls":["About 30"]},{"id":"ne91","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The old building was ____ last year.","options":["pulled down","pulled up","pulled out","pulled over"],"answer":"pulled down","analysis":"【审题】题干：The old building was ____ last year. 旧楼被“拆除”。\n【语法点/词汇】pull down 拆除；pull up 拉起；pull out 拔出；pull over 靠边停车。\n【步骤】① 旧楼拆除 → pulled down。② A. pulled down ✓。③ B. pulled up——错。④ C. pulled out——错。⑤ D. pulled over——错。\n【答案】A. pulled down。\n【易错】pull 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】pull down 拆房子，was pulled down 被拆；pull up 拉起 out 拔 over 停，old building down。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pull down拆除建筑","【答案】pulled down"],"pitfalls":["pulled down"]},{"id":"ne92","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the form first.","options":["fill out","fill in","fill up","fill with"],"answer":"fill out","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ____ the form first. 填表。\n【语法点/词汇】fill out 填整张表。\n【步骤】① fill out the form。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题答案 out。④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。\n【答案】A. fill out。\n【易错】fill in/out。\n【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，the form 前 fill out；fill in 填空 up 装满 with 充，fill out form。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】fill out填表","【答案】fill out"],"pitfalls":["fill out"]},{"id":"ne93","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She has ____ a lot of progress.","options":["made","done","had","taken"],"answer":"made","analysis":"【审题】题干：She has ____ a lot of progress. make progress（取得进步）。\n【语法点/词汇】make progress。\n【步骤】① has made progress。② A. made ✓。③ B. done——错。④ C. had——错。⑤ D. taken——错。\n【答案】A. made。\n【易错】do progress。\n【口诀/模板句】make progress 取进步，has made a lot of progress；do had taken 不搭 progress，make progress 记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make progress，made","【答案】made"],"pitfalls":["made"]},{"id":"ne94","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will ____ the matter right away.","options":["look into","look up","look for","look after"],"answer":"look into","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will ____ the matter right away. “调查”这件事。\n【语法点/词汇】look into 调查；look up 查阅；look for 寻找；look after 照顾。\n【步骤】① 调查 matter → look into。② A. look into ✓。③ B. look up——查字典，错。④ C. look for——寻找，错。⑤ D. look after——照顾，错。\n【答案】A. look into。\n【易错】look 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】look into 调查事，look up 查阅词；look for 寻找 after 照顾，look into the matter。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look into调查，look into","【答案】look into"],"pitfalls":["look into"]},{"id":"ne95","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"My sister ____ my children when I am away.","options":["looks after","looks for","looks up","looks out"],"answer":"looks after","analysis":"【审题】题干：My sister ____ my children when I am away. 我不在，姐姐“照顾”孩子。\n【语法点/词汇】look after 照顾。\n【步骤】① 照顾 children → looks after。② A. looks after ✓。③ B. looks for——寻找，错。④ C. looks up——查阅，错。⑤ D. looks out——小心，错。\n【答案】A. looks after。\n【易错】look 短语。\n【口诀/模板句】look after 照顾人，looks after my children；look for 寻找 up 查 out 小心，look after 记。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look after照顾，looks after","【答案】looks after"],"pitfalls":["looks after"]},{"id":"ne250","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Experts suggest ____ minutes of exercise a day.","options":null,"answer":"30","analysis":"【审题】题干：Experts suggest ____ minutes of exercise a day. 阅读填空，问每天锻炼几分钟。\n【语法点/词汇】suggest + 名词/doing；数字填空要回原文找具体数字。\n【步骤】① 回原文找专家建议的分钟数。② 原文“Experts suggest 30 minutes of exercise a day”。③ 填 30。④ 注意单位是 minutes，只填数字。⑤ 其他数字（20/40/60）不符合原文。\n【答案】30。\n【易错】填成 30 minutes（题干已有 minutes）；或填别的数字。\n【口诀/模板句】阅读填空回原文，suggest 30 minutes；单位已有只填数，30 分钟每一天。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题，专家建议每天30分钟","【答案】30"],"pitfalls":["30"]},{"id":"ne251","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The best way to exercise is ____.","options":null,"answer":"walking","analysis":"【审题】题干：The best way to exercise is ____. 最佳锻炼方式。\n【语法点/词汇】the best way to do is doing/to do；填原文所给方式。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 best way。② 原文“The best way to exercise is walking”。③ 填 walking。④ 其他方式（running/swimming）不是“best”。\n【答案】walking。\n【易错】填 run/running。\n【口诀/模板句】best way is walking，原文原词最稳；阅读填空抄原文，walking 最佳锻炼。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节题，最好的方式是走路","【答案】walking"],"pitfalls":["walking"]},{"id":"en4103","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"see sb doing","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I saw him ____ across the street.","options":"walking","answer":"walking","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["非谓语","感官动词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I saw him ____ across the street. see sb. doing（看见正在做）。\n【语法点/词汇】see sb. do / doing。\n【步骤】① 看见他正在过街 → walking。② A. walking ✓（选项只有 walking，且题干考 see sb. doing）。③ 其他形式 walk/to walk/walked 不是本题答案。④ see him walking 强调动作片段。\n【答案】walking。\n【易错】see him walk（全过程）。\n【口诀/模板句】see sb. doing 片段，walking 正在穿；I saw him walking across，see him doing 记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】see sb doing看见正在过，walking","【答案】walking"],"pitfalls":["walking"]},{"id":"ne86","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The meeting will be held in ____.","options":null,"answer":"Room 301","analysis":"【审题】题干：The meeting will be held in ____. 阅读填空，问会议室。\n【语法点/词汇】be held in + 地点；专有名称 Room 301。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 meeting location。② 原文“held in Room 301”。③ 填 Room 301。④ 格式：Room 首字母大写 + 编号。\n【答案】Room 301。\n【易错】小写 room 301；漏 Room 只写 301。\n【口诀/模板句】阅读填空回原文，Room 301 大写 Room；会议地点原文找，Room 301 是答案。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节，301房间","【答案】Room 301"],"pitfalls":["Room 301"]},{"id":"ne87","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The speaker is from ____.","options":null,"answer":"Beijing","analysis":"【审题】题干：The speaker is from ____. 问演讲者来自哪里。\n【语法点/词汇】be from + 地点。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 speaker's origin。② 原文“from Beijing”。③ 填 Beijing。④ 专有地点名首字母大写。\n【答案】Beijing。\n【易错】小写 beijing。\n【口诀/模板句】from Beijing 来自北京，阅读填空原词；专有地名大写，Beijing 是答案。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节，演讲者来自北京","【答案】Beijing"],"pitfalls":["Beijing"]},{"id":"ne121","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The course lasts ____ weeks.","options":null,"answer":"8","analysis":"【审题】题干：The course lasts ____ weeks. 课程持续几周。\n【语法点/词汇】last + 时间段；数字填空。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 duration。② 原文“lasts 8 weeks”。③ 填 8。④ 题干已有 weeks，只填数字。\n【答案】8。\n【易错】填 8 weeks。\n【口诀/模板句】lasts 8 weeks 八周，单位已有填数字；阅读填空回原文，8 就是答案。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节，8周","【答案】8"],"pitfalls":["8"]},{"id":"ne122","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The deadline for application is ____.","options":null,"answer":"May 1st","analysis":"【审题】题干：The deadline for application is ____. 申请截止日期。\n【语法点/词汇】deadline for；日期填空。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 deadline。② 原文“May 1st”。③ 填 May 1st。④ 月份大写 + 序数词。\n【答案】May 1st。\n【易错】写 1 May / May 1（缺 th/st）。\n【口诀/模板句】deadline May 1st，日期格式月份大写；May 1st 是原文，序数词 1st 不忘记。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节，5月1日","【答案】May 1st"],"pitfalls":["May 1st"]},{"id":"ne174","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The library opens at ____ a.m.","options":null,"answer":"8:00","analysis":"【审题】题干：The library opens at ____ a.m. 图书馆开放时间。\n【语法点/词汇】at + 时刻。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 opening time。② 原文“opens at 8:00 a.m.”。③ 填 8:00。④ 格式：数字 + :00。\n【答案】8:00。\n【易错】写 8 / 8:00 a.m.（题干已有 a.m.）。\n【口诀/模板句】opens at 8:00 a.m.，图书馆开门时间；题干已有 a.m.，只填 8:00 不添。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节8点，8:00","【答案】8:00"],"pitfalls":["8:00"]},{"id":"ne175","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The writer's favorite sport is ____.","options":null,"answer":"basketball","analysis":"【审题】题干：The writer's favorite sport is ____. 作者最爱的运动。\n【语法点/词汇】favorite sport；运动名称填空。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 favorite sport。② 原文“basketball”。③ 填 basketball。④ 运动名小写。\n【答案】basketball。\n【易错】填 Basketball（大写）或别的运动。\n【口诀/模板句】favorite sport basketball，原文原词填；运动名称小写，basketball 是答案。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】细节篮球，basketball","【答案】basketball"],"pitfalls":["basketball"]},{"id":"ne207","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The writer believes time is ____ than money.","options":null,"answer":"more important","analysis":"【审题】题干：The writer believes time is ____ than money. 时间比金钱更……。\n【语法点/词汇】than 比较级；more important。\n【步骤】① 回原文找 comparison。② 原文“time is more important than money”。③ 填 more important。④ 比较级结构完整。\n【答案】more important。\n【易错】填 important（漏比较级）。\n【口诀/模板句】than 前比较级，more important than money；时间比金钱重要，more important 填。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】时间比钱更重要，more important","【答案】more important"],"pitfalls":["more important"]},{"id":"ne208","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"阅读填空","type":"blank","typeLabel":"阅读填空","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"We should spend time on ____ things.","options":null,"answer":"meaningful","analysis":"【审题】题干：We should spend time on ____ things. 把时间花在……的事情上。\n【语法点/词汇】spend time on + 名词；形容词修饰 things。\n【步骤】① 回原文找修饰 things 的词。② 原文“meaningful things”。③ 填 meaningful。④ 形容词位置正确。\n【答案】meaningful。\n【易错】填 meaning/mean。\n【口诀/模板句】meaningful things 有意义的事，spend time on meaningful；形容词修饰 things，meaningful 填。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["阅读填空","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】有意义的事，meaningful","【答案】meaningful"],"pitfalls":["meaningful"]},{"id":"et01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign language.","answer":"我们有必要掌握一门外语。","accept":["我们掌握一门外语是必要的"],"sample":"参考译文：我们有必要掌握一门外语。","scorePoints":["It is necessary for sb to do 结构译对","master 译为“掌握”而非“主人”","语序通顺"],"pitfalls":["调整语序"],"tags":["翻译","形式主语"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】我们有必要掌握一门外语。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign lan。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign language.\n【语法点/词汇】It is + adj. + for sb. + to do（对某人来说做……是……的）；master 掌握；foreign language 外语。\n【步骤】① 主干：It is necessary（这是必要的）。② for us（对我们来说）。③ to master a foreign language（掌握一门外语）。④ 汉语语序：对我们来说掌握一门外语是必要的 → 我们有必要掌握一门外语。⑤ 调整语序使中文通顺。\n【答案】我们有必要掌握一门外语。\n【易错】直译“它是必要的给我们”；master 译成“主人”。\n【口诀/模板句】It is adj. for sb. to do，先译动作再译性质；master 掌握 foreign 外语，语序调整成中文。","steps":["【秒懂考点】英译汉：It is necessary for sb to do","【第一步】it是形式主语，真正主语是to master a foreign language","【第二步】necessary必要，master掌握，foreign language外语","【第三步】翻译：我们有必要掌握一门外语"]},{"id":"et02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough practice.","answer":"没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。","accept":["没有充分练习我们就无法学好一门语言"],"sample":"参考译文：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。","scorePoints":["cannot…without 双重否定按中文习惯处理","practice 译“练习”","通顺"],"pitfalls":["双重否定"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough practice.\n【语法点/词汇】cannot…without…（没有……就不能……）双重否定表肯定条件；practice 练习。\n【步骤】① We cannot learn a language well（我们不能学好语言）。② without enough practice（没有足够的练习）。③ 中文习惯：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。④ 或：我们没有足够的练习就学不好语言。\n【答案】没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。\n【易错】译成双重否定“不……不……”别扭；without 漏译。\n【口诀/模板句】without enough practice，先条件后结果；cannot learn well 学不好，中文语序条件前。","steps":["【秒懂考点】双重否定：cannot...without...","【第一步】cannot...without，没有……就不能……","【第二步】learn a language well学好语言，enough practice足够练习","【第三步】翻译：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言"]},{"id":"et03","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。","answer":"It is important to keep practicing every day.","accept":["It's important to practice every day.","Keeping practicing every day is important."],"sample":"参考译文：It is important to keep practicing every day.","scorePoints":["形式主语 It is adj to do 或动名词主语","keep practicing","every day"],"pitfalls":["keep doing"],"tags":["翻译","写作句型"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】It is important to keep practicing every day. 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语","analysis":"【审题】题干：汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。\n【语法点/词汇】It is important to do（做……很重要）；keep doing（坚持做）；practice doing；every day 每天。\n【步骤】① “很重要”→ It is important to…。② “坚持练习”→ keep practicing。③ “每天”→ every day（时间状语置后）。④ 组合：It is important to keep practicing every day. ⑤ 核对：keep practicing 坚持练习，every day 时间，结构完整。\n【答案】It is important to keep practicing every day.\n【易错】keep to practice（错）；practice to keep；漏 every day。\n【口诀/模板句】很重要 It is important to do，坚持做 keep doing；practice doing 不接 to，every day 置句后。","steps":["【秒懂考点】汉译英：It is important to do","【第一步】很重要It is important，坚持练习keep practicing","【第二步】每天every day","【第三步】It is important to keep practicing every day"]},{"id":"et04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will become.","answer":"你练习得越多，就会变得越好。","accept":["练习越多，你就会越好"],"sample":"参考译文：你练习得越多，就会变得越好。","scorePoints":["the more…the more 结构","时态","通顺"],"pitfalls":["比较级句型"],"tags":["翻译","比较"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】你练习得越多，就会变得越好。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will bec。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will become.\n【语法点/词汇】the + 比较级…, the + 比较级…（越……越……）。\n【步骤】① The more you practice（你练习得越多）。② the better you will become（你就会变得越好）。③ 中文对仗：你练习得越多，就会变得越好。④ 或：越练越好。\n【答案】你练习得越多，就会变得越好。\n【易错】译成“越多越好”漏“练习”；will become 译成“将变成”。\n【口诀/模板句】the more the better 越…越，比较级句型对仗；you practice 你练习，will become 会变得。","steps":["【秒懂考点】The more...the better...，越……越……","【第一步】The more you practice你练习越多，the better you will become变得越好","【第三步】翻译：你练习得越多，就会变得越好"]},{"id":"et05","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。","answer":"The Internet makes our life more convenient.","accept":["The Internet has made our life more convenient."],"sample":"参考译文：The Internet makes our life more convenient.","scorePoints":["make + 宾语 + 形容词补语","convenient 拼写","主谓一致"],"pitfalls":["make用法"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】The Internet makes our life more convenient. 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时","analysis":"【审题】题干：汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。\n【语法点/词汇】make + 宾语 + 形容词（使……变得）；more convenient 更便利；the Internet 互联网。\n【步骤】① 主语 the Internet。② 使 → makes（一般现在表事实）。③ our life 宾语。④ more convenient 宾补。⑤ 组合：The Internet makes our life more convenient.\n【答案】The Internet makes our life more convenient.\n【易错】make our life to be more convenient（错）；convenient 用 more easy。\n【口诀/模板句】make + 宾 + 形容，使什么变得怎样；The Internet makes life more convenient，make 不加 to。","steps":["【秒懂考点】汉译英：make sth+形容词","【第一步】互联网The Internet，使makes，生活our life，便利more convenient","【第二步】The Internet makes our life more convenient"]},{"id":"ex20","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：Practice makes perfect.","answer":"熟能生巧。","accept":["熟能生巧"],"sample":"参考译文：熟能生巧。","scorePoints":["固定谚语","通顺"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":5,"pitfalls":["谚语"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】熟能生巧。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：Practice makes perfect.。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 熟能生巧。。 【易错】注意","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：Practice makes perfect.\n【语法点/词汇】谚语：Practice makes perfect = 熟能生巧。\n【步骤】① Practice 练习。② makes perfect 使完美。③ 字面：练习使人完美。④ 意译谚语：熟能生巧。\n【答案】熟能生巧。\n【易错】直译“练习使完美”生硬；漏译 makes。\n【口诀/模板句】Practice makes perfect，熟能生巧谚语；英译谚语用意译，对应中文成语。","steps":["【秒懂考点】谚语翻译","【第一步】Practice练习，makes使得，perfect完美","【第二步】熟能生巧"]},{"id":"enx35","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：Actions speak louder than words.","answer":"行动胜于言语。","accept":["行动胜于雄辩","事实胜于雄辩"],"sample":"参考译文：行动胜于言语。","scorePoints":["谚语准确","通顺"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":5,"pitfalls":["行动胜于言语"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】行动胜于言语。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：Actions speak louder than words.。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 行动","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：Actions speak louder than words.\n【语法点/词汇】speak louder than words（比言语更有说服力）；Actions 行动。\n【步骤】① Actions speak（行动说话）。② louder than words（比言语更响）。③ 意译：行动胜于言语。④ 对应谚语“事实胜于雄辩”。\n【答案】行动胜于言语。\n【易错】直译“行动说话更响”；漏 than。\n【口诀/模板句】Actions speak louder than words，行动胜于言语；谚语意译对仗，louder than words。","steps":["【秒懂考点】谚语：Actions speak louder than words，行动胜于言语","【答案】行动胜于言语"]},{"id":"enx36","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"汉译英：知识就是力量。","answer":"Knowledge is power.","accept":["knowledge is power"],"sample":"参考译文：Knowledge is power.","scorePoints":["名言准确","大小写"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":5,"pitfalls":["Knowledge is power"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】Knowledge is power. 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：汉译英：知识就是力量。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 Knowledge is po","analysis":"【审题】题干：汉译英：知识就是力量。\n【语法点/词汇】Knowledge is power（固定译法）。\n【步骤】① 知识 → Knowledge（抽象名词不可数）。② 就是 → is。③ 力量 → power。④ 组合：Knowledge is power.\n【答案】Knowledge is power.\n【易错】Knowledge are（错）；power 用 strength。\n【口诀/模板句】Knowledge is power，知识就是力量；抽象名词用单数，is power 最经典。","steps":["【秒懂考点】汉译英：Knowledge is power","【答案】Knowledge is power"]},{"id":"ecx1","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：The harder you work, the more progress you will make.","answer":"你越努力，进步就越大。","accept":["越努力，进步越大"],"sample":"参考译文：你越努力，取得的进步就越大。","scorePoints":["the more…the more 结构译出「越…越…」","progress 译「进步」","通顺"],"pitfalls":["你越努力，进步就越大"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】你越努力，进步就越大。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：The harder you work, the more progress you wil。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：The harder you work, the more progress you will make.\n【语法点/词汇】the + 比较级…, the + 比较级…（越……越……）；make progress 取得进步。\n【步骤】① The harder you work（你越努力工作）。② the more progress you will make（你取得的进步就越大）。③ 中文：你越努力，进步就越大。④ make progress 译“取得进步/进步”。\n【答案】你越努力，进步就越大。\n【易错】漏 the 比较级对仗；make progress 译“做进步”。\n【口诀/模板句】the harder the more 越努力越进步；make progress 取进步，比较级对仗译。","steps":["【秒懂考点】The more比较，越努力进步越大","【答案】你越努力，进步就越大"]},{"id":"enR1t","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：Many students find it hard to learn programming.","answer":"见参考译文","sample":"参考译文：练习（动手写代码）比只看书更重要。/ 按第一句翻译即可。","scorePoints":["核心动词准确","从句通顺","无漏译"],"pitfalls":["见参考译文"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":10,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】见参考译文 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：Many students find it hard to learn programmin。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：Many students find it hard to learn programming.\n【语法点/词汇】find it + adj. + to do（发现做……是……的）；it 形式宾语；programming 编程。\n【步骤】① Many students（许多学生）。② find it hard（发现它很难）。③ to learn programming（学习编程）。④ 整合：许多学生发现学编程很难。⑤ 参考译文：许多学生觉得学习编程很困难。\n【答案】见参考译文。参考译文：许多学生发现学习编程很难。（或：许多学生觉得学编程不容易。）\n【易错】find it hard 直译“发现它难”；programming 译成“程序”不准确。\n【口诀/模板句】find it adj. to do，形式宾语 it；programming 编程，find hard to learn。","steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译：很多学生觉得学编程很难","【答案】见参考译文"]},{"id":"enR2t","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：The Internet of Things (IoT) connects devices to the network.","answer":"见参考译文","sample":"参考译文：练习（动手写代码）比只看书更重要。/ 按第一句翻译即可。","scorePoints":["核心动词准确","从句通顺","无漏译"],"pitfalls":["见参考译文"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":10,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】见参考译文 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：The Internet of Things (IoT) connects devices 。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：The Internet of Things (IoT) connects devices to the network.\n【语法点/词汇】The Internet of Things (IoT) 物联网；connect A to B（把A连接到B）；devices 设备。\n【步骤】① The Internet of Things (IoT)（物联网）。② connects devices（连接设备）。③ to the network（到网络）。④ 整合：物联网把设备连接到网络。⑤ 参考译文：物联网（IoT）将设备连接到网络。\n【答案】见参考译文。参考译文：物联网（IoT）将设备连接到网络。\n【易错】IoT 不译；connect to 译“连上”漏“到”。\n【口诀/模板句】Internet of Things 物联网，connect A to B 连接到；devices 设备 network 网络，IoT 将设备连网。","steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译：物联网将设备连接到网络","【答案】见参考译文"]},{"id":"ne252","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Action speaks louder than words.","options":["行动胜于言辞","行动比话大声","做比说强","言不如行"],"answer":"行动胜于言辞","analysis":"【审题】题干：Action speaks louder than words. 英译汉选择。\n【语法点/词汇】speak louder than words（比言语更响亮/更有说服力）。\n【步骤】① Action（行动）② speaks louder（说得更响）③ than words（比言语）④ 意译：行动胜于言辞。\n【答案】A. 行动胜于言辞。\n【易错】选 B 直译“大声”；C/D 不完整。\n【口诀/模板句】Actions speak louder than words，行动胜于言辞；直译错意译对，louder than words。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】谚语，行动胜于言辞","【答案】行动胜于言辞"],"pitfalls":["行动胜于言辞"]},{"id":"ne253","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Easier said than done.","options":["说起来容易做起来难","说易做难","说容易做困难","易说难做"],"answer":"说起来容易做起来难","analysis":"【审题】题干：Easier said than done. 英译汉谚语。\n【语法点/词汇】Easier said than done（说起来容易做起来难）。\n【步骤】① Easier said（说更容易）② than done（比做）③ 意译谚语：说起来容易做起来难。\n【答案】A. 说起来容易做起来难。\n【易错】B/C/D 意思对但不完整规范。\n【口诀/模板句】Easier said than done，说起来容易做起来难；谚语意译要完整，said than done 对仗。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】谚语，说起来容易做起来难","【答案】说起来容易做起来难"],"pitfalls":["说起来容易做起来难"]},{"id":"ne88","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"It is important to learn English well.","options":["学好英语很重要","很重要学英语","学英语好重要","英语学好很"],"answer":"学好英语很重要","analysis":"【审题】题干：It is important to learn English well. 英译汉。\n【语法点/词汇】It is important to do（做……很重要）。\n【步骤】① It is important（这很重要）② to learn English well（学好英语）③ 中文：学好英语很重要。\n【答案】A. 学好英语很重要。\n【易错】B 语序错；C 不通顺；D 不完整。\n【口诀/模板句】It is important to learn，学好英语很重要；形式主语 it 译省，to learn English well。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，学好英语很重要","【答案】学好英语很重要"],"pitfalls":["学好英语很重要"]},{"id":"ne89","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book is worth reading.","options":["这本书值得读","这本书值读","书值得读","这书读值得"],"answer":"这本书值得读","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book is worth reading. 英译汉。\n【语法点/词汇】be worth doing（值得做）。\n【步骤】① The book（这本书）② is worth（值得）③ reading（读）④ 中文：这本书值得读。\n【答案】A. 这本书值得读。\n【易错】B “值读”不完整；C 漏“这本”；D 语序乱。\n【口诀/模板句】be worth reading 值得读，worth doing 主动表被动；The book is worth reading，值得读。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，这本书值得读","【答案】这本书值得读"],"pitfalls":["这本书值得读"]},{"id":"ne123","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Not only did he study hard, but he also helped others.","options":["他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人","他学习努力还帮人","不仅他学习努力","他学习好"],"answer":"他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人","analysis":"【审题】题干：Not only did he study hard, but he also helped others. 英译汉倒装句。\n【语法点/词汇】Not only…(but) also…（不仅……而且……）；Not only 放句首倒装。\n【步骤】① Not only did he study hard（他不仅努力学习）② but he also helped others（还帮助别人）③ 中文：他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人。\n【答案】A. 他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人。\n【易错】B 不完整；C 只译一半；D 意思不对。\n【口诀/模板句】Not only but also 不仅而且，倒装 did he study；他不仅学习还帮助，完整译 A。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，他不仅努力还帮助别人","【答案】他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人"],"pitfalls":["他不仅努力学习，还帮助别人"]},{"id":"ne124","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The more you read, the more you know.","options":["你读得越多，知道得越多","读越多越知道","你读知道多","读多知道多"],"answer":"你读得越多，知道得越多","analysis":"【审题】题干：The more you read, the more you know. 英译汉。\n【语法点/词汇】the more…, the more…（越……越……）。\n【步骤】① The more you read（你读得越多）② the more you know（知道得越多）③ 中文：你读得越多，知道得越多。\n【答案】A. 你读得越多，知道得越多。\n【易错】B/C/D 不完整。\n【口诀/模板句】the more the more 越…越，读得越多知越多；比较级句型对仗，you read you know。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，读越多知道越多","【答案】你读得越多，知道得越多"],"pitfalls":["你读得越多，知道得越多"]},{"id":"ne176","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is too young to go to school.","options":["他太小还不能上学","他太年轻不能上学","他太小上学","他够大上学"],"answer":"他太小还不能上学","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is too young to go to school. 英译汉。\n【语法点/词汇】too…to…（太……而不能）。\n【步骤】① He is too young（他太小）② to go to school（不能上学）③ 中文：他太小还不能上学。\n【答案】A. 他太小还不能上学。\n【易错】B “年轻”不如“小”自然；C 漏否定；D 意思反。\n【口诀/模板句】too young to go，太小不能上学；too…to 表否定，A 选项最合适。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】too...to，太小不能上学","【答案】他太小还不能上学"],"pitfalls":["他太小还不能上学"]},{"id":"ne177","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I have never seen such a beautiful place.","options":["我从没见过这么美的地方","我从未看美丽地方","我看没见过美","美丽地方我没"],"answer":"我从没见过这么美的地方","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have never seen such a beautiful place. 英译汉。\n【语法点/词汇】have never seen（从未见过）；such a beautiful place（如此美的地方）。\n【步骤】① I have never seen（我从没见过）② such a beautiful place（这么美的地方）③ 中文：我从没见过这么美的地方。\n【答案】A. 我从没见过这么美的地方。\n【易错】B/C/D 语序乱。\n【口诀/模板句】have never seen 从未见过，such a beautiful place 这么美；现在完成 never seen，从没见过这么美。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】从没见过这么美","【答案】我从没见过这么美的地方"],"pitfalls":["我从没见过这么美的地方"]},{"id":"ne209","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Where there is a will, there is a way.","options":["有志者事竟成","有意志有路","哪里有意愿哪里有路","有志气"],"answer":"有志者事竟成","analysis":"【审题】题干：Where there is a will, there is a way. 英译汉谚语。\n【语法点/词汇】Where there is a will, there is a way（有志者事竟成）。\n【步骤】① Where there is a will（哪里有意志）② there is a way（哪里有路）③ 意译谚语：有志者事竟成。\n【答案】A. 有志者事竟成。\n【易错】B/C/D 直译不完整。\n【口诀/模板句】Where there is a will there is a way，有志者事竟成；谚语意译对仗，will way 志路。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】有志者事竟成，有志者事竟成","【答案】有志者事竟成"],"pitfalls":["有志者事竟成"]},{"id":"ne210","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"英译汉","type":"choice","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Practice makes perfect.","options":["熟能生巧","练习完美","实践制造完美","练完美"],"answer":"熟能生巧","analysis":"【审题】题干：Practice makes perfect. 英译汉谚语。\n【语法点/词汇】Practice makes perfect（熟能生巧）。\n【步骤】① Practice（练习）② makes perfect（使完美）③ 意译：熟能生巧。\n【答案】A. 熟能生巧。\n【易错】B/C/D 直译。\n【口诀/模板句】Practice makes perfect，熟能生巧谚语；makes perfect 使完美，意译成语最贴切。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["英译汉","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】熟能生巧","【答案】熟能生巧"],"pitfalls":["熟能生巧"]},{"id":"et06","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"英译汉：Only by working hard can we achieve our goals.","answer":"只有通过努力工作，我们才能实现目标。","accept":["只有努力工作我们才能达成目标"],"sample":"参考译文：只有通过努力工作，我们才能实现目标。","scorePoints":["Only 置前引起部分倒装","by doing 译法","通顺"],"pitfalls":["倒装"],"tags":["翻译","倒装"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】只有通过努力工作，我们才能实现目标。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：Only by working hard can we achieve our goals.。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：Only by working hard can we achieve our goals.\n【语法点/词汇】Only + 状语 放句首，主句部分倒装（can we）；by doing（通过做）；achieve our goals 实现目标。\n【步骤】① Only by working hard（只有通过努力工作）。② can we achieve our goals（我们才能实现目标）。③ 倒装还原：we can achieve our goals。④ 中文：只有努力工作，我们才能实现目标。\n【答案】只有通过努力工作，我们才能实现目标。\n【易错】忽略倒装仍按陈述序译；by working hard 译“努力地工作”不准确。\n【口诀/模板句】Only 状语倒装，can we achieve；by working hard 通过努力，只有才 中文对。","steps":["【秒懂考点】Only倒装句：Only by...can we...","【第一步】only位于句首，部分倒装，can提前","【第二步】working hard努力，achieve goals实现目标","【第三步】翻译：只有通过努力工作，我们才能实现目标"]},{"id":"ne254","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"汉译英","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"翻译：“知识就是力量。”","options":null,"answer":"Knowledge is power.","analysis":"【审题】题干：翻译：“知识就是力量。”\n【语法点/词汇】Knowledge is power（固定译法）；抽象名词 Knowledge 不可数。\n【步骤】① 知识 → Knowledge（大写开头作句子主语）。② 就是 → is。③ 力量 → power。④ 组合：Knowledge is power.\n【答案】Knowledge is power.\n【易错】Knowledge are；power 用 strength。\n【口诀/模板句】Knowledge is power，知识就是力量；抽象名词单数 is，power 不用 strength。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["汉译英","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译Knowledge is power","【答案】Knowledge is power"],"pitfalls":["Knowledge is power"]},{"id":"ne90","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"汉译英","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"请把“他每天早上6点起床”翻译成英文。","options":null,"answer":"He gets up at 6 every morning.","analysis":"【审题】题干：请把“他每天早上6点起床”翻译成英文。\n【语法点/词汇】get up 起床；at 6 在6点；every morning 每天早上；一般现在时表习惯。\n【步骤】① 他 → He。② 起床 → gets up（三单）。③ 每天早上6点 → at 6 every morning。④ 组合：He gets up at 6 every morning.\n【答案】He gets up at 6 every morning.\n【易错】get 不加 -s；at 6 in the morning 混乱。\n【口诀/模板句】get up 起床三单 gets，at 6 every morning；习惯动作用现在，He gets up at 6。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["汉译英","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，He gets up at 6 every morning","【答案】He gets up at 6 every morning"],"pitfalls":["He gets up at 6 every morning"]},{"id":"ne125","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"汉译英","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"请翻译：“学习是一个永无止境的过程。”","options":null,"answer":"Learning is a never-ending process.","analysis":"【审题】题干：请翻译：“学习是一个永无止境的过程。”\n【语法点/词汇】Learning 动名词作主语；never-ending 永无止境的；process 过程。\n【步骤】① 学习 → Learning（动名词）。② 是 → is。③ 一个永无止境的过程 → a never-ending process。④ 组合：Learning is a never-ending process.\n【答案】Learning is a never-ending process.\n【易错】Learn is（动词不能作主语）；never ending 缺连字符。\n【口诀/模板句】Learning 动名词作主语，a never-ending process；学习是永无止境过程，Learning is process。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["汉译英","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】翻译，Learning is never-ending process","【答案】Learning is a never-ending process"],"pitfalls":["Learning is a never-ending process"]},{"id":"ne178","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"汉译英","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"翻译：“熟能生巧。”","options":null,"answer":"Practice makes perfect.","analysis":"【审题】题干：翻译：“熟能生巧。”\n【语法点/词汇】Practice makes perfect（固定谚语）。\n【步骤】① 熟能生巧 → Practice makes perfect。② Practice 练习。③ makes perfect 使完美。④ 意译谚语对应。\n【答案】Practice makes perfect.\n【易错】Skill makes perfect；Practice make（漏 -s）。\n【口诀/模板句】熟能生巧 Practice makes perfect，谚语固定译；Practice 三单 makes，perfect 形容词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["汉译英","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】谚语Practice makes perfect","【答案】Practice makes perfect"],"pitfalls":["Practice makes perfect"]},{"id":"ne211","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"汉译英","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":3,"difficultyLabel":"冲刺","stem":"翻译：“众人拾柴火焰高。”","options":null,"answer":"Many hands make light work.","analysis":"【审题】题干：翻译：“众人拾柴火焰高。”\n【语法点/词汇】Many hands make light work（人多力量大/众人拾柴火焰高）。\n【步骤】① 众人 → Many hands。② 拾柴火焰高 → make light work（使工作变轻松）。③ 意译谚语：Many hands make light work.\n【答案】Many hands make light work.\n【易错】Many people make fire high（直译）。\n【口诀/模板句】Many hands make light work，众人拾柴火焰高；hands 代人 light work 轻松活，谚语意译。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["汉译英","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】众人拾柴，Many hands make light work","【答案】Many hands make light work"],"pitfalls":["Many hands make light work"]},{"id":"ew01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"书面表达（约 80 词）：给同学写一封电子邮件，建议他如何提高英语阅读能力。（说明理由与具体做法）","answer":"范文见 sample","accept":["自评"],"sample":"Dear Li Hua,\n\nI am glad to give you some advice on improving your English reading.\n\nFirst, read a little every day instead of cramming. Second, choose","scorePoints":["格式：称呼+正文+落款","至少 2 条具体建议并有展开","时态与人称一致","约 80 词，无重大语法错误","有衔接词 First/Second/Finally"],"pitfalls":["邮件格式"],"tags":["写作","建议信"],"source":"highfreq","score":20,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】范文见 sample 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：给同学写一封电子邮件，建议他如何提高英语阅读能力。（说明理由与具体做法）。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语","analysis":"【审题】题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：给同学写一封电子邮件，建议他如何提高英语阅读能力。（说明理由与具体做法）\n【语法点/词汇】邮件格式：Dear…, / 正文 / Best wishes；建议句型：You should… / I suggest… / It's helpful to…；阅读策略：read every day, guess new words, take notes。\n【步骤】① 开头：Dear Li Hua, I'm glad to hear from you. ② 引出：You asked me how to improve reading. ③ 建议1：You should read English every day（每天读）。④ 建议2：Try to guess new words from context（猜生词）。⑤ 建议3：Take notes of useful phrases（记短语）。⑥ 结尾：I hope these tips help. Best wishes, Wang Ming。⑦ 约80词，格式完整。\n【答案】范文见 sample。范文：Dear Li Hua, I'm glad to hear from you. You asked me how to improve your English reading. Here are my suggestions. First, you should read English for 20 minutes every day. Second, try to guess new words from the context instead of looking them up. Third, take notes of useful phrases and review them. If you keep practicing, your reading will get better soon. Best wishes, Wang Ming.\n【易错】漏邮件格式；建议不具体；词数不足。\n【口诀/模板句】邮件开头 Dear，建议 You should/I suggest；具体做法三条走，结尾 Best wishes 收。","steps":["【秒懂考点】写作：建议邮件，结构要点","【第一步】开头Dear，表明目的提高阅读","【第二步】具体建议：每天读、猜词、多读不同话题","【第三步】结尾鼓励，落款","【范文】见参考答案"]},{"id":"ew02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的专业（移动互联应用技术）以及你为什么选择它。","answer":"范文见 sample","accept":["自评"],"sample":"My major is Mobile Internet Application Technology. I chose it because mobile apps are widely used in daily life and business. In this program, I lear","scorePoints":["专业名称准确","说明 2 点原因/课程","未来打算","条理清晰","词数约 80"],"pitfalls":["条理"],"tags":["写作","介绍"],"source":"highfreq","score":20,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】范文见 sample 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的专业（移动互联应用技术）以及你为什么选择它。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确","analysis":"【审题】题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的专业（移动互联应用技术）以及你为什么选择它。\n【语法点/词汇】专业名 Mobile Internet Application Technology；选择原因：interested in, good at, future job；结构：介绍专业 → 原因 → 打算。\n【步骤】① 开头：My major is Mobile Internet Application Technology. ② 介绍：It is about apps and mobile networks. ③ 原因1：I am interested in computers. ④ 原因2：I want to be a developer. ⑤ 结尾：I will study hard to achieve my dream. ⑥ 约80词，条理清楚。\n【答案】范文见 sample。范文：My major is Mobile Internet Application Technology. It is about mobile apps and networks. I chose it because I am interested in computers and the Internet. Also, this field has many job chances. In the future, I want to be a good app developer. I will study hard and practice more to achieve my dream.\n【易错】专业名译错；原因不充分；条理乱。\n【口诀/模板句】介绍专业 My major is，选择原因 because I am interested；job chances 工作机会，结尾 study hard 梦想。","steps":["【秒懂考点】写作：介绍专业，结构","【第一步】开头点明专业，移动互联应用技术","【第二步】原因：兴趣、就业前景、实用","【第三步】未来打算","【范文】见参考答案"]},{"id":"ew04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"书面表达（约 80 词）：以 “A useful app” 为题写短文，介绍一个对你学习有帮助的应用。","answer":"范文见 sample","accept":["自评"],"sample":"A Useful App\n\nThe app I use most is a flashcard tool. It helps me review English words and computer terms every day. I can set a study plan, and the a","scorePoints":["标题","介绍功能","个人体验/好处","结尾评价","词数约 80"],"pitfalls":["说明顺序"],"tags":["写作"],"source":"highfreq","score":20,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】范文见 sample 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：以 “A useful app” 为题写短文，介绍一个对你学习有帮助的应用。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/","analysis":"【审题】题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：以 “A useful app” 为题写短文，介绍一个对你学习有帮助的应用。\n【语法点/词汇】说明顺序：名称 → 功能 → 好处；useful 有用的；help me with…。\n【步骤】① 开头：A useful app. ② 名称：My favorite app is Ximalaya. ③ 功能：I can listen to English on it. ④ 好处：It helps me improve listening. ⑤ 结尾：It is really useful for my study. ⑥ 约80词，说明顺序清晰。\n【答案】范文见 sample。范文：A useful app. My favorite app is Ximalaya. I can listen to English stories and news on it every day. It helps me improve my listening and speaking. When I meet new words, I can also look them up quickly. The app is free and easy to use. It is really useful for my study, and I will keep using it.\n【易错】只写名称不写好处；条理乱。\n【口诀/模板句】说明顺序：名称功能好处；I can/heps me 讲作用；A useful app 题目，study useful 收尾。","steps":["【秒懂考点】写作：介绍有用的应用","【第一步】点明应用名称和功能","【第二步】为什么有用、怎么帮助学习","【第三步】推荐","【范文】见参考答案"]},{"id":"ex21","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的家乡。","answer":"范文见 sample","sample":"My hometown is a small city in the south. It is famous for its rivers and green hills. People there are friendly and life is not too fast. I like walk","scorePoints":["地点与特点","个人感受","结构完整","约 80 词"],"tags":["写作"],"source":"batch","score":20,"pitfalls":["条理"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】范文见 sample 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的家乡。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 范文见 sample。 【易错","analysis":"【审题】题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：介绍你的家乡。\n【语法点/词汇】结构：位置 → 人口/风景 → 特产/人 → 感情；be located in, be famous for, friendly。\n【步骤】① 开头：My hometown is Guilin. ② 位置：It is in the north of Guangxi. ③ 风景：It is famous for its beautiful mountains and rivers. ④ 人：People there are friendly. ⑤ 结尾：I love my hometown very much. ⑥ 约80词，条理清楚。\n【答案】范文见 sample。范文：My hometown is Guilin. It is in the north of Guangxi. It is famous for its beautiful mountains and rivers. Every year, many tourists come to visit it. The food there is also very delicious. People in my hometown are friendly and hard-working. I love my hometown very much, and I hope it will become better and better.\n【易错】只写地点不写风景；条理乱；漏感情。\n【口诀/模板句】介绍家乡：位置风景特产人；be famous for 有名，I love my hometown 感情。","steps":["【秒懂考点】写作：介绍家乡，结构","【第一步】地理位置","【第二步】特色：风景、食物、人","【第三步】感情","【范文】见参考答案"]},{"id":"enx37","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"write","typeLabel":"写作","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"书面表达（约 80 词）：My Plan for the Winter Vacation（寒假计划）","answer":"范文见 sample","sample":"My Plan for the Winter Vacation\n\nI have made a simple plan for the winter vacation. First, I will review my lessons for two hours every morning. Secon","scorePoints":["时间安排","至少 3 条计划","结构完整","约 80 词"],"tags":["写作"],"source":"batch","score":20,"pitfalls":["范文见sample"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】范文见 sample 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：My Plan for the Winter Vacation（寒假计划）。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/","analysis":"【审题】题干：书面表达（约 80 词）：My Plan for the Winter Vacation（寒假计划）。\n【语法点/词汇】计划句型：I will… / I am going to… / I plan to…；学习/锻炼/娱乐/家务。\n【步骤】① 开头：The winter vacation is coming. I have made a plan. ② 学习：I will finish my homework first. ③ 锻炼：I will do sports every day. ④ 家务：I will help my parents with housework. ⑤ 娱乐：I will read some books. ⑥ 结尾：I am sure I will have a meaningful vacation. ⑦ 约80词。\n【答案】范文见 sample。范文：My Plan for the Winter Vacation. The winter vacation is coming. I have made a plan. First, I will finish my homework carefully. Second, I will do sports every day to keep healthy. Third, I will help my parents with housework. I also plan to read some useful books. I am sure I will have a meaningful and happy vacation.\n【易错】只写一件事；无顺序词；词数不够。\n【口诀/模板句】计划 will/going to，顺序 First Second Third；学习锻炼家务读，meaningful vacation 收。","steps":["【秒懂考点】写作：寒假计划，时间顺序安排","【答案】范文见sample"]}]);
